"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56412054?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lenajava1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lenajava1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lenajava1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lenajava1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Lenajava1","id":56412054,"login":"Lenajava1","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2NDEyMDU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lenajava1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lenajava1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lenajava1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lenajava1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lenajava1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lenajava1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend/commits/a8f4deb82d26fb7c9d9fcce5c703dc68843701f9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T16:51:13Z","email":"56412054+Lenajava1@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Elena Mutykova"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T16:51:13Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(VCST-6100): send search-bar view_item_list only while the dropdown is open (#2529)\n\n## Description\nThe search-bar list impression (`view_item_list` with `item_list_id:\n\"search_bar\"`) is now sent only while the search dropdown is open with\nresults. Before, opening a results URL with `?q=` sent it on page load\nfor the URL keyword with the dropdown closed, reporting impressions the\nshopper never saw.\nRoot cause: the dropdown runs its search whenever the phrase is set,\nincluding when the header fills the phrase from the URL, and\n`searchAndShowDropdownResults()` sent the impression without checking\n`visible`.\n\nNo new props / events / slots · no new GraphQL fields · no new settings\n· no new dependencies.\n\n## Breaking changes\n- Component contract (props / events / slots): None.\n- GraphQL operations the client sends (fields, variables): None.\n- Settings (`$cfg` keys, theme settings): None.\n- Runtime behaviour: on a page opened with `?q=<phrase>`, analytics no\nlonger receive a `search_bar` `view_item_list` on load. They receive it\nwhen the shopper opens the dropdown and results are shown, as when\ntyping. The dropdown still prefetches results while hidden.\n\n## New dependencies\nNone.\n\n> **Note** — The guard sits on the impression only, so the hidden\nprefetch (results ready when the dropdown opens) is unchanged. Opening\nthe dropdown already re-runs the search through the existing `visible`\nwatcher, which now sends the impression. Reviewer focus: analytics\nevents for the header search.\n\n<details><summary>Auto-fix evidence (red → green)</summary>\n\n- Reproduction:\n`client-app/shared/layout/components/header/_internal/search-dropdown.test.ts`\n— with the phrase set and the dropdown hidden, no `search_bar`\n`view_item_list` is sent; after the dropdown opens, exactly one is sent.\nBoth cases fail on the base commit and pass with this fix.\n- Live on vcst-qa (2026-10-01, 1920 px, anonymous): `/search?q=tablet`\nwith the search box untouched, no `.search-dropdown` in the DOM, and\n`window.dataLayer` holds `view_item_list` with `item_list_id:\n\"search_bar\"`, `search_term: \"tablet\"`.\n- Local checks:\n  - vue-tsc --noEmit — pass\n  - lint — no new findings (existing findings in the file only)\n  - vitest (new) — 2 passed\n  - build — pass\n</details>\n\n## References\n### Jira-link:\nhttps://virtocommerce.atlassian.net/browse/VCST-6100\n### Artifact URL:\n\nhttps://vc3prerelease.blob.core.windows.net/packages/vc-theme-b2b-vue-2.59.0-pr-2529-bc4b-bc4b9a08.zip\n> 🤖 Opened by `/vc-fix:qa-fix`. **Human review required before merge —\ndo not auto-merge.**\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: Ivan Kalachikov <ivan.kalachikov@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"b6afee66441e0942a9005a6eb754df0b16366d18","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend/git/trees/b6afee66441e0942a9005a6eb754df0b16366d18"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend/git/commits/a8f4deb82d26fb7c9d9fcce5c703dc68843701f9","verification":{"payload":"tree b6afee66441e0942a9005a6eb754df0b16366d18\nparent 5ad8ba8da100dbe7a526e04a39eb1c291f4055cb\nauthor Elena Mutykova <56412054+Lenajava1@users.noreply.github.com> 1791219073 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791219073 +0100\n\nfix(VCST-6100): send search-bar view_item_list only while the dropdown is open (#2529)\n\n## Description\nThe search-bar list impression (`view_item_list` with `item_list_id:\n\"search_bar\"`) is now sent only while the search dropdown is open with\nresults. Before, opening a results URL with `?q=` sent it on page load\nfor the URL keyword with the dropdown closed, reporting impressions the\nshopper never saw.\nRoot cause: the dropdown runs its search whenever the phrase is set,\nincluding when the header fills the phrase from the URL, and\n`searchAndShowDropdownResults()` sent the impression without checking\n`visible`.\n\nNo new props / events / slots · no new GraphQL fields · no new settings\n· no new dependencies.\n\n## Breaking changes\n- Component contract (props / events / slots): None.\n- GraphQL operations the client sends (fields, variables): None.\n- Settings (`$cfg` keys, theme settings): None.\n- Runtime behaviour: on a page opened with `?q=<phrase>`, analytics no\nlonger receive a `search_bar` `view_item_list` on load. They receive it\nwhen the shopper opens the dropdown and results are shown, as when\ntyping. The dropdown still prefetches results while hidden.\n\n## New dependencies\nNone.\n\n> **Note** — The guard sits on the impression only, so the hidden\nprefetch (results ready when the dropdown opens) is unchanged. Opening\nthe dropdown already re-runs the search through the existing `visible`\nwatcher, which now sends the impression. Reviewer focus: analytics\nevents for the header search.\n\n<details><summary>Auto-fix evidence (red → green)</summary>\n\n- Reproduction:\n`client-app/shared/layout/components/header/_internal/search-dropdown.test.ts`\n— with the phrase set and the dropdown hidden, no `search_bar`\n`view_item_list` is sent; after the dropdown opens, exactly one is sent.\nBoth cases fail on the base commit and pass with this fix.\n- Live on vcst-qa (2026-10-01, 1920 px, anonymous): `/search?q=tablet`\nwith the search box untouched, no `.search-dropdown` in the DOM, and\n`window.dataLayer` holds `view_item_list` with `item_list_id:\n\"search_bar\"`, `search_term: \"tablet\"`.\n- Local checks:\n  - vue-tsc --noEmit — pass\n  - lint — no new findings (existing findings in the file only)\n  - vitest (new) — 2 passed\n  - build — pass\n</details>\n\n## References\n### Jira-link:\nhttps://virtocommerce.atlassian.net/browse/VCST-6100\n### Artifact URL:\n\nhttps://vc3prerelease.blob.core.windows.net/packages/vc-theme-b2b-vue-2.59.0-pr-2529-bc4b-bc4b9a08.zip\n> 🤖 Opened by `/vc-fix:qa-fix`. **Human review required before merge —\ndo not auto-merge.**\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: Ivan Kalachikov <ivan.kalachikov@gmail.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqw9WBCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA37EQACr7j806MAxtx50kJw+xRSJQ\nBaosuzzKTlGpf0RO2LVmlFHcb7VCBaoSORLSHx0VULxSegHex27LH2P0yZaN0wh6\nZ9dbqmQltHPj/wI+yXvpLFaeEmqs2HUhBkHK5vB3MHK5nGXkMJezB25F3dcbJcqm\nUR6WJ9rPcz8aP/VHopGOPhMebDMuwFAhp/fhLpYomX6LXGN8+ymQ+OT0T+qB9AZZ\nMFQNWdl7r5ub/mHenS1W4d4fcC4gWjDuRsNXS1VzX4olWdTyEdOZnaBQ0jOrOZbg\n6IVFC1oHHMH0e4+Nuq0dF39lG+x+DJ2NVT3wFqCyUCJ9aheVC3b45Y8spHWBxBqY\n7E5705zVzNzfbG20kRfSZGMBGLRKlgyh5hG7Vsa8I6q/Nf/ztW2U/vQYjhJMXLWs\n9ToMUwnLZShfLNwlVx1wIgx1qc3QLY7ajLZKPL1bCmT2EoXqMfIJjnVdDBITeg1S\nXj2Gx4TkOXMAiiOXGZybbkhY