em`\ndefault).\n> \n> The enlarged hit area is applied only when the control sits in its own\n**`label`** (`label > &__indicator`); it is **skipped inside interactive\nparents** (e.g. **`VcMenuItem`**) so pseudo-element overhang does not\nsteal clicks from adjacent items. Size is overridable via\n**`--vc-checkbox-hit-area-size`** and\n**`--vc-radio-button-hit-area-size`**. Storybook gains **CustomHitArea**\nstories documenting this behavior.\n> \n> <sup>Reviewed by [Cursor Bugbot](https://cursor.com/bugbot) for commit\ne4e0915d6980f197dcb365f256a407f5139f84e5. Bugbot is set up for automated\ncode reviews on this repo. Configure\n[here](https://www.cursor.com/dashboard/bugbot).</sup>\n<!-- /CURSOR_SUMMARY -->","tree":{"sha":"0f7a18ad27b4e4037617908c95de7befb587e8c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend/git/trees/0f7a18ad27b4e4037617908c95de7befb587e8c4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend/git/commits/483b2712ad64695e8fa290e97c85dea8719a76ed","verification":{"payload":"tree 0f7a18ad27b4e4037617908c95de7befb587e8c4\nparent d5c6500729f36dd3bb13039b18cfd9cddf276c3e\nauthor Maiia Diachkovskaia <mayapavlovna@gmail.com> 1790842305 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790842305 +0300\n\nfix(VCST-5484): give VcCheckbox and VcRadioButton a 24x24 pointer target (#2516)\n\n## Description\n\n## References\n### Jira-link:\n<!-- Put link to your task in Jira here -->\nhttps://virtocommerce.atlassian.net/browse/VCST-5484\n### Artifact URL:\n\nhttps://vc3prerelease.blob.core.windows.net/packages/vc-theme-b2b-vue-2.59.0-pr-2516-e4e0-e4e0915d.zip\n\n<!-- CURSOR_SUMMARY -->\n---\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> **Low Risk**\n> Scoped presentation-layer CSS for touch targets with an explicit\nexclusion path for menu items; no logic or data-handling changes.\n> \n> **Overview**\n> Adds a shared **`hit-area` SCSS mixin** and uses it on\n**`VcCheckbox`** and **`VcRadioButton`** so the visual indicator gets an\ninvisible, layout-neutral pointer tar