ontend/commits/a67c92a60c28fe6bc1ded95610ac394652f69921/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T09:32:38Z","email":"56427313+AndrewEhlo@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Andrew"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T09:32:38Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"VCST-5414: Use actions and workflows from VirtoCommerce/.github v3.1000.1 (#2517)\n\nThe actions moved from `vc-github-actions` to `VirtoCommerce/.github`\n(VCST-5414). `vc-github-actions` is frozen: its `@master` refs keep\nworking but no longer get updates.\n\n- Switches every `uses: VirtoCommerce/vc-github-actions/<action>@…` to\n`VirtoCommerce/.github/actions/<action>@v3.1000.1`.\n- Moves reusable workflows (`VirtoCommerce/.github/.github/workflows/*`)\nto `@v3.1000.1` where they exist in that release.\n- Nothing else in the workflows changes: only `uses:` lines are edited.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\n<!-- CURSOR_SUMMARY -->\n---\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> **Medium Risk**\n> Touches release, cloud deploy, and theme CI paths; behavior should be\nequivalent but depends on parity between the old vc-github-actions\n@master and the new pinned release.\n> \n> **Overview**\n> Migrates CI/CD workflows off the frozen\n**`VirtoCommerce/vc-github-actions`** repo (`@master`) to\n**`VirtoCommerce/.github`** at **`v3.1000.1`**.\n> \n> Composite actions (versioning, changelog, blob publish, deploy\nhelpers, Jira helpers, etc.) now use\n`VirtoCommerce/.github/actions/<name>@v3.1000.1`. Reusable workflows\n**`release.yml`** and **`pytest-tests.yml`** are bumped from older\n`@v3.800.x` tags to **`@v3.1000.1`**. Affected files:\n`deploy-cloud.yml`, `release.yml`, `storybook-ci.yml`, `theme-ci.yml`,\nand `theme-release-hotfix.yml` — **only `uses:` references change**;\nstep inputs and job logic are unchanged. Jira upload actions still point\nat separate `VirtoCommerce/jira-*` repos.\n> \n> <sup>Reviewed by [Cursor Bugbot](https://cursor.com/bugbot) for commit\na7d739825fbded5f8566872b041db30171a3dc2d. Bugbot is set up for automated\ncode reviews on this repo. Configure\n[here](https://www.cursor.com/dashboard/bugbot).</sup>\n<!-- /CURSOR_SUMMARY -->\nArtifact URL:\n\nhttps://vc3prerelease.blob.core.windows.net/packages/vc-theme-b2b-vue-2.59.0-pr-2517-a7d7-a7d73982.zip\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"879e0c747a2569d5ffc18648467307d7c26f889e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend/git/trees/879e0c747a2569d5ffc18648467307d7c26f889e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend/git/commits/a67c92a60c28fe6bc1ded95610ac394652f69921","verification":{"payload":"tree 879e0c747a2569d5ffc18648467307d7c26f889e\nparent d90289590f9a0162527eae354b48589e08f0f6be\nauthor Andrew <56427313+AndrewEhlo@users.noreply.github.com> 1790674358 +0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790674358 +0500\n\nVCST-5414: Use actions and workflows from VirtoCommerce/.github v3.1000.1 (#2517)\n\nThe actions moved from `vc-github-actions` to `VirtoCommerce/.github`\n(VCST-5414). `vc-github-actions` is frozen: its `@master` refs keep\nworking but no longer get updates.\n\n- Switches every `uses: VirtoCommerce/vc-github-actions/<action>@…` to\n`VirtoCommerce/.github/actions/<action>@v3.1000.1`.\n- Moves reusable workflows (`VirtoCommerce/.github/.github/workflows/*`)\nto `@v3.1000.1` where they exist in that release.\n- Nothing else in the workflows changes: only `uses:` lines are edited.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\n<!-- CURSOR_SUMMARY -->\n---\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> **Medium Risk**\n> Touches release, cloud deploy, and theme CI paths; behavior should be\nequivalent but depends on parity between the old vc-github-actions\n@master and the new pinned release.\n> \n> **Overview**\n> Migrates CI/CD workflows off the frozen\n**`VirtoCommerce/vc-github-actions`** repo (`@master`) to\n**`VirtoCommerce/.github`** at **`v3.1000.1`**.\n> \n> Composite actions (versioning, changelog, blob publish, deploy\nhelpers, Jira helpers, etc.) now use\n`VirtoCommerce/.github/actions/<name>@v3.1000.1`. Reusable workflows\n**`release.yml`** and **`pytest-tests.yml`** are bumped from older\n`@v3.800.x` tags to **`@v3.1000.1`**. Affected files:\n`deploy-cloud.yml`, `release.yml`, `storybook-ci.yml`, `theme-ci.yml`,\nand `theme-release-hotfix.yml` — **only `uses:` references change**;\nstep inputs and job logic are unchanged. Jira upload actions still point\nat separate `VirtoCommerce/jira-*` repos.\n> \n> <sup>Reviewed by [Cursor Bugbot](https://cursor.com/bugbot) for commit\na7d739825fbded5f8566872b041db30171a3dc2d. Bugbot is set up for automated\ncode reviews on this repo. Configure\n[here](https://www.cursor.com/dashboard/bugbot).</sup>\n<!-- /CURSOR_SUMMARY -->\nArtifact URL:\n\nhttps://vc3prerelease.blob.core.windows.net/packages/vc-theme-b2b-vue-2.59.0-pr-2517-a7d7-a7d73982.zip\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqu4W2CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAMW0QAJNMtKXo7hxO9L1xjnuUdZZn\ncZM9AB2vEkpIDnu9cPuSZiwDIOHelGbX/+sbZc+a1GbgczSVTDkLHfNn4ub/2zF+\nsWECa4oMeEJuJYawE5IxIy9HbVSpSRdkEGAnOthhqzzhnZzV9QuGIDgxaQFYNpKj\neoUBwos0FrBJVU57f3hwTrJZ2LR5j5t6RHUZCHpbrXC6xQ3SSNhBs/pDLjcJMcWI\nz2qfef18n/cGz3O9+2jwYz++v6jY+Co9PNgZIW23qnJiHHq3TLD8sOgbOLjT0auh\n6V8Yi/gqnP65UIlpRny5DXpMsbnaFTwN91J14YyP62kKHe7vFyrc4gbkDNxi1DUq\nTE62/Xf3CzK8NH3jHAMPjZX0Rt1zDH28JM5K4m+SAABp/xZTInbUcC4Oo+x8OWuN\nId+17y/atksaNoy+6AQzSHCMGSbwT3AVTp3Pvf1R/0iMLzDF26R4KKJuxbE0vMRZ\ntrVGJDAY+QOLYz6Dc7GofPcFt/WKZDkpNc2BZmqDERODCDbnMOY4Qq+o2i61cmnK\n7ISR3sLWgpeZG21eqN3Gvx64jIfRHCcbGMlo7QU/i9C1iS2l2VQDHihVWSzy1BqK\n94JHUQGAR7PCOXkIUUCEeIP4JTiA9za5barUY/HKVTEtUy5dxUAZNJHikqMNDKpl\nZGDZGsiwlwaZ4+P1Co87\n=WZFM\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-29T09:32:39Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.c