to your task in Jira here -->\nhttps://virtocommerce.atlassian.net/browse/VCST-5911\n### Artifact URL:\n\nhttps://vc3prerelease.blob.core.windows.net/packages/vc-theme-b2b-vue-2.58.0-pr-2479-cf20-cf20b0ad.zip\n\n<!-- CURSOR_SUMMARY -->\n---\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> **Low Risk**\n> Scoped UI/accessibility styling and loyalty copy with tests; no auth,\nAPI, or payment changes.\n> \n> **Overview**\n> Slotless **`VcBadge`** instances now get a **`vc-badge--dot`**\nmodifier; **solid** status dots use **700-shade** fill/border (plus\nmatching **dark theme** overrides) so color-only indicators meet **WCAG\n1.4.11** **3:1** contrast. Storybook adds a **`DotColors`** story\ndocumenting that behavior.\n> \n> Loyalty missions with **`daysRemaining: null`** now show a\n**`no_deadline`** label (new i18n across locales) instead of a lone dot.\nShared **`MissionDateBadge`** replaces duplicated dot+label markup on\nmission cards and order/SKU modals. **`useMissionCard`** date-label\nlogic is covered by new **Vitest** cases.\n> \n> <sup>Reviewed by [Cursor Bugbot](https://cursor.com/bugbot) for commit\ncf20b0ada6b203bfc606f2fd33129a68f2756e32. Bugbot is set up for automated\ncode reviews on this repo. Configure\n[here](https://www.cursor.com/dashboard/bugbot).</sup>\n<!-- /CURSOR_SUMMARY -->\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Elena Mutykova <56412054+Lenajava1@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"9bb22df48c5c223f7b18a169b3f74b1045a8fc42","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend/git/trees/9bb22df48c5c223f7b18a169b3f74b1045a8fc42"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend/git/commits/308ff1d700f9bcfae6234ae356bb12740ee467f6","verification":{"payload":"tree 9bb22df48c5c223f7b18a169b3f74b1045a8fc42\nparent d10e4fd680cb937c359121fe57bbeb146c8de8bb\nauthor Maiia Diachkovskaia <mayapavlovna@gmail.com> 1789564511 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789564511 +0300\n\nfix(VCST-5911): meet 3:1 on mission status dots and label open-ended missions (#2479)\n\n## Description\n\n## References\n### Jira-link:\n<!-- Put link to your task in Jira here -->\nhttps://virtocommerce.atlassian.net/browse/VCST-5911\n### Artifact URL:\n\nhttps://vc3prerelease.blob.core.windows.net/packages/vc-theme-b2b-vue-2.58.0-pr-2479-cf20-cf20b0ad.zip\n\n<!-- CURSOR_SUMMARY -->\n---\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> **Low Risk**\n> Scoped UI/accessibility styling and loyalty copy with tests; no auth,\nAPI, or payment changes.\n> \n> **Overview**\n> Slotless **`VcBadge`** instances now get a **`vc-badge--dot`**\nmodifier; **solid** status dots use **700-shade** fill/border (plus\nmatching **dark theme** overrides) so color-only indicators meet **WCAG\n1.4.11** **3:1** contrast. Storybook adds a **`DotColors`** story\ndocumenting that behavior.\n> \n> Loyalty missions with **`daysRemaining: null`** now show a\n**`no_deadline`** label (new i18n across locales) instead of a lone dot.\nShared **`MissionDateBadge`** replaces duplicated dot+label markup on\nmission cards and order/SKU modals. **`useMissionCard`** date-label\nlogic is covered by new **Vitest** cases.\n> \n> <sup>Reviewed by [Cursor Bugbot](https://cursor.com/bugbot) for commit\ncf20b0ada6b203bfc606f2fd33129a68f2756e32. Bugbot is set up for automated\ncode reviews on this repo. Configure\n[here](https://www.cursor.com/dashboard/bugbot).</sup>\n<!-- /CURSOR_SUMMARY -->\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Elena Mutykova <56412054+Lenajava1@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqqpZfCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAyp4QABUvVLpSh0zXZOkTi740SFn4\nI4PHY8lCpBNo7ALHu+Gff102c8MdPuNEyuIzJ0kd/7ibG4xviIyR2NM5grzJHlka\n5Id3d9B6vgaQrVEjsoXEwvnzs2Xel1bplwHoZNqfJwC7+/4dgGb6buRkG2nVkqCL\ndjsQ7wa7tNmS92nHIeMtTA81X4UiDoDWfa7qRebUccmEkJx5xiNOOYR8ACNhyOXh\nuGdQqTtEZQjA6QvHOZkzfe0Eh9ZrNGYBdYTNgfAON0r9L8zw2T3wjlmEQVCkHeC6\nLCE6yboM61TTMLVAX5f/UAUNx3TUZEmWsXJv+HJf6xpuzwN5QY6y5kQgr33AQy5R\n9f0GXfSp4xqXGxJVdseJwwcaLgoVg7aoWdAupkdB4bn1s+QrzAhiBpQHGP3nySKB\ndmdCQTaAJLg2E00YxmrTlw