tive-*`\noverrides, and loading a dark override that defaults the active fill to\n**`primary-700`** instead of the light pairing that inverted poorly.\n> \n> Also corrects ellipsis detection from `item === 0` to **`!item`** so\n`NaN` ellipsis placeholders get the ellipsis class, drops hard-coded\nactive/ellipsis Tailwind colors in favor of the variables, and adds a\nStorybook example for custom active-page colors.\n> \n> <sup>Reviewed by [Cursor Bugbot](https://cursor.com/bugbot) for commit\ne8f6a9d75acef55da08299d35e6eedcc8e1d1e85. Bugbot is set up for automated\ncode reviews on this repo. Configure\n[here](https://www.cursor.com/dashboard/bugbot).</sup>\n<!-- /CURSOR_SUMMARY -->\n\nCo-authored-by: Elena Mutykova <56412054+Lenajava1@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"6453230da8005e1e4730200abfd2c8abcff01c86","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend/git/trees/6453230da8005e1e4730200abfd2c8abcff01c86"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend/git/commits/d10e4fd680cb937c359121fe57bbeb146c8de8bb","verification":{"payload":"tree 6453230da8005e1e4730200abfd2c8abcff01c86\nparent b35fa35f5f3a4353e1184c7db20121aafb53c032\nauthor Maiia Diachkovskaia <mayapavlovna@gmail.com> 1789564473 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789564473 +0300\n\nfix(VCST-5838): lighten active pagination page fill in dark mode (#2478)\n\n## Description\n\n## References\n### Jira-link:\n<!-- Put link to your task in Jira here -->\nhttps://virtocommerce.atlassian.net/browse/VCST-5838\n### Artifact URL:\n\nhttps://vc3prerelease.blob.core.windows.net/packages/vc-theme-b2b-vue-2.58.0-pr-2478-e8f6-e8f6a9d7.zip\n\n<!-- CURSOR_SUMMARY -->\n---\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> **Low Risk**\n> Scoped pagination styling and a small template class fix; no auth,\ndata, or API behavior changes.\n> \n> **Overview**\n> Fixes **dark-mode contrast** on the active page chip in `VcPagination`\nby wiring active fill/text through CSS variables (`--page-active-bg`,\n`--page-active-text`) with optional `--vc-pagination-page-active-*`\noverrides, and loading a dark override that defaults the active fill to\n**`primary-700`** instead of the light pairing that inverted poorly.\n> \n> Also corrects ellipsis detection from `item === 0` to **`!item`** so\n`NaN` ellipsis placeholders get the ellipsis class, drops hard-coded\nactive/ellipsis Tailwind colors in favor of the variables, and adds a\nStorybook example for custom active-page colors.\n> \n> <sup>Reviewed by [Cursor Bugbot](https://cursor.com/bugbot) for commit\ne8f6a9d75acef55da08299d35e6eedcc8e1d1e85. Bugbot is set up for automated\ncode reviews on this repo. Configure\n[here](https://www.cursor.com/dashboard/bugbot).</sup>\n<!-- /CURSOR_SUMMARY -->\n\nCo-authored-by: Elena Mutykova <56412054+Lenajava1@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqqpY5CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAhfwQACF38ly47WemMziVFjUZYLGW\n4b1Mulo0mtFwimQnMt/TZ1JL/K3MzDHWA+bJQQA980FlOi3Q5SdSQU+sTbTqg+mc\nVqOG6irMJFLDBELjov5pr2k+1z8gkb4CPsEQYCDBOXnExVBgXkxWjTMMy+pbrn/+\nBV2PTX1R7gG9R2udoQE00iq7J2ovl7Wii9s+nZxsRem3tQgybAeb08FiN4+o/CpD\nIoz35RbUyAMxITzJcu9UXmFIiBL10Ewygn3bVDm1W9luedWWA87RbQUVkYCu7GJD\ndByk/EHF8htYjrmRtFX1pbJflvlDKFZMjSrvIhJL7IbpDX8FP0NaJ+dMROx1oOXi\nRp+qamqCQFg9w036qkIvEaIftdCrK80mZeCpT74SedJSVvxXdkv3NqN/bg8M4UuA\nc1MV1x7hrZ09Ck87sEjgNOk2w1gcqXiPvt3jtbirI5LuDSZHVGNMw6Hvmshm9a5Q\n+GTxEGZe/jLw1S/l8MKgazNWj6jSSverpferisGb0wmjUlCYLbg0M8fis1W4UaQb\nM6vQtf+QnOLCP0/+asfpCRl31xoJfvzoyIwHD/3TgkyyJh6KmvkB5NVmvFx4OzOi\nAMVtPK9SYIpIltRZtxMMEMrjA5ISdPbyoiqM0mT5L/1I6ZGsHxwGfpjY0lfR16Dz\n6U0CnCudhr3F54o/QhKF\n=llQx\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-16T13:14:33Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/follow