e shared **`VcTabSwitch`** instead of\nbespoke `<button>` tabs, dropping duplicate tab/active/hover styles and\noverriding **`--vc-tab-switch-hover-color`** so hover text meets WCAG\nAA. The “All” chip binds a **boolean** baseline value so rule names like\n`__all__` can’t collide with the sentinel that used to break selection.\n> \n> **`VcTabSwitch`** exposes selected state on the visible control via\n**`aria-pressed`** (removed from the hidden radio), fixing announcements\nfor chip-style usage.\n> \n> **Tests:** new coverage for **`SalesRepRuleChips`** and\n**`VcTabSwitch`** selection semantics; orders/documents integration\ntests stub **`VcTabSwitch`** as `label > button` and click the inner\nbutton.\n> \n> <sup>Reviewed by [Cursor Bugbot](https://cursor.com/bugbot) for commit\n62e635c6446110f53431d819a23e2fe83fbbff89. Bugbot is set up for automated\ncode reviews on this repo. Configure\n[here](https://www.cursor.com/dashboard/bugbot).</sup>\n<!-- /CURSOR_SUMMARY -->\n\nCo-authored-by: Aleksandra-Mitricheva <54628043+Aleksandra-Mitricheva@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"e60c23c847d249a7709dd8586254b843eb0d699e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend/git/trees/e60c23c847d249a7709dd8586254b843eb0d699e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend/git/commits/916b986b88bd863b5afcb14158645b75e5478521","verification":{"payload":"tree e60c23c847d249a7709dd8586254b843eb0d699e\nparent 3efe8d4fa78dfaa532a8ff919d9bb03b1a1471cf\nauthor Maiia Diachkovskaia <mayapavlovna@gmail.com> 1789478227 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789478227 +0300\n\nrefactor(VCST-5890): move sales-rep rule chips onto VcTabSwitch (#2474)\n\n## Description\n<img width=\"1568\" height=\"673\" alt=\"screenshot-1788937429668-4\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2623504c-a46d-4230-b9a1-f5a746623be4\"\n/>\n<img width=\"1567\" height=\"673\" alt=\"screenshot-1788937455495-5\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/273ef45a-8fab-431a-9868-2a7065f3f8f4\"\n/>\n\n## References\n### Jira-link:\n<!-- Put link to your task in Jira here -->\nhttps://virtocommerce.atlassian.net/browse/VCST-5890\n### Artifact URL:\n\nhttps://vc3prerelease.blob.core.windows.net/packages/vc-theme-b2b-vue-2.58.0-pr-2474-62e6-62e635c6.zip\n\n<!-- CURSOR_SUMMARY -->\n---\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> **Medium Risk**\n> Touches a shared UI primitive and sales-rep filtering UX; changes are\nmostly presentational and accessibility-focused with broad test\ncoverage, but any `VcTabSwitch` consumer now gets toggle semantics on\nthe button.\n> \n> **Overview**\n> **Sales-rep filter chips** now use shared **`VcTabSwitch`** instead of\nbespoke `<button>` tabs, dropping duplicate tab/active/hover styles and\noverriding **`--vc-tab-switch-hover-color`** so hover text meets WCAG\nAA. The “All” chip binds a **boolean** baseline value so rule names like\n`__all__` can’t collide with the sentinel that used to break selection.\n> \n> **`VcTabSwitch`** exposes selected state on the visible control via\n**`aria-pressed`** (removed from the hidden radio), fixing announcements\nfor chip-style usage.\n> \n> **Tests:** new coverage for **`SalesRepRuleChips`** and\n**`VcTabSwitch`** selection semantics; orders/documents integration\ntests stub **`VcTabSwitch`** as `label > button` and click the inner\nbutton.\n> \n> <sup>Reviewed by [Cursor Bugbot](https://cursor.com/bugbot) for commit\n62e635c6446110f53431d819a23e2fe83fbbff89. Bugbot is set up for automated\ncode reviews on this repo. Configure\n[here](https://www.cursor.com/dashboard/bugbot).</sup>\n<!-- /CURSOR_SUMMARY -->\n\nCo-authored-by: Aleksandra-Mitricheva <54628043+Aleksandra-Mitricheva@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqqUVTCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAYT0QAAYINVXjvupYmy7EHFQY/Nqu\nKM6u/nrNrCDrJGS+ycRZnva+3A89FOcrEOLzKNSfTRMYq7AXkDiT+oKml6kjD9UX\nV29gz4Rncx4nQZYSc8JzZiwJVXS2MEKd8x6DmDibJ1bORzugG2iFcEEQRZKxrmZl\nlUhrK6t98Qk0UDU