398a331b650c345b33bc6736e4fa7c477da"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16372194?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/goldenmaya","id":16372194,"login":"goldenmaya","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MzcyMTk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend/commits/c4046f560a35fe0b9f260f2ef353129792b45c98/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T07:21:29Z","email":"mayapavlovna@gmail.com","name":"Maiia Diachkovskaia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T07:21:29Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(VCST-5848): stop the checkbox and radio input overlay swallowing label clicks (#2466)\n\n## Description\n\n## References\n### Jira-link:\n<!-- Put link to your task in Jira here -->\nhttps://virtocommerce.atlassian.net/browse/VCST-5848\n### Artifact URL:\n\nhttps://vc3prerelease.blob.core.windows.net/packages/vc-theme-b2b-vue-2.57.0-pr-2466-4cb5-4cb5b374.zip\n\n<!-- CURSOR_SUMMARY -->\n---\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> **Medium Risk**\n> Click and selection behavior changes across shared form controls and\ntable row radios; regressions could affect toggling, double-firing\nhandlers, or disabled state, though the duplicate-click guard is\nnarrowly scoped.\n> \n> **Overview**\n> **VcCheckbox** and **VcRadioButton** no longer stretch the native\ninput over the whole label. The input is **screen-reader-only**\n(`sr-only`), and the label’s click-capture pseudo-layer is removed so\n**links, buttons, and other real controls in the label slot get their\nown clicks** instead of always toggling the control.\n> \n> Both components add **`onContainerClick`** on the label/container to\n**suppress the duplicate click** the browser forwards from label\nactivation to the input, while still allowing keyboard use, direct input\nclicks, and clicks on slot content. **Disabled** controls **stop\npropagation** on the container so nothing leaks through, matching the\nold overlay behavior.\n> \n> Storybook adds **LabelWithInteractiveContent** and (for checkbox)\n**Tooltip** stories documenting the expected patterns. **VcTable** only\nupdates an inline comment about single-select row radios and the new\nclick semantics.\n> \n> <sup>Reviewed by [Cursor Bugbot](https://cursor.com/bugbot) for commit\n4cb5b3744472437ef330a69881dc039771375eb1. Bugbot is set up for automated\ncode reviews on this repo. Configure\n[here](https://www.cursor.com/dashboard/bugbot).</sup>\n<!-- /CURSOR_SUMMARY -->\n\nCo-authored-by: Basil Kotov <basilkot@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Elena Kutasina <kutasina.elena@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"3567350e4033eb584922e165fc0a35a3d32df0d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend/git/trees/3567350e4033eb584922e165fc0a35a3d32df0d4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend/git/commits/c4046f560a35fe0b9f260f2ef353129792b45c98","verification":{"payload":"tree 3567350e4033eb584922e165fc0a35a3d32df0d4\nparent 71d20ea97b807579027fe5dbff31118f038398f5\nauthor Maiia Diachkovskaia <mayapavlovna@gmail.com> 1788506489 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788506489 +0300\n\nfix(VCST-5848): stop the checkbox and radio input overlay swallowing label clicks (#2466)\n\n## Description\n\n## References\n### Jira-link:\n<!-- Put link to your task in Jira here -->\nhttps://virtocommerce.atlassian.net/browse/VCST-5848\n### Artifact URL:\n\nhttps://vc3prerelease.blob.core.windows.net/packages/vc-theme-b2b-vue-2.57.0-pr-2466-4cb5-4cb5b374.zip\n\n<!-- CURSOR_SUMMARY -->\n---\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> **Medium Risk**\n> Click and selection behavior changes across shared form controls and\ntable row radios; regressions could affect toggling, double-firing\nhandlers, or disabled state, though the duplicate-click guard is\nnarrowly scoped.\n> \n> **Overview**\n> **VcCheckbox** and **VcRadioButton** no longer stretch the native\ninput over the whole label. The input is **screen-reader-only**\n(`sr-only`), and the label’s click-capture pseudo-layer is removed so\n**links, buttons, and other real controls in the label slot get their\nown clicks** instead of always toggling the control.\n> \n> Both components add **`onContainerClick`** on the label/container to\n**suppress the duplicate click** the browser forwards from label\nactivation to the input, while still allowing keyboard use, direct input\nclicks, and clicks on slot content. **Disabled** controls **stop\npropagation** on the container so nothing leaks through, matching the\nold overlay behavior.\n> \n> Storybook adds **LabelWithInteractiveContent** and (for checkbox)\n**Tooltip** stories documenting the expected patterns. **VcTable** only\nupdates an inline comment about single-select row radios and the new\nclick semantics.\n> \n> <sup>Reviewed by [Cursor Bugbot](https://cursor.com/bugbot) for commit\n4cb5b3744472437ef330a69881dc039771375eb1. Bugbot is set up for automated\ncode reviews on this repo. Configure\n[here](https://www.cursor.com/dashboard/bugbot).</sup>\n<!-- /CURSOR_SUMMARY -->\n\nCo-authored-by: Basil Kotov <basilkot@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Elena Kutasina <kutasina.elena@gmail.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqmnF5CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAO