/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yuskithedeveloper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yuskithedeveloper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yuskithedeveloper/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yuskithedeveloper","id":126832118,"login":"yuskithedeveloper","node_id":"U_kgDOB49N9g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yuskithedeveloper/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yuskithedeveloper/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yuskithedeveloper/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yuskithedeveloper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yuskithedeveloper/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yuskithedeveloper","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend/commits/21cde9a1bed624cd806c14c0143bb952f99c84fb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-26T14:36:04Z","email":"126832118+yuskithedeveloper@users.noreply.github.com","name":"yuskithedeveloper"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-26T14:36:04Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(VCST-5730): sales rep hub documents library (#2439)\n\n## Description\n\nAdds the storefront **Document Library** to the Sales Rep Hub: a\ndashboard widget of the latest documents plus a full\n**`/company/documents`** browse page (category tabs with counts, name\nsearch, a card grid, an inline details panel, and open / download).\nSales Reps find and share approved sales materials without leaving the\nHub. The whole surface is gated by the new `sales-rep-documents:read`\npermission.\n\nRequires the backend PR (new `salesRepDocuments` / `salesRepDocument` /\n`salesRepDocumentCategories` queries):\nhttps://github.com/VirtoCommerce/vc-module-sales-rep/pull/12\n\n## Behaviour\n\n- **Dashboard widget** (`sales-rep-documents.vue`): the top documents,\n**pinned-first then newest**, each a row with file-type icon, name, `PDF\n· 96 pages · Published <date>` meta, and an Open button; a \"Browse all\n→\" link to the page. Row cap is a widget setting (default 5). Registered\nonly when the user has `sales-rep-documents:read`, and — because the\nlayout mounts only visible blocks — a **hidden widget issues no document\nrequest**.\n\n- **Browse page** (`documents.vue`): a **featured document panel** at\nthe top (the pinned document, else the newest, with a \"Latest\npublication\" badge), then **category tabs** whose counts are\nkeyword-aware (empty categories drop out and the \"All\" count reflects\nthe filter), then a **name search**, then a responsive **card grid**\n(preview image when available, else a large file-type icon + type\nbadge). Selecting a card opens an **inline details panel** (no separate\nroute), deep-linked via `?doc=`.\n\n- **Open / Download never expose the raw asset URL**: both go through an\nauthenticated fetch (bearer token) → Blob → object URL, so `__customer`\nsales-rep tokens work against the authorized endpoint. Open views in a\nnew tab; Download saves under the real file name (display name is\nUI-only).\n\n- **Permission-gated everywhere**: the widget, the page route (guard =\nSales Rep access **and** `sales-rep-documents:read`), and the Hub nav\nlink are all hidden without the permission.\n\n- **Reuse**: the `VcFile` content-type icon set and `downloadFile`\nhelper; the shared `SalesRepRuleChips` tabs, extended with an optional\nper-chip `count` (existing consumers unchanged).\n\n- **i18n**: new `sales_rep.documents.*` keys in all 13 locales.\n\n## Screenshots\n<img width=\"1506\" height=\"907\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/590e64b8-acdf-4baa-840b-d2ac34ea6891\"\n/>\n<img width=\"1436\" height=\"817\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/220e5f07-cf6e-43f5-b06d-306d3f7db925\"\n/>\n\n\n## References\n### Jira-link:\nhttps://virtocommerce.atlassian.net/browse/VCST-5730\n### Artifact URL:\n\nhttps://vc3prerelease.blob.core.windows.net/packages/vc-theme-b2b-vue-2.57.0-pr-2439-b59f-b59f7bc8.zip\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Aleksandra-Mitricheva <54628043+Aleksandra-Mitricheva@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"b2622c2ea4f812131831781282a2f895728d7fc0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend/git/trees/b2622c2ea4f812131831781282a2f895728d7fc0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend/git/commits/21cde9a1bed624cd806c14c0143bb952f99c84fb","verification":{"payload":"tree b2622c2ea4f812131831781282a2f895728d7fc0\nparent 17c99c7c8df935670bc4fd4fead0c7078ae0f7ec\nauthor yuskithedeveloper <126832118+yuskithedeveloper@users.noreply.github.com> 1787754964 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787754964 -0500\n\nfeat(VCST-5730): sales rep hub documents library (#2439)\n\n## Description\n\nAdds the storefront **Document Library** to the Sales Rep Hub: a\ndashboard widget of the latest documents plus a full\n**`/company/documents`** browse page (category tabs with counts, name\nsearch, a card grid, an inline details panel, and open / download).\nSales Reps find and share approved sales materials without leaving the\nHub. The whole surface is gated by the new `sales-rep-documents:read`\npermission.\n\nRequires the backend PR (new `salesRepDocuments` / `salesRepDocument` /\n`salesRepDocumentCategories` queries):\nhttps://github.com/VirtoCommerce/vc-module-sales-rep/pull/12\n\n## Behaviour\n\n- **Dashboard widget** (`sales-rep-documents.vue`): the top documents,\n**pinned-first then newest**, each a row with file-type icon, name, `PDF\n· 96 pages · Published <date>` meta, and an Open button; a \"Browse all\n→\" link to the page. Row cap is a widget setting (default 5). Registered\nonly when the user has `sales-rep-documents:read`, and — because the\nlayout mounts only visible blocks — a **hidden widget issues no document\nrequest**.\n\n- **Browse page** (`documents.vue`): a **featured document panel** at\nthe top (the pinned document, else the newest, with a \"Latest\npublication\" badge), then **category tabs** whose counts are\nkeyword-aware (empty categories drop out and the \"All\" count reflects\nthe filter), then a **name search**, then a responsive **card grid**\n(preview image when available, else a large file-type icon + type\nbadge). Selecting a card opens an **inline details panel** (no separate\nroute), deep-linked via `?doc=`.\n\n- **Open / Download never expose the raw asset URL**: both go through an\nauthenticated fetch (bearer token) → Blob → object URL, so `__customer`\nsales-rep tokens work against the authorized endpoint. Open views in a\nnew tab; Download saves under the real file name (display name is\nUI-only).\n\n- **Permission-gated everywhere**: the widget, the page route (guard =\nSales Rep access **and** `sales-rep-documents:read`), and the Hub nav\nlink are all hidden without the permission.\n\n- **Reuse**: the `VcFile` content-type icon set and `downloadFile`\nhelper; the shared `SalesRepRuleChips` tabs, extended with an optional\nper-chip `count` (existing consumers unchanged).\n\n- **i18n**: new `sales_rep.documents.*` keys in all 13 locales.\n\n## Screenshots\n<img width=\"1506\" height=\"907\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/590e64b8-acdf-4baa-840b-d2ac34ea6891\"\n/>\n<img width=\"1436\" height=\"817\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/220e5f07-cf6e-43f5-b06d-306d3f7db925\"\n/>\n\n\n## References\n### Jira-link:\nhttps://virtocommerce.atlassian.net/browse/VCST-5730\n### Artifact URL:\n\nhttps://vc3prerelease.blob.core.windows.net/packages/vc-theme-b2b-vue-2.57.0-pr-2439-b59f-b59f7bc8.zip\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Aleksandra-Mitricheva <54628043+Aleksandra-Mitricheva@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJ