Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bac30afc27c40b0d8df01e2cf82df7570d27ed67","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/home-portal/core/git/trees/bac30afc27c40b0d8df01e2cf82df7570d27ed67"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/home-portal/core/git/commits/51cc10bdcd802c69193399041ec11e8ff7b10da0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/home-portal/core/commit/51cc10bdcd802c69193399041ec11e8ff7b10da0","node_id":"C_kwDOEbD_PtoAKDUxY2MxMGJkY2Q4MDJjNjkxOTMzOTkwNDFlYzExZThmZjdiMTBkYTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/home-portal/core/commit/5849a2a1228a3202274535a2ee50eb92316d892c","sha":"5849a2a1228a3202274535a2ee50eb92316d892c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/home-portal/core/commits/5849a2a1228a3202274535a2ee50eb92316d892c"}],"sha":"51cc10bdcd802c69193399041ec11e8ff7b10da0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/home-portal/core/commits/51cc10bdcd802c69193399041ec11e8ff7b10da0"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/home-portal/core/commits/5849a2a1228a3202274535a2ee50eb92316d892c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-09T12:46:21Z","email":"icebob@home-portal.local","name":"Icebob"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-09T12:46:21Z","email":"icebob@home-portal.local","name":"Icebob"},"message":"feat: Vue 3 frontend fixes — weather, traffic, animations\n\n- Fix weather widget overflow (CurrentInfo, WeekForecast responsive layout)\n- Fix weather page layout with flex-based responsive CSS\n- Migrate traffic module from legacy Directions API to Routes API\n- Add enhanced traffic infobox (travel time, traffic level, departure/arrival)\n- Fix double animation on home page reload\n- Fix radar video not replaying on page revisit\n- Load Font Awesome as static vendor file (Vite Unicode mangling fix)\n- Add modules directory to Tailwind content scan\n- Add global widget height rule for Vue 3 sub-app wrappers\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2ad6f178c5465236726e408267f0234ad6141d26","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/home-portal/core/git/trees/2ad6f178c5465236726e408267f0234ad6141d26"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/home-portal/core/git/commits/5849a2a1228a3202274535a2ee50eb92316d892c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/home-portal/core/commit/5849a2a1228a3202274535a2ee50eb92316d892c","node_id":"C_kwDOEbD_PtoAKDU4NDlhMmExMjI4YTMyMDIyNzQ1MzVhMmVlNTBlYjkyMzE2ZDg5MmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/home-portal/core/commit/d3a6b3f63ed8d1c48ef8282c042ce90fd25faf1e","sha":"d3a6b3f63ed8d1c48ef8282c042ce90fd25faf1e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/home-portal/core/commits/d3a6b3f63ed8d1c48ef8282c042ce90fd25faf1e"}],"sha":"5849a2a1228a3202274535a2ee50eb92316d892c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/home-portal/core/commits/5849a2a1228a3202274535a2ee50eb92316d892c"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/home-portal/core/commits/d3a6b3f63ed8d1c48ef8282c042ce90fd25faf1e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-08T23:23:21Z","email":"icebob@home-portal.local","name":"Icebob"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-08T23:23:21Z","email":"icebob@home-portal.local","name":"Icebob"},"message":"fix: resolve Vite build issues with moleculer-browser and CORS\n\n- Add vite-plugin-node-polyfills to shim Node.js built-ins (process,\n  events, stream, etc.) required by moleculer-browser UMD bundle\n- Mock unused Node.js modules (glob, cpus, raf-perf) that fail in browser\n- Fix CORS for static assets: change origin from boolean `true` to\n  string `\"*\"` (moleculer-web treats boolean as invalid origin match)\n- Remove crossorigin attributes from built HTML via Vite plugin\n  (ES module scripts inherently use CORS mode)\n- Use content-hashed filenames for cache busting\n- Clean up old non-hashed build artifacts\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"950414e502f42a309209c9497794c9c884883857","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/home-portal/core/git/trees/950414e502f42a309209c9497794c9c884883857"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/home-portal/core/git/commits/d3a6b3f63ed8d1c48ef8282c042ce90fd25faf1e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/home-portal/core/commit/d3a6b3f63ed8d1c48ef8282c042ce90fd25faf1e","node_id":"C_kwDOEbD_PtoAKGQzYTZiM2Y2M2VkOGQxYzQ4ZWY4MjgyYzA0MmNlOTBmZDI1ZmFmMWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/home-portal/core/commit/56de44be4299afcf5467638f15eed811b5d5f889","sha":"56de44be4299afcf5467638f15eed811b5d5f889","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/home-portal/core/commits/56de44be4299afcf5467638f15eed811b5d5f889"}],"sha":"d3a6b3f63ed8d1c48ef8282c042ce90fd25faf1e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/home-portal/core/commits/d3a6b3f63ed8d1c48ef8282c042ce90fd25faf1e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/home-portal/core/commits/56de44be4299afcf5467638f15eed811b5d5f889/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-08T22:46:57Z","email":"icebob@home-portal.local","name":"Icebob"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-08T22:46:57Z","email":"icebob@home-portal.local","name":"Icebob"},"message":"Fix startup issues: disable notifications REST autoAliases, add null checks\n\n- notifications.service.js: disable moleculer-db REST routes (rest: false)\n  to prevent autoAliases crash in moleculer-web 0.10.8\n- www.service.js: add notifications dependency for startup ordering\n- weather.service.js: add null checks for API responses without data\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"066968f75b84453176e35d6d4e826a758d5a1f8c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/home-portal/core/git/trees/066968f75b84453176e35