cebob"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-08T22:06:31Z","email":"icebob@home-portal.local","name":"Icebob"},"message":"fix: address 6 code review issues in notifications service\n\n- Fix N+1 query: move count() call after the cleanup loop, not inside it\n- Fix adapter usage: use findById() instead of find({query:{_id}})\n- Fix silent null: throw MoleculerClientError(404) for unknown notification id\n- Fix falsy offset: use !== undefined check so offset:0 is handled correctly\n- Fix event name: confirm action broadcasts notification.confirmed (not removed)\n- Fix NeDB dates: store createdAt/confirmedAt/expiresAt as Unix ms numbers\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"004fe0e4d8369944d0b65d388eb87ecd16e873e4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/home-portal/core/git/trees/004fe0e4d8369944d0b65d388eb87ecd16e873e4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/home-portal/core/git/commits/373476d30ffaa307e18d398db35c69e4313bf3d8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/home-portal/core/commit/373476d30ffaa307e18d398db35c69e4313bf3d8","node_id":"C_kwDOEbD_PtoAKDM3MzQ3NmQzMGZmYWEzMDdlMThkMzk4ZGIzNWM2OWU0MzEzYmYzZDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/home-portal/core/commit/10d04baa69a5541d82dab0023865670ea84fb93d","sha":"10d04baa69a5541d82dab0023865670ea84fb93d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/home-portal/core/commits/10d04baa69a5541d82dab0023865670ea84fb93d"}],"sha":"373476d30ffaa307e18d398db35c69e4313bf3d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/home-portal/core/commits/373476d30ffaa307e18d398db35c69e4313bf3d8"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/home-portal/core/commits/10d04baa69a5541d82dab0023865670ea84fb93d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-08T21:02:31Z","email":"icebob@home-portal.local","name":"Icebob"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-08T21:02:31Z","email":"icebob@home-portal.local","name":"Icebob"},"message":"feat: migrate notifications service to NeDB persistence via db.mixin\n\n- Replace in-memory store with NeDB file DB (./data/notifications.db)\n- Add new fields: persistent, source, confirmed, confirmedAt, createdAt, expiresAt\n- persistent:true notifications never auto-expire, only dismissed via confirm\n- confirm action sets confirmed:true + confirmedAt instead of deleting\n- Auto-cleanup timer removes expired non-persistent notifications from DB\n- list action returns confirmed:false notifications by default\n- Restart-safe: unconfirmed notifications survive service restarts\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9157f8a2d28b1bddde4f14fc5aae98eb2ab08407","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/home-portal/core/git/trees/9157f8a2d28b1bddde4f14fc5aae98eb2ab08407"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/home-portal/core/git/commits/10d04baa69a5541d82dab0023865670ea84fb93d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/home-portal/core/commit/10d04baa69a5541d82dab0023865670ea84fb93d","node_id":"C_kwDOEbD_PtoAKDEwZDA0YmFhNjlhNTU0MWQ4MmRhYjAwMjM4NjU2NzBlYTg0ZmI5M2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/home-portal/core/commit/5c48924c63721b043078c67ab6ed6ef752a68933","sha":"5c48924c63721b043078c67ab6ed6ef752a68933","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/home-portal/core/commits/5c48924c63721b043078c67ab6ed6ef752a68933"}],"sha":"10d04baa69a5541d82dab0023865670ea84fb93d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/home-portal/core/commits/10d04baa69a5541d82dab0023865670ea84fb93d"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/home-portal/core/commits/5c48924c63721b043078c67ab6ed6ef752a68933/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-08T20:54:24Z","email":"icebob@home-portal.local","name":"Icebob"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-08T20:54:24Z","ema