api.github.com/users/hpoepping","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TobitSoftware/chayns-toolkit/commits/a9d34e2ea4356c6a44cd4d46b0eba0bc29348417/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-20T15:58:46Z","email":"heiner.poepping@tobit.com","name":"Heiner Pöpping"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-20T16:28:32Z","email":"heiner.poepping@tobit.com","name":"Heiner Pöpping"},"message":":sparkles: Allow disabling Module Federation per entry point\n\nIntroduce a `moduleFederation` flag on entry points to opt them out of the federated web environment.\n\nThis prevents the Module Federation runtime and shared dependency wiring from being injected into specific entry points, such as simple helper scripts or standalone HTML pages that should not participate in federation.\nNon-federated web entry points are now built into a dedicated `web-non-federated` environment.","tree":{"sha":"3db0d60d28b26f683500f537b09a5a1ce017bf77","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TobitSoftware/chayns-toolkit/git/trees/3db0d60d28b26f683500f537b09a5a1ce017bf77"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TobitSoftware/chayns-toolkit/git/commits/a9d34e2ea4356c6a44cd4d46b0eba0bc29348417","verification":{"payload":"tree 3db0d60d28b26f683500f537b09a5a1ce017bf77\nparent 5f9da99b05e8d88ca2104f565541a0b068b8a014\nauthor Heiner Pöpping <heiner.poepping@tobit.com> 1784563126 +0200\ncommitter Heiner Pöpping <heiner.poepping@tobit.com> 1784564912 +0200\n\n:sparkles: Allow disabling Module Federation per entry point\n\nIntroduce a `moduleFederation` flag on entry points to opt them out of the federated web environment.\n\nThis prevents the Module Federation runtime and shared dependency wiring from being injected into specific entry points, such as simple helper scripts or standalone HTML pages that should not participate in federation.\nNon-federated web entry points are now built into a dedicated `web-non-federated` environment.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"----