=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-authn/commits/333f81593d683be6eef478de3ce1d767f2baae24/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-29T12:00:08Z","email":"adolfo@axim.org","name":"Adolfo R. Brandes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-29T13:19:06Z","email":"arbrandes@arbrand.es","name":"Adolfo R. Brandes"},"message":"style: use semicolons for TypeScript member delimiters\n\nThe shared ESLint config in frontend-base 2.0 requires semicolons rather than\ncommas between TypeScript type members. Mechanical `npm run lint:fix`.\n\nPart of #1687.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"164092e148fad55bb013dbd064c83c3ebd77e7b9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-authn/git/trees/164092e148fad55bb013dbd064c83c3ebd77e7b9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-authn/git/commits/333f81593d683be6eef478de3ce1d767f2baae24","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/759355?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/arbrandes","id":759355,"login":"arbrandes","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1OTM1NQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/openedx/frontend-app-authn/commit/333f81593d683be6eef478de3ce1d767f2baae24","node_id":"C_kwDOEdckq9oAKDMzM2Y4MTU5M2Q2ODNiZTZlZWY0NzhkZTNjZTFkNzY3ZjJiYWFlMjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/openedx/frontend-app-authn/commit/d124a0abf1dd9cafe4515a24b05cb0967a8f761c","sha":"d124a0abf1dd9cafe4515a24b05cb0967a8f761c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-authn/commits/d124a0abf1dd9cafe4515a24b05cb0967a8f761c"}],"sha":"333f81593d683be6eef478de3ce1d767f2baae24","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-authn/commits/333f81593d683be6eef478de3ce1d767f2baae24"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/759355?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/arbrandes","id":759355,"login":"arbrandes","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1OTM1NQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-authn/commits/d124a0abf1dd9cafe4515a24b05cb0967a8f761c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-29T11:59:33Z","email":"adolfo@axim.org","name":"Adolfo R. Brandes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-29T13:19:06Z","email":"arbrandes@arbrand.es","name":"Adolfo R. Brandes"},"message":"feat!: bundle only real defaults in app config\n\nEvery key an app declares in its own `config` is a key `commonAppConfig` can\nnever supply, since app config is the highest-precedence layer. Authn declared\ntwenty-nine, so values an operator set platform-wide through `MFE_CONFIG`\nsilently lost to bundled defaults.\n\nThree survive as genuine defaults and move to `App.defaultConfig` (frontend-base\nADR 0017, added by openedx/frontend-base#298), which resolves below\n`commonAppConfig`: `DISABLE_ENTERPRISE_LOGIN`, whose absence would quietly\nre-enable the enterprise flow, and `LOGO_URL` and `LOGO_WHITE_URL`, which carry\nthe same default frontend-base ships for the shell header.\n\nTwo of the rest were read nowhere at all, `FAVICON_URL` and `LOGO_TRADEMARK_URL`.\nFifteen were no-ops against reads that already guard for absence. The remaining\nnine were placeholders whose reads did not guard, and those reads now do:\n`SEARCH_CATALOG_URL` was a latent `TypeError` in the embedded welcome-page flow;\n`INFO_EMAIL` produced `mailto:undefined`; the activation and password-reset\nsupport links rendered dead anchors; and the four `BANNER_IMAGE_*` keys asked the\nbrowser for `/undefined`.\n\n`MARKETING_SITE_BASE_URL` wrapped the logo in a link at ten near-identical sites\nand defaulted to a devstack host. Those collapse into one `BrandLogo`, which\nrenders the logo unlinked when no marketing site is configured, rather than\npointing it at the app''s own origin.\n\nThe peer dependency moves to `@openedx/frontend-base` 2.0.0-alpha.4, the first\nrelease carrying `App.defaultConfig`.\n\nThree test defects surfaced while auditing and are fixed here, since the audit is\nwhat makes the boolean contract real: `AccountActivationMessage.test.jsx` called\n`mergeAppConfig` without its `appId`, so its overrides never landed and the\nconfirmation suite asserted the activation copy; boolean flags were overridden\nwith env-era strings that strict `=== false` reads can never honour; and\n`SHOW_CONFIGURABLE_EDX_FIELDS` was set in four tests but read nowhere.\n\nPart of #1687.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ebbaa845bdd91840da65ef475bc62c3e5e48046f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-authn/git/trees/ebbaa845bdd91840da65ef475bc62c3e5e48046f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-authn/git/commits/d124a0abf1dd9cafe4515a24b05cb0967a8f761c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/759355?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/arbrandes","id":759355,"login":"arbrandes","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1OTM1NQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/openedx/frontend-app-authn/commit/d124a0abf1dd9cafe4515a24b05cb0967a8f761c","node_id":"C_kwDOEdckq9oAKGQxMjRhMGFiZjFkZDljYWZlNDUxNWEyNGIwNWNiMDk2N2E4Zjc2MWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/openedx/frontend-app-authn/commit/c9bfd4936d74dccd6a0d0cdaa1dc4a68e96f2674","sha":"c9bfd4936d74dccd6a0d0cdaa1dc4a68e96f2674","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-authn/commits/c9bfd4936d74dccd6a0d0cdaa1dc4a68e96f2674"}],"sha":"d124a0abf1dd9cafe4515a24b05cb0967a8f761c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-authn/commits/d124a0abf1dd9cafe4515a24b05cb0967a8f761c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/759355?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/arbrandes","id":759355,"login":"arbrandes","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1OTM1NQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-authn/commits/c9bfd4936d74dccd6a0d0cdaa1dc4a68e96f2674/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-28T18:43:46Z","email":"adolfo@axim.org","name":"Adolfo R. Brandes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-28T18:43:46Z","email":"arbrandes@arbrand.es","name":"Adolfo R. Brandes"},"message":"chore: land the frontend-base conversion\n\nThe frontend-base branch takes over master. This repository is now an App\nRepository: a library published to NPM that plugs into the Open edX frontend\nshell, rather than a standalone micro-frontend. Its branches follow OEP-10\nADR 0002, and it is no longer branched or tagged for Open edX releases in\nits own right.\n\nThe micro-frontend goes on living on legacy-mfe, which is where any further\nrelease/RELEASENAME branches for it are cut, for as long as a supported\nrelease still ships it.\n\nCloses #1685.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e98caacf3e4c343cc8edb296b19dd3fa3c3ea383","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-authn/git/trees/e98caacf3e4c343cc8edb296b19dd3fa3c3ea383"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-authn/git/commits/c9bfd4936d74dccd6a0d0cdaa1dc4a68e96f2674","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/759355?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/arbrandes","id":759355,"login":"arbrandes","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1OTM1NQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/openedx/frontend-app-authn/commit/c9bfd4936d74dccd6a0d0cdaa1dc4a68e96f2674","node_id":"C_kwDOEdckq9oAKGM5YmZkNDkzNmQ3NGRjY2Q2YTBkMGNkYWExZGM0YTY4ZTk2ZjI2NzQ","