":"Adolfo R. Brandes"},"message":"docs: restructure the README to the standard section layout\n\nBrings the section hierarchy in line with frontend-template-application\nand the other landed App Repositories. Getting Help, License,\nContributing, The Open edX Code of Conduct, People and Reporting\nSecurity Issues were all nested under Getting Started; they become\ntop-level sections, in the template''s order.\n\nAdds the two sections this README was missing: Slots, pointing at\nsrc/slots/, and Developing, covering the project structure, the\ndifference between the library build and the CI build, and where the\ni18n documentation lives.\n\nDrops the empty `Known Issues` section, which the template does not\nhave.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e98caacf3e4c343cc8edb296b19dd3fa3c3ea383","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-authn/git/trees/e98caacf3e4c343cc8edb296b19dd3fa3c3ea383"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-authn/git/commits/dd4b93f3bdefe6147ece1406878aa6a4ad66b88b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/759355?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/arbrandes","id":759355,"login":"arbrandes","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1OTM1NQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.