Q3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Prasun-Acharjee/Prasun-Acharjee/commits/e7d84284f8ed38a9f582aeba9870940d52bac63b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-05T21:06:23Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-05T21:06:23Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Freeze background mesh; restrict animation to the glass card\n\nLarge slow-moving colour fields stepped visibly at 8fps on mobile.\nA static backdrop also compresses to almost nothing via frame\ndifferencing, which buys the budget to raise the frame rate.\nheader.webp is regenerated next.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Q8m95wXUTBqC9YMMDx2Cqu","tree":{"sha":"708d5dbca4e8f113ef93c79ba74a771a8cf2e124","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Prasun-Acharjee/Prasun-Acharjee/git/trees/708d5dbca4e8f113ef93c79ba74a771a8cf2e124"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Prasun-Acharjee/Prasun-Acharjee/git/commits/e7d84284f8ed38a9f582aeba9870940d52bac63b","verification":{"payload":"tree 708d5dbca4e8f113ef93c79ba74a771a8cf2e124\nparent 3382bf461b7fc091eec6d6c65089fa107bcc5203\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1785963983 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1785963983 +0000\n\nFreeze background mesh; restrict animation to the glass card\n\nLarge slow-moving colour fields stepped visibly at 8fps on mobile.\nA static backdrop also compresses to almost nothing via frame\ndifferencing, which buys the budget 