_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rogeru/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rogeru/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rogeru","id":1393401,"login":"rogeru","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzOTM0MDE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rogeru/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rogeru/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rogeru/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rogeru/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rogeru/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rogeru","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular-architects/module-federation-plugin/commits/543909edda6f94ca202243884fb20a0e06f8c89e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-20T14:16:47Z","email":"roger.urscheler@atos.net","name":"Roger Urscheler"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-20T14:16:47Z","email":"roger.urscheler@atos.net","name":"Roger Urscheler"},"message":"fix: define ngDevMode in dev builds to prevent ReferenceError\n\nIn dev mode, `ngDevMode` was not defined at all in the esbuild `define`\nconfig. Angular''s compiler emits bare `ngDevMode` references in\nsignal/input/computed debug info. When these run at module load time,\nthey throw `ReferenceError: ngDevMode is not defined`.\n\nThis sets `ngDevMode` to `''true''` in dev builds (and keeps `''false''`\nfor production), ensuring the global is always replaced by esbuild.\n\nFixes #458\nFixes #897\nRelated to #552, #815\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"131e14b8db6b3d4678f4508534ea26fff1989461","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular-architects/module-federation-plugin/git/trees/131e14b8db6b3d4678f4508534ea26fff1989461"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular-architects/module-federation-plugin/git/commits/543909edda6f94ca202243884fb20a0