r":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/navikt/esyfovarsel/commit/946a546c4e44ef035ea8a8d04f560a0e8a24fe2e","node_id":"C_kwDOEh5AtNoAKDk0NmE1NDZjNGU0NGVmMDM1ZWE4YThkMDRmNTYwYTBlOGEyNGZlMmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/navikt/esyfovarsel/commit/b1896ebcf5d666652d84f3a12b43198971cb179b","sha":"b1896ebcf5d666652d84f3a12b43198971cb179b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/navikt/esyfovarsel/commits/b1896ebcf5d666652d84f3a12b43198971cb179b"}],"sha":"946a546c4e44ef035ea8a8d04f560a0e8a24fe2e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/navikt/esyfovarsel/commits/946a546c4e44ef035ea8a8d04f560a0e8a24fe2e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/29110?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/dependabot","id":49699333,"login":"dependabot[bot]","node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDk2OTkzMzM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/navikt/esyfovarsel/commits/b1896ebcf5d666652d84f3a12b43198971cb179b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T14:43:10Z","email":"49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"dependabot[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T14:43:10Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore(deps): bump org.jetbrains.kotlin:kotlin-test from 2.4.10 to 2.4.20 (#1100)\n\nBumps\n[org.jetbrains.kotlin:kotlin-test](https://github.com/JetBrains/kotlin)\nfrom 2.4.10 to 2.4.20.\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/JetBrains/kotlin/releases\">org.jetbrains.kotlin:kotlin-test''s\nreleases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>Kotlin 2.4.20</h2>\n<h2>Changelog</h2>\n<h3>Analysis API</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-86546\"><code>KT-86546</code></a>\nCheck suspicious when over ConeKotlinType in\nConeTypeCompatibilityChecker</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-85418\"><code>KT-85418</code></a>\nImplement an API for accessing deserialized file annotations in Analysis\nAPI</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-74448\"><code>KT-74448</code></a>\nK2. False positive MISSING_DEPENDENCY_SUPERCLASS in LinkedListTest.kt,\nkotlinx.coroutines</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-85856\"><code>KT-85856</code></a>\ncontainingSymbol of constructor property differs for local and non-local\nclasses</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-65417\"><code>KT-65417</code></a>\nK2 IDE: KTOR false positive expect-actual matching error on enum class\nbecause of implicit clone() in non-JVM source sets</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Analysis API. Code Compilation</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-76457\"><code>KT-76457</code></a>\nK2 IDE / KMP Debugger: KISEWA “Cannot compile a common source without a\nJVM counterpart” on evaluating inline fun from common module inside\njvm</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Analysis API. FIR</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-70552\"><code>KT-70552</code></a>\nNo expects for actual</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-69727\"><code>KT-69727</code></a>\nK2 IDE. Wrong error in the editor on calling <code>clone</code> function\nof actual enum instance in non-jvm platform</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-69726\"><code>KT-69726</code></a>\nFP errors on declaring <code>fun clone()</code> in actual enum in\nnot-jvm source-set</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-86014\"><code>KT-86014</code></a>\nTypes are broken after remove parameter through change signature</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-86363\"><code>KT-86363</code></a>\nKotlinIllegalArgumentExceptionWithAttachments: No dangling modifier\nfound on companion blocks</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-86147\"><code>KT-86147</code></a>\nDrop <code>kotlin.parallel.resolve.under.global.lock</code> registry\nkey</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-85543\"><code>KT-85543</code></a>\nAvoid lazy resolve for the contracts phase if no constracts might be\nresolved</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Analysis API. Infrastructure</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-84914\"><code>KT-84914</code></a>\nDo not publish analysis-api-test-framework</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-86986\"><code>KT-86986</code></a>\n<code>kotlin-compiler-common-for-ide</code> bundles unrelated Analysis\nAPI modules</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-86186\"><code>KT-86186</code></a>\nAnalysis API: Codebase tests run twice in some analysis modules — pick a\nsingle JUnit runner and migrate</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-85360\"><code>KT-85360</code></a>\nDrop kotlin-compiler-testdata-for-ide artifact</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-85585\"><code>KT-85585</code></a>\nSimplify the dependencies graph for the Analysis API modules</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-85381\"><code>KT-85381</code></a>\nRemove tests for the FE10 implementation</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Analysis API. Light Classes</h3>\n<h4>New Features</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-84645\"><code>KT-84645</code></a>\nSupport resolving to companion block members &amp; extensions from Java\n(light classes)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-80775\"><code>KT-80775</code></a>\nSupport PsiClass#getRecordComponents in light classes</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Fixes</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-57537\"><code>KT-57537</code></a>\nSLC: propagate default parameter value from (<code>@JvmOverloads</code>)\n<code>expect</code> declarations to <code>actual</code>\ndeclarations</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-85040\"><code>KT-85040</code></a>\n[Analysis API] Improve Java / Kotlin interop in KMP projects</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-87301\"><code>KT-87301</code></a>\nSymbolLightAccessorMethod#isValid returns false for delegated\nproperties</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-87171\"><code>KT-87171</code></a>\nSLC: non-mapped Kotlin collection supertype is dropped from supertype\nlist</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-87250\"><code>KT-87250</code></a>\nJvmExposeBoxed: light classes shouldn''t be autogenerated for private\ndeclarations</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-70428\"><code>KT-70428</code></a>\nAA: good code is red when a Java class extends a Kotlin class\nimplementing MutableList by delegation</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-63568\"><code>KT-63568</code></a>\nSymbol Light Classes:\nKtAnnotationApplicationWithArgumentsInfo.normalizedArguments() may work\nincorrectly when psi is not set</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- raw HTML omitted -->\n</blockquote>\n<p>... (truncated)</p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Changelog</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/JetBrains/kotlin/blob/master/ChangeLog.md\">org.jetbrains.kotlin:kotlin-test''s\nchangelog</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>2.4.20</h2>\n<h3>Analysis API</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-86546\"><code>KT-86546</code></a>\nCheck suspicious when over ConeKotlinType in\nConeTypeCompatibilityChecker</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-85418\"><code>KT-85418</code></a>\nImplement an API for accessing deserialized file annotations in Analysis\nAPI</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-74448\"><code>KT-74448</code></a>\nK2. False positive MISSING_DEPENDENCY_SUPERCLASS in LinkedListTest.kt,\nkotlinx.coroutines</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-85856\"><code>KT-85856</code></a>\ncontainingSymbol of constructor property differs for local and non-local\nclasses</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-65417\"><code>KT-65417</code></a>\nK2 IDE: KTOR false positive expect-actual matching error on enum class\nbecause of implicit clone() in non-JVM source sets</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Analysis API. Code Compilation</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-76457\"><code>KT-76457</code></a>\nK2 IDE / KMP Debugger: KISEWA “Cannot compile a common source without a\nJVM counterpart” on evaluating inline fun from common module inside\njvm</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Analysis API. FIR</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-70552\"><code>KT-70552</code></a>\nNo expects for actual</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-69727\"><code>KT-69727</code></a>\nK2 IDE. Wrong error in the editor on calling <code>clone</code> function\nof actual enum instance in non-jvm platform</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-69726\"><code>KT-69726</code></a>\nFP errors on declaring <code>fun clone()</code> in actual enum in\nnot-jvm source-set</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-86014\"><code>KT-86014</code></a>\nTypes are broken after remove parameter through change signature</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-86363\"><code>KT-86363</code></a>\nKotlinIllegalArgumentExceptionWithAttachments: No dangling modifier\nfound on companion blocks</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-86147\"><code>KT-86147</code></a>\nDrop <code>kotlin.parallel.resolve.under.global.lock</code> registry\nkey</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-85543\"><code>KT-85543</code></a>\nAvoid lazy resolve for the contracts phase if no constracts might be\nresolved</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Analysis API. Infrastructure</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-84914\"><code>KT-84914</code></a>\nDo not publish analysis-api-test-framework</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-86986\"><code>KT-86986</code></a>\n<code>kotlin-compiler-common-for-ide</code> bundles unrelated Analysis\nAPI modules</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-86186\"><code>KT-86186</code></a>\nAnalysis API: