orheim","id":80095835,"login":"AudunSorheim","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgwMDk1ODM1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AudunSorheim/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AudunSorheim/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AudunSorheim/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AudunSorheim/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AudunSorheim/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AudunSorheim","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/navikt/esyfovarsel/commits/8c5f32d4ef6d7408693615f4099b9317466395f1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-09T09:56:34Z","email":"80095835+AudunSorheim@users.noreply.github.com","name":"AudunSorheim"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-09T09:56:34Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Fjern gammelt agentoppsett og slank repoinstruksjoner (#1096)\n\nFjerner kopierte agenter og skills, synkemanifest og alle workflows for\nagentoppsett. Erstatter generelle maler og rammeverkseksempler med 19\nlinjer i `.github/copilot-instructions.md` og én pekerlinje i\n`AGENTS.md`. Overflødige path-instrukser fjernes.\n\nBeholder varslingsrettigheter, feil- og retryhåndtering og den særskilte\nFlyway-koblingen som unngår låsing ved samtidige indeksmigreringer.\n\nDen påkrevde oppsettssjekken er fjernet fra grenreglene. Appens bygg-,\ntest- og deployflyter er beholdt.\n\nKontrollert endringsomfang, lokale filpekere, uendrede app-workflows og\nfravær av gamle oppsettsreferanser. Ingen appbygg er kjørt for denne\ninstruksjonsendringen.","tree":{"sha":"517c70fcf9fde014f496c0072aebd18296c6d8c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/navikt/esyfovarsel/git/trees/517c70fcf9fde014f496c0072aebd18296c6d8c8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/navikt/esyfovarsel/git/commits/8c5f32d4ef6d7408693615f4099b9317466395f1","verification":{"payload":"tree 517c70fcf9fde014f496c0072aebd18296c6d8c8\nparent 46d0e74f9a92ebeeb730767d225a074613e63cbc\nauthor AudunSorheim <80095835+AudunSorheim@users.noreply.github.com> 1788947794 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788947794 +0000\n\nFjern gammelt agentoppsett og slank repoinstruksjoner (#1096)\n\nFjerner kopierte agenter og skills, synkemanifest og alle workflows for\nagentoppsett. Erstatter generelle maler og rammeverkseksempler med 19\nlinjer i `.github/copilot-instructions.md` og én pekerlinje i\n`AGENTS.md`. Overflødige path-instrukser fjernes.\n\nBeholder varslingsrettigheter, feil- og retryhåndtering og den særskilte\nFlyway-koblingen som unngår låsing ved samtidige indeksmigreringer.\n\nDen påkrevde oppsettssjekken er fjernet fra grenreglene. Appens bygg-,\ntest- og deployflyter er beholdt.\n\nKontrollert endringsomfang, lokale filpekere, uendrede app-workflows og\nfravær av gamle oppsettsreferanser. Ingen appbygg er kjørt for denne\ninstruksjonsendringen.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqoS1iCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAACQoQAI0zWhsBpgrs0xpEPtVxv8Aq\no5B0qTWnTLUAdCnTrumdq/xn6hr9QCY44wcLPvSQAZQ4dP9tse0a3FPgiSVYlqqT\nmbZICZskqnqWAJA/l+pKDkU0YpC6SYAH70byyzCFTSou36mGA7GjNgZKmoFFB7V9\nWxvUckZofLgmARy9b6wns0+8+F8nvkIL0Q5I80r88N9LIAbyiafl+Up3b31EouvR\nfdO7m9750KEKQndzCuduluqIVt200Sl2BpKTlweRdBLFGCQqJPpwoARgZzQ0ROOd\nYLMop6u7Ip46c2x1fHmr9VH7ltMd5j9G1xSRQvi1q/V3lYQiJ6zMw6/XcVoL2a+G\nX8eqUeQhMrvOnW/lqO4P7LGtP13u1AZi8kBh1PZierP/NzwTvgeJ9x+kttRkfQfA\nN4gNY1crnix+F9oDGP+Iw3uDznzNM8fAgV+cJZ4Vv6MebwQPFhtb15wLKMiylcrs\nNu/KMCypb0OiAi9TGnmXAIsd+EB+LM7bxN1UdjIOrlIaLFYYv6vpQuYcCnpJhvcb\nDXAzN2FpEERrhnDG8aOyk2v4iLECD5FIxyUadIAR2gcasFMq31Ef1A888UDjk2ds\nvCxdnkozDxhfrOM4nTAbULpkmIHfGlCkSainC/sZ1y7Nhr1ZVeMge2uA1nIc25qD\nc6yICfqM0zc/ZwHvxWt/\n=ef5G\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-09T09:56:50Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/navikt/esyfovarsel/commit/8c5f32d4ef6d7408693615f4099b9317466395f1","node_id":"C_kwDOEh5AtNoAKDhjNWYzMmQ0ZWY2ZDc0MDg2OTM2MTVmNDA5OWI5MzE3NDY2Mzk1ZjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/navikt/esyfovarsel/commit/46d0e74f9a92ebeeb730767d225a074613e63cbc","sha":"46d0e74f9a92ebeeb730767d225a074613e63cbc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/navikt/esyfovarsel/commits/46d0e74f9a92ebeeb730767d225a074613e63cbc"}],"sha":"8c5f32d4ef6d7408693615f4099b9317466395f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/navikt/esyfovarsel/commits/8c5f32d4ef6d7408693615f4099b9317466395f1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/29110?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/dependabot","id":49699333,"login":"dependabot[bot]","node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDk2OTkzMzM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/navikt/esyfovarsel/commits/46d0e74f9a92ebeeb730767d225a074613e63cbc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T06:29:17Z","email":"49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"dependabot[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T06:29:17Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore(deps): bump jvm from 2.3.21 to 2.4.10 (#1067)\n\nBumps [jvm](https://github.com/JetBrains/kotlin) from 2.3.21 to 2.4.10.\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/JetBrains/kotlin/releases\">jvm''s\nreleases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>Kotlin 2.4.10</h2>\n<h2>Changelog</h2>\n<h3>Backend. Wasm</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-87066\"><code>KT-87066</code></a>\nK/Wasm: Not all files are presented in compiler output directory with\nmultimodule-closed-world and incremental compilation</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Compiler</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-86939\"><code>KT-86939</code></a>\nJVM: IllegalStateException &quot;No value for annotation parameter&quot;\nwhen using const val in nested Java annotation array argument</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-83766\"><code>KT-83766</code></a>\nK2: Wrong sourcePsi is set for <code>SymbolPsiLiteral</code> in SLC for\nannotation arguments referencing a const val</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-86728\"><code>KT-86728</code></a>\nReified type inference: expected type not propagated into inline call\ninside lambda with elvis operator</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Compose Compiler</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://issuetracker.google.com/issues/522127447\"><code>b/522127447</code></a>\nCompose Compiler 2.4: classes previously inferred <code>stable</code>\nnow reported <code>runtime</code>/<code>Uncertain</code></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Klibs</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-86501\"><code>KT-86501</code></a>\nNative: IrTypeAliasSymbolImpl is already bound. Signature:\nkotlinx.datetime/Instant|null[0] on iosSimulatorArm64</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Tools. CLI</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-86930\"><code>KT-86930</code></a>\nIntroduce <code>kotlinr</code> in the Kotlin distribution</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Tools. Gradle. BCV</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-87223\"><code>KT-87223</code></a>\nGradle, BCV: open version range in kotlinAbiValidationCompatClasspath\ncauses kotlin-build-tools-impl to resolve to 2.4.20-Beta1 instead of\n2.4.0</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Tools. Gradle. JS</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-87304\"><code>KT-87304</code></a>\njsBrowserTest fails with &quot;exited with errors (exit code:\n1)&quot;</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-86057\"><code>KT-86057</code></a>\nkotlinUpgradeYarnLock skips lock file regeneration when kotlinNpmInstall\nis up-to-date, causing kotlinStoreYarnLock to fail</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Tools. Gradle. Multiplatform</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-87084\"><code>KT-87084</code></a>\nFalse positive warning for JS and Wasm compilations when CRI is\nenabled</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Tools. Scripts</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-87076\"><code>KT-87076</code></a>\n<code>@file</code>:CompilerOptions(&quot;-jvm-target&quot;, ...) ignored\nin .main.kts scripts in Kotlin 2.4.0, falling back to JVM target\n1.8</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-86352\"><code>KT-86352</code></a>\nK2 scripting: FirResolvedTypeRef exception when resolving extension\nfunctions from imported scripts</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Kotlin 2.4.10-RC2</h2>\n<h2>Changelog</h2>\n<h3>Backend. Wasm</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-87066\"><code>KT-87066</code></a>\nK/Wasm: Not all files are presented in compiler output directory with\nmultimodule-closed-world and incremental compilation</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- raw HTML omitted -->\n</blockquote>\n<p>... (truncated)</p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Changelog</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/JetBrains/kotlin/blob/master/ChangeLog.md\">jvm''s\nchangelog</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>2.4.10</h2>\n<h3>Backend. Wasm</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-87066\"><code>KT-87066</code></a>\nK/Wasm: Not all files are presented in compiler output directory with\nmultimodule-closed-world and incremental compilation</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Compiler</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-86939\"><code>KT-86939</code></a>\nJVM: IllegalStateException &quot;No value for annotation parameter&quot;\nwhen using const val in nested Java annotation array argument</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-83766\"><code>KT-83766</code></a>\nK2: Wrong sourcePsi is set for <code>SymbolPsiLiteral</code> in SLC for\nannotation arguments referencing a const val</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-86728\"><code>KT-86728</code></a>\nReified type inference: expected type not propagated into inline call\ninside lambda with elvis operator</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Compose Compiler</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://issuetracker.google.com/issues/522127447\"><code>b/522127447</code></a>\nCompose Compiler 2.4: classes previously inferred <code>stable</code>\nnow reported <code>runtime</code>/<code>Uncertain</code></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Klibs</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-86501\"><code>KT-86501</code></a>\nNative: IrTypeAliasSymbolImpl is already bound. Signature:\nkotlinx.datetime/Instant|null[0] on iosSimulatorArm64</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Tools. CLI</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-86930\"><code>KT-86930</code></a>\nIntroduce <code>kotlinr</code> in the Kotlin distribution</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Tools. Gradle. BCV</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-87223\"><code>KT-87223</code></a>\nGradle, BCV: open version range in kotlinAbiValidationCompatClasspath\ncauses kotlin-build-tools-impl to resolve to 2.4.20-Beta1 instead of\n2.4.0</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Tools. Gradle. JS</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-87304\"><code>KT-87304</code></a>\njsBrowserTest fails with &quot;exited with errors (exit code:\n1)&quot;</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-86057\"><code>KT-86057</code></a>\nkotlinUpgradeYarnLock skips lock file regeneration when kotlinNpmInstall\nis up-to-date, causing kotlinStoreYarnLock to fail</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Tools. Gradle. Multiplatform</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-87084\"><code>KT-87084</code></a>\nFalse positive warning for JS and Wasm compilations when CRI is\nenabled</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Tools. Scripts</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-87076\"><code>KT-87076</code></a>\n<code>@file</code>:CompilerOptions(&quot;-jvm-target&quot;, ...) ignored\nin .main.kts scripts in Kotlin 2.4.0, falling back to JVM target\n1.8</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-86352\"><code>KT-86352</code></a>\nK2 scripting: FirResolvedTypeRef exception when resolving extension\nfunctions from imported scripts</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>2.4.0</h2>\n<h3>Analysis API</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-83867\"><code>KT-83867</code></a>\nOVERLOAD_RESOLUTION_AMBIGUITY false positive with assertEquals in IJ\nrepo</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-83723\"><code>KT-83723</code></a>\n[Analysis API] Enable experimental KDoc resolver by default</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KT-83388\"><code>KT-83388</code></a>\nAnalysis API: properly support KMP in KotlinPackageProvider</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- raw HTML omitted -->\n</blockquote>\n<p>... (truncated)</p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/JetBrains/kotlin/commit/5687445832cd835b4509b9fbc264cdf1a8201093\"><code>5687445</code></a>\nAdd Changelog for 2.4.10-RC2</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/JetBrains/kotlin/commit/ba30392c459dd7c1ae74c1501e83453144416bc9\"><code>ba30392</code></a>\n[Wasm] Support regenerate unchanged modules flag on KGP</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/JetBrains/kotlin/commit/6307e7310d14eef05f199ebccd9518379772d3a7\"><code>6307e73</code></a>\n[Wasm] Implement Xwasm-IC-generate-unchanged-modules flag</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/JetBrains/kotlin/commit/39d7aee8470b7ce61fea8f76c317456e2756f7c0\"><code>39d7aee</code></a>\nAdd ChangeLog for 2.4.10-RC2</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/JetBrains/kotlin/commit/a2956bed85f99752b78881075665d81a82e98ab2\"><code>a2956be</code></a>\n[Gradle] Update karma.conf.js to use ''require(...)'' instead plain\nstrings</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/JetBrains/kotlin/commit/9b1361ce7a6cfd2edd6f8cdb05198573fb839b61\"><code>9b1361c</code></a>\n[Gradle] KT-87223: Updated regression test</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/JetBrains/kotlin/commit/a4c153af52ad4694c0cca14c25812db54b19f90e\"><code>a4c153a</code></a>\n[Gradle] KT-87223: Fix toochain to 2.4.0 for abiValidation compat\nconfig</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/JetBrains/kotlin/commit/bc04b90d245cd27d8339fe51bd43a90dd4c04e9f\"><code>bc04b90</code></a>\nAdd ChangeLog for 2.4.10-RC</li>\n<li><a\nhref=