rack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-7892\">KTOR-7892</a>\nSwaggerUI: Missing oauth2-redirect.html support in the plugin</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9759\">KTOR-9759</a>\nReject whitespace in URL hosts during parsing</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9681\">KTOR-9681</a>\nUpdate kotlinx-io to 0.9.1</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9743\">KTOR-9743</a>\nByteReadChannel.readLineStrict: Misleading definition of limit parameter\nin KDocs</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9504\">KTOR-9504</a>\nImprove KDoc for EmbeddedServer.addShutdownHook</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Bugfixes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9741\">KTOR-9741</a> CIO:\nrequest-handler coroutine leak on half-closed idle connection after ≥1MB\nresponse</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-7661\">KTOR-7661</a>\nMaven + YAML config file does not work</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9585\">KTOR-9585</a>\nOpenAPI: JsonSchema title is truncated when it contains a dot</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9704\">KTOR-9704</a>\nUTF-8 encoding in ktor-io bypasses JVM String.getBytes intrinsics,\nslowing every text response by 5-7x</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9588\">KTOR-9588</a> SSE\nclient (CIO engine) sends spurious <code>Content-Length: 0</code> on\nbody-less GET (RFC 9110 § 8.6 violation; rejected by AWS ELB)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9679\">KTOR-9679</a>\nByteReadChannel.readLine corrupts multi-byte UTF-8 by splitting a\ncharacter at a buffer boundary</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9767\">KTOR-9767</a>\nByteReadChannel.readLineTo: Return read bytes count instead of decoded\ncharacters count <a href=\"#\"><img\nsrc=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/%5BImpactful%20change%5D-orange?style=flat-square\"\nalt=\"\" /></a></li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8992\">KTOR-8992</a>\nHoconConfigLoader is not loaded when ktor-server-config-yaml on the\nclasspath</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9698\">KTOR-9698</a>\nOpenAPI: schema for kotlinx.serialization sealed types omits\ndiscriminator property in variant schemas</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9690\">KTOR-9690</a>\nNetty: in-flight requests are aborted on stop(), ignoring shutdown grace\nperiod</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8903\">KTOR-8903</a>\nNetty: Close channel connection on errors properly</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9707\">KTOR-9707</a>\nSaveBody performance regression</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9703\">KTOR-9703</a>\nInefficient text reading function in DefaultTransform</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9711\">KTOR-9711</a>\nNetty HTTP/2: a single client-canceled stream (RST_STREAM) breaks\nresponse flushing for the whole connection</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9688\">KTOR-9688</a>\nRateLimit: No access to principal when wrapped with authentication since\n3.5.1</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9677\">KTOR-9677</a>\nAuto-reloading: server is reloaded only once since 3.5.0</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9683\">KTOR-9683</a>\nSockets: Canceling a SelectorManager job doesn''t close it properly</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9671\">KTOR-9671</a>\nDarwin: Semicolons in URL path are sanitized</li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Changelog</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md\">io.ktor:ktor-server-netty-jvm''s\nchangelog</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h1>3.5.2</h1>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Publi