m/kotest/kotest/pull/6119\">kotest/kotest#6119</a></li>\n<li>fix(kotest-assertions-core): Handle null map values in\nshouldBeEqualUsingFields by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sksamuel\"><code>@​sksamuel</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/pull/6112\">kotest/kotest#6112</a></li>\n<li>Update dependency io.mockk:mockk to v1.14.11 by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/renovate\"><code>@​renovate</code></a>[bot] in\n<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/pull/6163\">kotest/kotest#6163</a></li>\n<li>fix: attach Fail fast scope tracker for each root test case in\ninstance per spec mode by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ashdawngary\"><code>@​ashdawngary</code></a> in\n<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/pull/6160\">kotest/kotest#6160</a></li>\n<li>Update dependency io.projectreactor.tools:blockhound to\nv1.0.17.RELEASE by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/renovate\"><code>@​renovate</code></a>[bot] in\n<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/pull/6164\">kotest/kotest#6164</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>New Contributors</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/AlexCue987\"><code>@​AlexCue987</code></a> with\n<a href=\"https://github.com/Copilot\"><code>@​Copilot</code></a> made\ntheir first contribution in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/pull/6159\">kotest/kotest#6159</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/axiom\"><code>@​axiom</code></a> made\ntheir first contribution in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/pull/6155\">kotest/kotest#6155</a></li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ashdawngary\"><code>@​ashdawngary</code></a>\nmade their first contribution in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/kotest/kotest/pull/6160\">kotest/kotest#6160</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Full Changelog</strong>: <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/kotest/kotest/compare/v6.2.1...v6.2.2\">https://github.com/kotest/kotest/compare/v6.2.1...v6.2.2</a></p>\n</blockquote>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Co