":49699333,"login":"dependabot[bot]","node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDk2OTkzMzM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/navikt/esyfovarsel/commits/14b8317536e7b8dfa87f1c386b8ee8ed66f9494a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-13T14:39:20Z","email":"49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"dependabot[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-13T14:39:20Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore(deps): bump com.gradleup.shadow from 9.4.3 to 9.5.1 (#1058)\n\nBumps [com.gradleup.shadow](https://github.com/GradleUp/shadow) from\n9.4.3 to 9.5.1.\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/GradleUp/shadow/releases\">com.gradleup.shadow''s\nreleases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>9.5.1</h2>\n<h3>Fixed</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Fix eager calls for <code>toolchainSpec</code> in Kotlin DSL. (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/GradleUp/shadow/pull/2087\">#2087</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>9.5.0</h2>\n<h3>Added</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Check <code>DuplicatesStrategy</code> for merging transformers. (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/GradleUp/shadow/pull/2026\">#2026</a>)<br\n/>\nThis will log warnings when an incompatible\n<code>DuplicatesStrategy</code> (e.g., <code>EXCLUDE</code>) is applied\nin Gradle configuration for built-in\n<code>ResourceTransformer</code>s.</li>\n<li>Add <code>KotlinModuleMetadataTransformer</code>. (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/GradleUp/shadow/pull/2073\">#2073</a>)</li>\n<li>Add R8 as an opt-in <code>minimize { r8 { ... } }</code> tool for\nshrinking the final shadowed JAR. (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/GradleUp/shadow/pull/2077\">#2077</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Changed</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Bump min Gradle requirement to 9.2.0. (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/GradleUp/shadow/pull/2057\">#2057</a>)</li>\n<li>Remove <code>afterEvaluate</code> when adding variants. (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/GradleUp/shadow/pull/2056\">#2056</a>)</li>\n<li>Deprecate <code>enableKotlinModuleRemapping</code> for\n<code>ShadowJar</code>. (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/GradleUp/shadow/pull/2073\">#2073</a>)<br\n/>\nApply <code>KotlinModuleMetadataTransformer</code> explicitly to support\nrelocating inside Kotlin module metadata files.</li>\n<li>Deprecate everything under <code>ShadowCopyAction</code>. (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/GradleUp/shadow/pull/2083\">#2083</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Fixed</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Fix the conflicts when using <code>afterEvaluate</code> with other\nplugins. (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/GradleUp/shadow/pull/2055\">#2055</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/GradleUp/shadow/commit/c33612d2e122feaaf080714ac56d7cf4f61645aa\"><code>c33612d</code></a>\nPrepare version 9.5.1</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/GradleUp/shadow/commit/485e4121d99ab59262e94c6d5cbc45bd4259bb9e\"><code>485e412</code></a>\nFix eager calls for toolchainSpec in Kotlin DSL (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/GradleUp/shadow/issues/2087\">#2087</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/GradleUp/shadow/commit/d062fa23f9fe4d1a0e8b6694133794113cbc8bd6\"><code>d062fa2</code></a>\nFix DuplicatesStrategyCheckerTest resource loading on Windows (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/GradleUp/shadow/issues/2085\">#2085</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/GradleUp/shadow/commit/e71a2c1c629da138d830220a56afb59eaae50d16\"><code>e71a2c1</code></a>\nAdd description for shadow configuration (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/GradleUp/shadow/issues/2084\">#2084</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/GradleUp/shadow/commit/7ba43b066e0c86b9d32cce4742cd4171a4aaa68b\"><code>7ba43b0</code></a>\nPrepare next development version</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/GradleUp/shadow/commit/6e00cb7101ebf78e9fa1ce04fb215a4587bb0d6a\"><code>6e00cb7</code></a>\nPrepare version 9.5.0</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/GradleUp/shadow/commit/ca039099f068c5899127709224c116bd7d835c5e\"><code>ca03909</code></a>\nDeprecate everything under ShadowCopyAction (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/GradleUp/shadow/issues/2083\">#2083</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/GradleUp/shadow/commit/7d7da274d0714b8a72bd008eb5f0c107aff5f2c2\"><code>7d7da27</code></a>\nRevert &quot;Mark CONSTANT_TIME_FOR_ZIP_ENTRIES as const (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/GradleUp/shadow/issues/2074\">#2074</a>)&quot;</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/GradleUp/shadow/commit/da18cc00a68f12c8d27b43ed4a304876b9926825\"><code>da18cc0</code></a>\nDeprecate enableKotlinModuleRemapping for ShadowJar (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/GradleUp/shadow/issues/2073\">#2073</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/GradleUp/shadow/commit/ec6e55a659ac42306f7399a3661e781d768eb6eb\"><code>ec6e55a</code></a>\nReplace system properties with buildConfig consts (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/GradleUp/shadow/issues/2082\">#2082</a>)</li>\n<li>Additional commits viewable in <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/GradleUp/shadow/compare/9.4.3...9.5.1\">compare\nview</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<br />\n\n\n[![Dependabot compatibility\nscore](https://dependabot-badges.githubapp.com/badges/compatibility_score?dependency-name=com.gradleup.shadow&package-manager=gradle&previous-version=9.4.3&new-version=9.5.1)](https://docs.github.com/en/github/managing-security-vulnerabili