P/blob/dev/CHANGES\">com.zaxxer:HikariCP''s\nchangelog</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>HikariCP Changes</p>\n<p>Changes in 7.1.0</p>\n<ul>\n<li>merged <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/brettwooldridge/HikariCP/issues/2402\">#2402</a>\navoid virtual-thread yield spin in ConcurrentBag. Thanks to <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ittaigolde\"><code>@​ittaigolde</code></a> for\naddressing this and deep\ninvestigation into the issue.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Changes in 7.0.2</p>\n<ul>\n<li>decrease thread yield frequency in ConcurrentBag.unreserve()</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Changes in 7.0.1</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>merged <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/brettwooldridge/HikariCP/issues/2346\">#2346</a>\nfix regression with setSchema behavior</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>decrease thread yield frequency in ConcurrentBag.requite()</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Changes in 7.0.0</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>merged <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/brettwooldridge/HikariCP/issues/2340\">#2340</a>\nNoSuchMethodException error that is thrown when setting a metric\nregistry, fixes to UtilityElf\nreflection code to use the correct method signature.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>fixed <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/brettwooldridge/HikariCP/issues/1294\">#1294</a>\nadd support for HikariCredentialsProvider class</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>fixed <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/brettwooldridge/HikariCP/issues/2265\">#2265</a>\nbail out of the pool filling loop if the thread is interrupted</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Changes in 6.3.3</p>\n<ul>\n<li>backport <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/brettwooldridge/HikariCP/issues/2340\">#2340</a>\nNoSuchMethodException error that is thrown when setting a metric\nregistry, fixes to UtilityElf\nreflection code to use the correct method signature.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Changes in 6.3.2</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>fixed <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/brettwooldridge/HikariCP/issues/2342\">#2342</a>\nrestore module-info.class to jar file, which was lost in 6.3.1</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>fixed <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/brettwooldridge/HikariCP/issues/2256\">#2256</a>\nadd support for legacy override of getUsername()/getPassword() of\nHikariDataSource. See project page\nfor documentation of system property\ncom.zaxxer.hikari.legacy.supportUserPassDataSourceOverride.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>fixed <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/brettwooldridge/HikariCP/issues/2323\">#2323</a>\nright or wrong (wrt driver behavior) return to previous\nConnection.get/setSchema behavior</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>fixed <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/brettwooldridge/HikariCP/issues/2288\">#2288</a>\nupgrade dependencies and fix build warnings</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Changes in 6.3.1</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>fixed <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/brettwooldridge/HikariCP/issues/2315\">#2315</a>\nsource jar contains also binary .class files and missing some .java\nfiles</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>fixed <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/brettwooldridge/HikariCP/issues/2307\">#2307</a>\nremove improper hardcoded timout, use validationTimeout</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>fixed <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/brettwooldridge/HikariCP/issues/2305\">#2305</a>\nkeep properties key and values as is rather than forcing\nstringification. Also fixes <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/brettwooldridge/HikariCP/issues/2286\">#2286</a>\nand <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/brettwooldridge/HikariCP/issues/2304\">#2304</a></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- raw HTML omitted -->\n</blockquote>\n<p>... (truncated)</p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/brettwooldridge/HikariCP/commit/e4c04e8b6d33790e7769608c8f5fa0a6921d7c8f\"><code>e4c04e8</code></a>\n[maven-release-plugin] prepare release HikariCP-7.1.0</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/brettwooldridge/HikariCP/commit/b7c5afe5d80817030db59f42e993f5fd488b1395\"><code>b7c5afe</code></a>\nupgrade fabric8 docker dependency for tests</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/brettwooldridge/HikariCP/commit/315ab1cbc2180ebb4be09bb9e7f9382185294153\"><code>315ab1c</code></a>\nupdate testcontainer dependency and postgresql test dependency</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/brettwooldridge/HikariCP/commit/a400521b35eab6a38b9bedde0c74090c19983e98\"><code>a400521</code></a>\nfix compiler warnings</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/brettwooldridge/HikariCP/commit/37167dcda10303f5e85a146337bf60fd8e93ee4e\"><code>37167dc</code></a>\nprepare for v7.1.0 release</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/brettwooldridge/HikariCP/commit/5e63223aa73a5b01215e148aa8d71715081d68d8\"><code>5e63223</code></a>\nAvoid virtual-thread yield spin in ConcurrentBag (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/brettwooldridge/HikariCP/issues/2402\">#2402</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/brettwooldridge/HikariCP/commit/bba167f0a28905e8e63083cd7b5cbf479263271a\"><code>bba167f</code></a>\nUpdate README.md</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/brettwooldridge/HikariCP/commit/62d720b29f227c50bd71d34032574fbbf45c8915\"><code>62d720b</code></a>\nupdate CHANGES for backport release 6.3.3, fix micrometrics dep\nversion</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/brettwooldridge/HikariCP/commit/c3a2473992644ce648df97f9e78131d5d8abf6f9\"><code>c3a2473</code></a>\nUpdate README.md</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/brettwooldridge/HikariCP/commit/25663efc462c5aeb8e474795c86448bdbc1885bc\"><code>25663ef</code></a>\n[maven-release-plugin] prepare for next development iteration</li>\n<li>See full diff in <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/brettwooldridge/HikariCP/compare/HikariCP-7.0.2...HikariCP-7.1.0\">compare\nview</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<br />\n\n\n[![Dependabot compatibility\nscore](https://dependabot-badges.githubapp.com/badges/compatibility_score?dependency-name=com.zaxxer:HikariCP&package-manager=gradle&previous-version=7.0.2&new-version=7.1.0)](https://docs.github.com/en/github/managing-security-vulnerabilities/about-dependabot-security-updates#about-comp