ter/wiki/1.17-Migration-Guide\">1.17\nmigration guide</a> and the release notes for <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/micrometer-metrics/micrometer/releases/tag/v1.17.0-RC1\">1.17.0-RC1</a>,\n<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/micrometer-metrics/micrometer/releases/tag/v1.17.0-M3\">1.17.0-M3</a>,\n<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/micrometer-metrics/micrometer/releases/tag/v1.17.0-M2\">1.17.0-M2</a>,\n<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/micrometer-metrics/micrometer/releases/tag/v1.17.0-M1\">1.17.0-M1</a>.</p>\n<h2>:lady_beetle: Bug Fixes</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>ArrayIndexOutOfBoundsException when using LongTaskTimer <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/micrometer-metrics/micrometer/issues/3877\">#3877</a></li>\n<li>Jetty 12''s TimedHandler marks some requests with outcome UNKNOWN <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/micrometer-metrics/micrometer/issues/7276\">#7276</a></li>\n<li>MeterRegistry closes HighCardinalityTagsDetector twice if the\nregistry is closed twice <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/micrometer-metrics/micrometer/issues/7409\">#7409</a></li>\n<li>Reduce allocation in HTTP server instrumentation <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/micrometer-metrics/micrometer/issues/7580\">#7580</a></li>\n<li>Reduce allocation in gRPC server convention <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/micrometer-metrics/micrometer/issues/7581\">#7581</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>:notebook_with_decorative_cover: Documentation</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Clarify time series produced by LongTaskTimer when using Prometheus\n<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/micrometer-metrics/micrometer/issues/6507\">#6507</a></li>\n<li>Document metrics that need to close the MeterBinder <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/micrometer-metrics/micrometer/issues/4624\">#4624</a></li>\n<li>Multigauge Documentation lacks overwrite=true <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/micrometer-metrics/micrometer/issues/4403\">#4403</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>:hammer: Dependency Upgrades</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Bump com.dynatrace.metric.util:dynatrace-metric-utils-java from\n2.4.0 to 2.5.0 <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/micrometer-metrics/micrometer/pull/7452\">#7452</a></li>\n<li>Bump com.google.auth:google-auth-library-oauth2-http from 1.43.0 to\n1.48.0 <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/micrometer-metrics/micrometer/pull/7397\">#7397</a></li>\n<li>Bump com.google.cloud:google-cloud-monitoring from 3.89.0 to 3.94.0\n<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/micrometer-metrics/micrometer/pull/7398\">#7398</a></li>\n<li>Bump com.google.cloud:libraries-bom from 26.79.0 to 26.83.0 <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/micrometer-metrics/micrometer/pull/7497\">#7497</a></li>\n<li>Bump com.netflix.spectator:spectator-reg-atlas from 1.9.6 to 1.9.9\n<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/micrometer-metrics/micrometer/pull/7552\">#7552</a></li>\n<li>Bump dropwizard-metrics from 4.2.38 to 4.2.39 <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/micrometer-metrics/micrometer/pull/7527\">#7527</a></li>\n<li>Bump io.prometheus:prometheus-metrics-bom from 1.5.1 to 1.7.0 <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/micrometer-metrics/micrometer/pull/7572\">#7572</a></li>\n<li>Bump software.amazon.awssdk:cloudwatch from 2.42.32 to 2.46.4 <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/micrometer-metrics/micrometer/pull/7494\">#7494</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>:heart: Contributors</h2>\n<p>Thank you to all the contributors who worked on this release:</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/blaspat\"><code>@​blaspat</code></a>, <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/codingkiddo\"><code>@​codingkiddo</code></a>, <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/izeye\"><code>@​izeye</code></a>, <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/jewoodev\"><code>@​jewoodev</code></a>, and <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/schiemon\"><code>@​schiemon</code></a></p>\n<h2>1.17.0-RC1</h2>\n<h2>:star: New Features</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Add meter for ForkJoinPool#getDelayedTaskCount <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/micrometer-metrics/micrometer/issues/6381\">#6381</a></li>\n<li>Add support for JDK 26''s MemoryPoolMXBean.getTotalGcCpuTime() <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/micrometer-metrics/micrometer/issues/7245\">#7245</a></li>\n<li>Clear the state of the ObservationValidator <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/micrometer-metrics/micrometer/pull/7337\">#7337</a></li>\n<li>Improve exemplars sizing and add exemplarsSize config <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/micrometer-metrics/micrometer/pull/7324\">#7324</a></li>\n<li>Log warning when a registry is added to composite after meter\nregistration <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/micrometer-metrics/micrometer/issues/6908\">#6908</a></li>\n<li>Treat OkHttp Request as non-nullable <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/micrometer-metrics/micrometer/pull/7388\">#7388</a></li>\n<li>Validate <code>Observation.Scope</code> closing when using\nTestObservationRegistry <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/micrometer-metrics/micrometer/issues/6329\">#6329</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>:lady_beetle: Bug Fixes</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Invalid reflection hint in micrometer-core for native GraalVM 25\nbuild <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/micrometer-metrics/micrometer/issues/7316\">#7316</a></li>\n<li>ObservationGrpcClientInterceptor throws NPE when NameResolver\nreturns empty authority <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/micrometer-metrics/micrometer/issues/7380\">#7380</a></li>\n</ul>\n<!-- raw HTML omitted -->\n</blockquote>\n<p>... (truncated)</p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/micrometer-metrics/micrometer/commit/8466feab03a1c6bdb9c2f854e3aa31affc52a356\"><code>8466fea</code></a>\nMerge branch ''1.16.x''</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/micrometer-metrics/micrometer/commit/fa2ed3265e1f423c2fc4bd5c582b459d0c2ab082\"><code>fa2ed32</code></a>\nMerge branch ''1.15.x'' into 1.16.x</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/micrometer-metrics/micrometer/commit/dc2e5e2ea33a41a271b4b40e796ef39f1ed056af\"><code>dc2e5e2</code></a>\nReduce allocation in gRPC server convention</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/micrometer-metrics/micrometer/commit/36da131525228188a36779a28471a76c79213dd4\"><code>36da131</code></a>\nReduce allocation in HTTP server instrumentation</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/micrometer-metrics/micrometer/commit/9591cb40a9bfb5ec0743da1dd9760d4e07a9dd70\"><code>9591cb4</code></a>\nBump com.uber.nullaway:nullaway from 0.13.5 to 0.13.6 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/micrometer-metrics/micrometer/issues/7575\">#7575</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/micrometer-metrics/micrometer/commit/7a92a446994b1a24c9994093ff460f2040bcbe76\"><code>7a92a44</code></a>\nBump software.amazon.awssdk:cloudwatch from 2.46.3 to 2.46.4 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/micrometer-metrics/micrometer/issues/7576\">#7576</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/micrometer-metrics/micrometer/commit/e11e7c6b3e579c607393905732d3b9b1f5863e95\"><code>e11e7c6</code></a>\nMerge branch ''1.16.x''</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/micrometer-metrics/micrometer/commit/d8e8bcb56b5c48cf015c56ea324cc4ebdea976fc\"><code>d8e8bcb</code></a>\nMerge branch ''1.15.x'' into 1.16.x</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/micrometer-metrics/micrometer/commit/cf6ac0231a6115420fcfcd90eb530ea327d1d98a\"><code>cf6ac02</code></a>\nReduce flakiness of PushMeterRegistryTest (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/micrometer-metrics/micrometer/issues/7574\">#7574</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/micrometer-metrics/micrometer/commit/d74759acf5de309aef7dd6cc862e37501866814c\"><code>d74759a</code></a>\nBump com.google.cloud:google-cloud-monitoring from 3.93.0 to 3.94.0 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/micrometer-metrics/micrometer/issues/7573\">#7573</a>)</li>\n<li>Additional commits viewable in <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/micrometer-metrics/micrometer/compare/v1.16.5...v1.17.0\">compare\nview</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<br />\n\n\n[![Dependabot compatibility\nscore](https://dependabot-badges.githubapp.co