ef3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/navikt/esyfovarsel/commits/8827732e2b724512f6e08b04a69c6a8b4737fef3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/29110?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/dependabot","id":49699333,"login":"dependabot[bot]","node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDk2OTkzMzM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/navikt/esyfovarsel/commits/07e8f70b25f946b404a9fb7a4f22d2dc92dc72a8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-21T16:09:35Z","email":"49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"dependabot[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-21T16:09:35Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore(deps): bump ktorVersion from 3.4.3 to 3.5.0 (#986)\n\nBumps `ktorVersion` from 3.4.3 to 3.5.0.\nUpdates `io.ktor:ktor-server-content-negotiation` from 3.4.3 to 3.5.0\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/releases\">io.ktor:ktor-server-content-negotiation''s\nreleases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>3.5.0</h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Published 14 May 2026</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8421\">KTOR-8421</a>\nRoute.contentType should support multiple ContentType</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-7961\">KTOR-7961</a> Add\nknown TDM headers to the HttpHeaders object</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9418\">KTOR-9418</a>\nSupport getAs from the root ApplicationConfig</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9559\">KTOR-9559</a> DNS\nconfiguration for the Apache5 client</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9554\">KTOR-9554</a> DNS\nconfiguration for OkHttp client engine</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9555\">KTOR-9555</a>\nCustom SSE heartbeat function</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8914\">KTOR-8914</a>\nDependency injection: read annotations in function references</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8300\">KTOR-8300</a>\nSessions: Add a way to create a user session shared for all user devices\nor look up sessions of the same user</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9521\">KTOR-9521</a>\nUpgrade to Kotlin 2.3.21</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9276\">KTOR-9276</a> Make\nDynamicProviderConfig.authenticateFunction suspend</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9491\">KTOR-9491</a>\nProvide parameter validation convenience functions</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9506\">KTOR-9506</a>\nOpenAPI: Support prefixItems in JsonSchema for tuple type\ndefinitions</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-470\">KTOR-470</a>\nAdd an option to not resend the session cookie if the session data\nwasn''t changed.</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9355\">KTOR-9355</a>\nDeprecate HttpHeaders.AcceptCharset</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-7659\">KTOR-7659</a> Make\nktor-network compatible with ES modules for nodejs</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9350\">KTOR-9350</a> JS:\nMake ES2015 the default target for tests</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-7578\">KTOR-7578</a>\nUpdate Digest authentication implementation according to RFC 7616</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Improvements</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9503\">KTOR-9503</a> The\nJacksonConverter.streamRequestBody property name is confusing</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9552\">KTOR-9552</a>\nDeprecation notice for io.ktor.server.auth.Principal does not explain\nwhat to use instead</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-7458\">KTOR-7458</a>\nJetty Jakarta: Provide an easy way to disable SNI hostname\nvalidation</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9354\">KTOR-9354</a>\nWebsockets: webSocket builder function should return a Route to be\ndescribable</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9488\">KTOR-9488</a>\nNonce and hex function performance optimizations</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Bugfixes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9524\">KTOR-9524</a>\nNetty response hangs after connection lost</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9542\">KTOR-9542</a>\nNetty: The request handler runs on worker event loop instead of call\nevent loop since 3.4.3</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9531\">KTOR-9531</a>\nNetty server intermittently drops requests after upgrading to 3.4.3</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8151\">KTOR-8151</a>\nMicrometerMetrics: &quot;MeterFilters configured after a Meter has been\nregistered&quot; warning when a metric is registered before installing\nthe plugin</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9411\">KTOR-9411</a>\nDarwin throws DarwinHttpRequestException instead of\nFrameTooBigException</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8320\">KTOR-8320</a>\nCallLogging: plugin usage in testApplication breaks console standard\noutput</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8906\">KTOR-8906</a>\nJackson, with request body streaming on, exhausts Dispatchers.IO</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8709\">KTOR-8709</a>\nWebsockets: Unable to close session with a custom CloseReason</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9567\">KTOR-9567</a>\nFlaky UnixSockets on Windows: WSAEOPNOTSUPP from bind()</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9183\">KTOR-9183</a> A\nclient call wrapped with <code>withTimeout</code> throws a generic\nCancellationException instead of TimeoutCancellationException</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8199\">KTOR-8199</a>\nAutoreloading: default watch patterns don''t match anything when project\npath contain spaces</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9549\">KTOR-9549</a>\nKotlin/JS: ktor-ktor-client-core.mjs is incompatible with Vite: toRaw\nnaming conflict</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9544\">KTOR-9544</a>\nApache: body channel not cancelled when caller scope is cancelled</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9546\">KTOR-9546</a>\nHttpClient: cancelling ByteReadChannel body does not propagate to\nengine</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-455\">KTOR-455</a>\nContent-Disposition additional parameters should be inside quotes</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9500\">KTOR-9500</a>\nRawSourceChannel returns false positive on awaitContent</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-646\">KTOR-646</a>\nNetty engine still print annoying exceptions</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9527\">KTOR-9527</a>\nCurl: Freeze when receiving large responses</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9460\">KTOR-9460</a>\nCurl: Can''t build shared library with Ktor 3.4.2</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9483\">KTOR-9483</a>\nCurl: backpressure implementation is never used</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- raw HTML omitted -->\n</blockquote>\n<p>... (truncated)</p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Changelog</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md\">io.ktor:ktor-server-content-negotiation''s\nchangelog</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h1>3.5.0</h1>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Published 14 May 2026</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8421\">KTOR-8421</a>\nRoute.contentType should support multiple ContentType</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-7961\">KTOR-7961</a> Add\nknown TDM headers to the HttpHeaders object</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9418\">KTOR-9418</a>\nSupport getAs from the root ApplicationConfig</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9559\">KTOR-9559</a> DNS\nconfiguration for the Apache5 client</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9554\">KTOR-9554</a> DNS\nconfiguration for OkHttp client engine</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9555\">KTOR-9555</a>\nCustom SSE heartbeat function</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8914\">KTOR-8914</a>\nDependency injection: read annotations in function references</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8300\">KTOR-8300</a>\nSessions: Add a way to create a user session shared for all user devices\nor look up sessions of the same user</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9521\">KTOR-9521</a>\nUpgrade to Kotlin 2.3.21</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9276\">KTOR-9276</a> Make\nDynamicProviderConfig.authenticateFunction suspend</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9491\">KTOR-9491</a>\nProvide parameter validation convenience functions</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9506\">KTOR-9506</a>\nOpenAPI: Support prefixItems in JsonSchema for tuple type\ndefinitions</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-470\">KTOR-470</a>\nAdd an option to not resend the session cookie if the session data\nwasn''t changed.</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9355\">KTOR-9355</a>\nDeprecate HttpHeaders.AcceptCharset</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-7659\">KTOR-7659</a> Make\nktor-network compatible with ES modules for nodejs</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9350\">KTOR-9350</a> JS:\nMake ES2015 the default target for tests</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-7578\">KTOR-7578</a>\nUpdate Digest authentication implementation according to RFC 7616</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Improvements</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9503\">KTOR-9503</a> The\nJacksonConverter.streamRequestBody property name is confusing</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9552\">KTOR-9552</a>\nDeprecation notice for io.ktor.server.auth.Principal does not explain\nwhat to use instead</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-7458\">KTOR-7458</a>\nJetty Jakarta: Provide an easy way to disable SNI hostname\nvalidation</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9354\">KTOR-9354</a>\nWebsockets: webSocket builder function should return a Route to be\ndescribable</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9488\">KTOR-9488</a>\nNonce and hex function performance optimizations</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Bugfixes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9524\">KTOR-9524</a>\nNetty response hangs after connection lost</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9542\">KTOR-9542</a>\nNetty: The request handler runs on worker event loop instead of call\nevent loop since 3.4.3</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9531\">KTOR-9531</a>\nNetty server intermittently drops requests after upgrading to 3.4.3</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8151\">KTOR-8151</a>\nMicrometerMetrics: &quot;MeterFilters configured after a Meter has been\nregistered&quot; warning when a metric is registered before installing\nthe plugin</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9411\">KTOR-9411</a>\nDarwin throws DarwinHttpRequestException instead of\nFrameTooBigException</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8320\">KTOR-8320</a>\nCallLogging: plugin usage in testApplication breaks console standard\noutput</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8906\">KTOR-8906</a>\nJackson, with request body streaming on, exhausts Dispatchers.IO</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8709\">KTOR-8709</a>\nWebsockets: Unable to close session with a custom CloseReason</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9567\">KTOR-9567</a>\nFlaky UnixSockets on Windows: WSAEOPNOTSUPP from bind()</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9183\">KTOR-9183</a> A\nclient call wrapped with <code>withTimeout</code> throws a generic\nCancellationException instead of TimeoutCancellationException</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8199\">KTOR-8199</a>\nAutoreloading: default watch patterns don''t match anything when project\npath contain spaces</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9549\">KTOR-9549</a>\nKotlin/JS: ktor-ktor-client-core.mjs is incompatible with Vite: toRaw\nnaming conflict</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9544\">KTOR-9544</a>\nApache: body channel not cancelled when caller scope is cancelled</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9546\">KTOR-9546</a>\nHttpClient: cancelling ByteReadChannel body does not propagate to\nengine</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-455\">KTOR-455</a>\nContent-Disposition additional parameters should be inside quotes</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9500\">KTOR-9500</a>\nRawSourceChannel returns false positive on awaitContent</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-646\">KTOR-646</a>\nNetty engine still print annoying exceptions</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9527\">KTOR-9527</a>\nCurl: Freeze when receiving large responses</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9460\">KTOR-9460</a>\nCurl: Can''t build shared library with Ktor 3.4.2</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9483\">KTOR-9483</a>\nCurl: backpressure implementation is never used</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- raw HTML omitted -->\n</blockquote>\n<p>... (truncated)</p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/commit/3ccad96fbb891469cdb5ff92b51a96bb6d6374c9\"><code>3ccad96</code></a>\nRelease 3.5.0 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/ktorio/ktor/issues/5612\">#5612</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/commit/decd09ffd35e23a2b3e4481f37b252000a8b7ec2\"><code>decd09f</code></a>\nUpdate report links (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/ktorio/ktor/issues/5616\">#5616</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/commit/ba5bbc5a7aafe0b909e9c40536153d02b7baa99c\"><code>ba5bbc5</code></a>\nRethrow cancellation in Digest.build (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/ktorio/ktor/issues/5618\">#5618</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/commit/165355954f7659ddd9c114381ea8eb592dee9cb7\"><code>1653559</code></a>\nUpdate kotlinx-serialization to v1.11.0</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/commit/eb593ac471b00f99c55090fb190a0ec5cdfa5115\"><code>eb593ac</code></a>\nUpdate kotlinx-coroutines to v1.11.0</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/commit/043d400e8140e1e2c46830463efb807f3669a313\"><code>043d400</code></a>\nUpdate dependency org.jetbrains.kotlinx:kotlinx-io-core to v0.9.0</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/commit/75a8324a98f38ca299ba8af7e4224a07cb78bc30\"><code>75a8324</code></a>\nUpdate dependency com.squareup.okio:okio to v3.17.0</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/commit/757c3da525695ae2e0b3f15b50145f50e57d08af\"><code>757c3da</code></a>\nUpdate dependency com.google.code.gson:gson to v2.14.0</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/commit/4b796859d1c189190d3fe964bf506d98356a5e0c\"><code>4b79685</code></a>\nUpdate dependency com.auth0:jwks-rsa to v0.24.0</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/commit/6fe542f9b102300921ce681afb48d38c5e3aac2d\"><code>6fe542f</code></a>\nUpdate tomcat.jakarta to v10.1.55</li>\n<li>Additional commits viewable in <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/compare/3.4.3...3.5.0\">compare\nview</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<br />\n\nUpdates `io.ktor:ktor-client-content-negotiation` from 3.4.3 to 3.5.0\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/releases\">io.ktor:ktor-client-content-negotiation''s\nreleases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>3.5.0</h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Published 14 May 2026</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8421\">KTOR-8421</a>\nRoute.contentType should support multiple ContentType</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-7961\">KTOR-7961</a> Add\nknown TDM headers to the HttpHeaders object</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9418\">KTOR-9418</a>\nSupport getAs from the root ApplicationConfig</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9559\">KTOR-9559</a> DNS\nconfiguration for the Apache5 client</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9554\">KTOR-9554</a> DNS\nconfiguration for OkHttp client engine</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9555\">KTOR-9555</a>\nCustom SSE heartbeat function</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8914\">KTOR-8914</a>\nDependency injection: read annotations in function references</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8300\">KTOR-8300</a>\nSessions: Add a way to create a user session shared for all user devices\nor look up sessions of the same user</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9521\">KTOR-9521</a>\nUpgrade to Kotlin 2.3.21</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9276\">KTOR-9276</a> Make\nDynamicProviderConfig.authenticateFunction suspend</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9491\">KTOR-9491</a>\nProvide parameter validation convenience functions</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9506\">KTOR-9506</a>\nOpenAPI: Support prefixItems in JsonSchema for tuple type\ndefinitions</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-470\">KTOR-470</a>\nAdd an option to not resend the session cookie if the session data\nwasn''t changed.</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9355\">KTOR-9355</a>\nDeprecate HttpHeaders.AcceptCharset</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-7659\">KTOR-7659</a> Make\nktor-network compatible with ES modules for nodejs</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9350\">KTOR-9350</a> JS:\nMake ES2015 the default target for tests</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-7578\">KTOR-7578</a>\nUpdate Digest authentication implementation according to RFC 7616</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Improvements</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9503\">KTOR-9503</a> The\nJacksonConverter.streamRequestBody property name is confusing</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9552\">KTOR-9552</a>\nDeprecation notice for io.ktor.server.auth.Principal does not explain\nwhat to use instead</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-7458\">KTOR-7458</a>\nJetty Jakarta: Provide an easy way to disable SNI hostname\nvalidation</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9354\">KTOR-9354</a>\nWebsockets: webSocket builder function should return a Route to be\ndescribable</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9488\">KTOR-9488</a>\nNonce and hex function performance optimizations</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Bugfixes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9524\">KTOR-9524</a>\nNetty response hangs after connection lost</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9542\">KTOR-9542</a>\nNetty: The request handler runs on worker event loop instead of call\nevent loop since 3.4.3</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9531\">KTOR-9531</a>\nNetty server intermittently drops requests after upgrading to 3.4.3</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8151\">KTOR-8151</a>\nMicrometerMetrics: &quot;MeterFilters configured after a Meter has been\nregistered&quot; warning when a metric is registered before installing\nthe plugin</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9411\">KTOR-9411</a>\nDarwin throws DarwinHttpRequestException instead of\nFrameTooBigException</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8320\">KTOR-8320</a>\nCallLogging: plugin usage in testApplication breaks console standard\noutput</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8906\">KTOR-8906</a>\nJackson, with request body streaming on, exhausts Dispatchers.IO</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8709\">KTOR-8709</a>\nWebsockets: Unable to close session with a custom CloseReason</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9567\">KTOR-9567</a>\nFlaky UnixSockets on Windows: WSAEOPNOTSUPP from bind()</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9183\">KTOR-9183</a> A\nclient call wrapped with <code>withTimeout</code> throws a generic\nCancellationException instead of TimeoutCancellationException</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8199\">KTOR-8199</a>\nAutoreloading: default watch patterns don''t match anything when project\npath contain spaces</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9549\">KTOR-9549</a>\nKotlin/JS: ktor-ktor-client-core.mjs is incompatible with Vite: toRaw\nnaming conflict</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9544\">KTOR-9544</a>\nApache: body channel not cancelled when caller scope is cancelled</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9546\">KTOR-9546</a>\nHttpClient: cancelling ByteReadChannel body does not propagate to\nengine</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-455\">KTOR-455</a>\nContent-Disposition additional parameters should be inside quotes</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9500\">KTOR-9500</a>\nRawSourceChannel returns false positive on awaitContent</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-646\">KTOR-646</a>\nNetty engine still print annoying exceptions</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9527\">KTOR-9527</a>\nCurl: Freeze when receiving large responses</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9460\">KTOR-9460</a>\nCurl: Can''t build shared library with Ktor 3.4.2</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9483\">KTOR-9483</a>\nCurl: backpressure implementation is never used</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- raw HTML omitted -->\n</blockquote>\n<p>... (truncated)</p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Changelog</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md\">io.ktor:ktor-client-content-negotiation''s\nchangelog</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h1>3.5.0</h1>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Published 14 May 2026</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8421\">KTOR-8421</a>\nRoute.contentType should support multiple ContentType</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-7961\">KTOR-7961</a> Add\nknown TDM headers to the HttpHeaders object</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9418\">KTOR-9418</a>\nSupport getAs from the root ApplicationConfig</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9559\">KTOR-9559</a> DNS\nconfiguration for the Apache5 client</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9554\">KTOR-9554</a> DNS\nconfiguration for OkHttp client engine</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9555\">KTOR-9555</a>\nCustom SSE heartbeat function</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8914\">KTOR-8914</a>\nDependency injection: read annotations in function references</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8300\">KTOR-8300</a>\nSessions: Add a way to create a user session shared for all user devices\nor look up sessions of the same user</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9521\">KTOR-9521</a>\nUpgrade to Kotlin 2.3.21</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9276\">KTOR-9276</a> Make\nDynamicProviderConfig.authenticateFunction suspend</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9491\">KTOR-9491</a>\nProvide parameter validation convenience functions</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9506\">KTOR-9506</a>\nOpenAPI: Support prefixItems in JsonSchema for tuple type\ndefinitions</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-470\">KTOR-470</a>\nAdd an option to not resend the session cookie if the session data\nwasn''t changed.</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9355\">KTOR-9355</a>\nDeprecate HttpHeaders.AcceptCharset</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-7659\">KTOR-7659</a> Make\nktor-network compatible with ES modules for nodejs</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9350\">KTOR-9350</a> JS:\nMake ES2015 the default target for tests</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-7578\">KTOR-7578</a>\nUpdate Digest authentication implementation according to RFC 7616</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Improvements</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9503\">KTOR-9503</a> The\nJacksonConverter.streamRequestBody property name is confusing</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9552\">KTOR-9552</a>\nDeprecation notice for io.ktor.server.auth.Principal does not explain\nwhat to use instead</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-7458\">KTOR-7458</a>\nJetty Jakarta: Provide an easy way to disable SNI hostname\nvalidation</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9354\">KTOR-9354</a>\nWebsockets: webSocket builder function should return a Route to be\ndescribable</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9488\">KTOR-9488</a>\nNonce and hex function performance optimizations</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Bugfixes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9524\">KTOR-9524</a>\nNetty response hangs after connection lost</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9542\">KTOR-9542</a>\nNetty: The request handler runs on worker event loop instead of call\nevent loop since 3.4.3</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9531\">KTOR-9531</a>\nNetty server intermittently drops requests after upgrading to 3.4.3</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8151\">KTOR-8151</a>\nMicrometerMetrics: &quot;MeterFilters configured after a Meter has been\nregistered&quot; warning when a metric is registered before installing\nthe plugin</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9411\">KTOR-9411</a>\nDarwin throws DarwinHttpRequestException instead of\nFrameTooBigException</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8320\">KTOR-8320</a>\nCallLogging: plugin usage in testApplication breaks console standard\noutput</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8906\">KTOR-8906</a>\nJackson, with request body streaming on, exhausts Dispatchers.IO</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8709\">KTOR-8709</a>\nWebsockets: Unable to close session with a custom CloseReason</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9567\">KTOR-9567</a>\nFlaky UnixSockets on Windows: WSAEOPNOTSUPP from bind()</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9183\">KTOR-9183</a> A\nclient call wrapped with <code>withTimeout</code> throws a generic\nCancellationException instead of TimeoutCancellationException</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8199\">KTOR-8199</a>\nAutoreloading: default watch patterns don''t match anything when project\npath contain spaces</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9549\">KTOR-9549</a>\nKotlin/JS: ktor-ktor-client-core.mjs is incompatible with Vite: toRaw\nnaming conflict</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9544\">KTOR-9544</a>\nApache: body channel not cancelled when caller scope is cancelled</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9546\">KTOR-9546</a>\nHttpClient: cancelling ByteReadChannel body does not propagate to\nengine</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-455\">KTOR-455</a>\nContent-Disposition additional parameters should be inside quotes</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9500\">KTOR-9500</a>\nRawSourceChannel returns false positive on awaitContent</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-646\">KTOR-646</a>\nNetty engine still print annoying exceptions</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9527\">KTOR-9527</a>\nCurl: Freeze when receiving large responses</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9460\">KTOR-9460</a>\nCurl: Can''t build shared library with Ktor 3.4.2</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9483\">KTOR-9483</a>\nCurl: backpressure implementation is never used</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- raw HTML omitted -->\n</blockquote>\n<p>... (truncated)</p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/commit/3ccad96fbb891469cdb5ff92b51a96bb6d6374c9\"><code>3ccad96</code></a>\nRelease 3.5.0 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/ktorio/ktor/issues/5612\">#5612</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/commit/decd09ffd35e23a2b3e4481f37b252000a8b7ec2\"><code>decd09f</code></a>\nUpdate report links (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/ktorio/ktor/issues/5616\">#5616</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/commit/ba5bbc5a7aafe0b909e9c40536153d02b7baa99c\"><code>ba5bbc5</code></a>\nRethrow cancellation in Digest.build (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/ktorio/ktor/issues/5618\">#5618</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/commit/165355954f7659ddd9c114381ea8eb592dee9cb7\"><code>1653559</code></a>\nUpdate kotlinx-serialization to v1.11.0</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/commit/eb593ac471b00f99c55090fb190a0ec5cdfa5115\"><code>eb593ac</code></a>\nUpdate kotlinx-coroutines to v1.11.0</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/commit/043d400e8140e1e2c46830463efb807f3669a313\"><code>043d400</code></a>\nUpdate dependency org.jetbrains.kotlinx:kotlinx-io-core to v0.9.0</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/commit/75a8324a98f38ca299ba8af7e4224a07cb78bc30\"><code>75a8324</code></a>\nUpdate dependency com.squareup.okio:okio to v3.17.0</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/commit/757c3da525695ae2e0b3f15b50145f50e57d08af\"><code>757c3da</code></a>\nUpdate dependency com.google.code.gson:gson to v2.14.0</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/commit/4b796859d1c189190d3fe964bf506d98356a5e0c\"><code>4b79685</code></a>\nUpdate dependency com.auth0:jwks-rsa to v0.24.0</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/commit/6fe542f9b102300921ce681afb48d38c5e3aac2d\"><code>6fe542f</code></a>\nUpdate tomcat.jakarta to v10.1.55</li>\n<li>Additional commits viewable in <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/compare/3.4.3...3.5.0\">compare\nview</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<br />\n\nUpdates `io.ktor:ktor-serialization-jackson` from 3.4.3 to 3.5.0\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/releases\">io.ktor:ktor-serialization-jackson''s\nreleases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>3.5.0</h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Published 14 May 2026</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8421\">KTOR-8421</a>\nRoute.contentType should support multiple ContentType</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-7961\">KTOR-7961</a> Add\nknown TDM headers to the HttpHeaders object</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9418\">KTOR-9418</a>\nSupport getAs from the root ApplicationConfig</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9559\">KTOR-9559</a> DNS\nconfiguration for the Apache5 client</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9554\">KTOR-9554</a> DNS\nconfiguration for OkHttp client engine</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9555\">KTOR-9555</a>\nCustom SSE heartbeat function</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8914\">KTOR-8914</a>\nDependency injection: read annotations in function references</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8300\">KTOR-8300</a>\nSessions: Add a way to create a user session shared for all user devices\nor look up sessions of the same user</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9521\">KTOR-9521</a>\nUpgrade to Kotlin 2.3.21</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9276\">KTOR-9276</a> Make\nDynamicProviderConfig.authenticateFunction suspend</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9491\">KTOR-9491</a>\nProvide parameter validation convenience functions</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9506\">KTOR-9506</a>\nOpenAPI: Support prefixItems in JsonSchema for tuple type\ndefinitions</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-470\">KTOR-470</a>\nAdd an option to not resend the session cookie if the session data\nwasn''t changed.</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9355\">KTOR-9355</a>\nDeprecate HttpHeaders.AcceptCharset</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-7659\">KTOR-7659</a> Make\nktor-network compatible with ES modules for nodejs</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9350\">KTOR-9350</a> JS:\nMake ES2015 the default target for tests</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-7578\">KTOR-7578</a>\nUpdate Digest authentication implementation according to RFC 7616</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Improvements</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9503\">KTOR-9503</a> The\nJacksonConverter.streamRequestBody property name is confusing</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9552\">KTOR-9552</a>\nDeprecation notice for io.ktor.server.auth.Principal does not explain\nwhat to use instead</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-7458\">KTOR-7458</a>\nJetty Jakarta: Provide an easy way to disable SNI hostname\nvalidation</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9354\">KTOR-9354</a>\nWebsockets: webSocket builder function should return a Route to be\ndescribable</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9488\">KTOR-9488</a>\nNonce and hex function performance optimizations</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Bugfixes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9524\">KTOR-9524</a>\nNetty response hangs after connection lost</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9542\">KTOR-9542</a>\nNetty: The request handler runs on worker event loop instead of call\nevent loop since 3.4.3</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9531\">KTOR-9531</a>\nNetty server intermittently drops requests after upgrading to 3.4.3</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8151\">KTOR-8151</a>\nMicrometerMetrics: &quot;MeterFilters configured after a Meter has been\nregistered&quot; warning when a metric is registered before installing\nthe plugin</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9411\">KTOR-9411</a>\nDarwin throws DarwinHttpRequestException instead of\nFrameTooBigException</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8320\">KTOR-8320</a>\nCallLogging: plugin usage in testApplication breaks console standard\noutput</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8906\">KTOR-8906</a>\nJackson, with request body streaming on, exhausts Dispatchers.IO</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8709\">KTOR-8709</a>\nWebsockets: Unable to close session with a custom CloseReason</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9567\">KTOR-9567</a>\nFlaky UnixSockets on Windows: WSAEOPNOTSUPP from bind()</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9183\">KTOR-9183</a> A\nclient call wrapped with <code>withTimeout</code> throws a generic\nCancellationException instead of TimeoutCancellationException</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8199\">KTOR-8199</a>\nAutoreloading: default watch patterns don''t match anything when project\npath contain spaces</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9549\">KTOR-9549</a>\nKotlin/JS: ktor-ktor-client-core.mjs is incompatible with Vite: toRaw\nnaming conflict</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9544\">KTOR-9544</a>\nApache: body channel not cancelled when caller scope is cancelled</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9546\">KTOR-9546</a>\nHttpClient: cancelling ByteReadChannel body does not propagate to\nengine</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-455\">KTOR-455</a>\nContent-Disposition additional parameters should be inside quotes</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9500\">KTOR-9500</a>\nRawSourceChannel returns false positive on awaitContent</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-646\">KTOR-646</a>\nNetty engine still print annoying exceptions</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9527\">KTOR-9527</a>\nCurl: Freeze when receiving large responses</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9460\">KTOR-9460</a>\nCurl: Can''t build shared library with Ktor 3.4.2</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9483\">KTOR-9483</a>\nCurl: backpressure implementation is never used</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- raw HTML omitted -->\n</blockquote>\n<p>... (truncated)</p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Changelog</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md\">io.ktor:ktor-serialization-jackson''s\nchangelog</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h1>3.5.0</h1>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Published 14 May 2026</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8421\">KTOR-8421</a>\nRoute.contentType should support multiple ContentType</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-7961\">KTOR-7961</a> Add\nknown TDM headers to the HttpHeaders object</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9418\">KTOR-9418</a>\nSupport getAs from the root ApplicationConfig</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9559\">KTOR-9559</a> DNS\nconfiguration for the Apache5 client</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9554\">KTOR-9554</a> DNS\nconfiguration for OkHttp client engine</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9555\">KTOR-9555</a>\nCustom SSE heartbeat function</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8914\">KTOR-8914</a>\nDependency injection: read annotations in function references</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8300\">KTOR-8300</a>\nSessions: Add a way to create a user session shared for all user devices\nor look up sessions of the same user</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9521\">KTOR-9521</a>\nUpgrade to Kotlin 2.3.21</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9276\">KTOR-9276</a> Make\nDynamicProviderConfig.authenticateFunction suspend</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9491\">KTOR-9491</a>\nProvide parameter validation convenience functions</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9506\">KTOR-9506</a>\nOpenAPI: Support prefixItems in JsonSchema for tuple type\ndefinitions</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-470\">KTOR-470</a>\nAdd an option to not resend the session cookie if the session data\nwasn''t changed.</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9355\">KTOR-9355</a>\nDeprecate HttpHeaders.AcceptCharset</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-7659\">KTOR-7659</a> Make\nktor-network compatible with ES modules for nodejs</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9350\">KTOR-9350</a> JS:\nMake ES2015 the default target for tests</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-7578\">KTOR-7578</a>\nUpdate Digest authentication implementation according to RFC 7616</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Improvements</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9503\">KTOR-9503</a> The\nJacksonConverter.streamRequestBody property name is confusing</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9552\">KTOR-9552</a>\nDeprecation notice for io.ktor.server.auth.Principal does not explain\nwhat to use instead</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-7458\">KTOR-7458</a>\nJetty Jakarta: Provide an easy way to disable SNI hostname\nvalidation</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9354\">KTOR-9354</a>\nWebsockets: webSocket builder function should return a Route to be\ndescribable</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9488\">KTOR-9488</a>\nNonce and hex function performance optimizations</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Bugfixes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9524\">KTOR-9524</a>\nNetty response hangs after connection lost</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9542\">KTOR-9542</a>\nNetty: The request handler runs on worker event loop instead of call\nevent loop since 3.4.3</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9531\">KTOR-9531</a>\nNetty server intermittently drops requests after upgrading to 3.4.3</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8151\">KTOR-8151</a>\nMicrometerMetrics: &quot;MeterFilters configured after a Meter has been\nregistered&quot; warning when a metric is registered before installing\nthe plugin</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9411\">KTOR-9411</a>\nDarwin throws DarwinHttpRequestException instead of\nFrameTooBigException</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8320\">KTOR-8320</a>\nCallLogging: plugin usage in testApplication breaks console standard\noutput</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8906\">KTOR-8906</a>\nJackson, with request body streaming on, exhausts Dispatchers.IO</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8709\">KTOR-8709</a>\nWebsockets: Unable to close session with a custom CloseReason</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9567\">KTOR-9567</a>\nFlaky UnixSockets on Windows: WSAEOPNOTSUPP from bind()</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9183\">KTOR-9183</a> A\nclient call wrapped with <code>withTimeout</code> throws a generic\nCancellationException instead of TimeoutCancellationException</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8199\">KTOR-8199</a>\nAutoreloading: default watch patterns don''t match anything when project\npath contain spaces</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9549\">KTOR-9549</a>\nKotlin/JS: ktor-ktor-client-core.mjs is incompatible with Vite: toRaw\nnaming conflict</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9544\">KTOR-9544</a>\nApache: body channel not cancelled when caller scope is cancelled</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9546\">KTOR-9546</a>\nHttpClient: cancelling ByteReadChannel body does not propagate to\nengine</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-455\">KTOR-455</a>\nContent-Disposition additional parameters should be inside quotes</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9500\">KTOR-9500</a>\nRawSourceChannel returns false positive on awaitContent</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-646\">KTOR-646</a>\nNetty engine still print annoying exceptions</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9527\">KTOR-9527</a>\nCurl: Freeze when receiving large responses</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9460\">KTOR-9460</a>\nCurl: Can''t build shared library with Ktor 3.4.2</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9483\">KTOR-9483</a>\nCurl: backpressure implementation is never used</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- raw HTML omitted -->\n</blockquote>\n<p>... (truncated)</p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/commit/3ccad96fbb891469cdb5ff92b51a96bb6d6374c9\"><code>3ccad96</code></a>\nRelease 3.5.0 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/ktorio/ktor/issues/5612\">#5612</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/commit/decd09ffd35e23a2b3e4481f37b252000a8b7ec2\"><code>decd09f</code></a>\nUpdate report links (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/ktorio/ktor/issues/5616\">#5616</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/commit/ba5bbc5a7aafe0b909e9c40536153d02b7baa99c\"><code>ba5bbc5</code></a>\nRethrow cancellation in Digest.build (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/ktorio/ktor/issues/5618\">#5618</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/commit/165355954f7659ddd9c114381ea8eb592dee9cb7\"><code>1653559</code></a>\nUpdate kotlinx-serialization to v1.11.0</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/commit/eb593ac471b00f99c55090fb190a0ec5cdfa5115\"><code>eb593ac</code></a>\nUpdate kotlinx-coroutines to v1.11.0</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/commit/043d400e8140e1e2c46830463efb807f3669a313\"><code>043d400</code></a>\nUpdate dependency org.jetbrains.kotlinx:kotlinx-io-core to v0.9.0</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/commit/75a8324a98f38ca299ba8af7e4224a07cb78bc30\"><code>75a8324</code></a>\nUpdate dependency com.squareup.okio:okio to v3.17.0</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/commit/757c3da525695ae2e0b3f15b50145f50e57d08af\"><code>757c3da</code></a>\nUpdate dependency com.google.code.gson:gson to v2.14.0</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/commit/4b796859d1c189190d3fe964bf506d98356a5e0c\"><code>4b79685</code></a>\nUpdate dependency com.auth0:jwks-rsa to v0.24.0</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/commit/6fe542f9b102300921ce681afb48d38c5e3aac2d\"><code>6fe542f</code></a>\nUpdate tomcat.jakarta to v10.1.55</li>\n<li>Additional commits viewable in <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/compare/3.4.3...3.5.0\">compare\nview</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<br />\n\nUpdates `io.ktor:ktor-server-auth` from 3.4.3 to 3.5.0\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/releases\">io.ktor:ktor-server-auth''s\nreleases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>3.5.0</h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Published 14 May 2026</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8421\">KTOR-8421</a>\nRoute.contentType should support multiple ContentType</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-7961\">KTOR-7961</a> Add\nknown TDM headers to the HttpHeaders object</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9418\">KTOR-9418</a>\nSupport getAs from the root ApplicationConfig</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9559\">KTOR-9559</a> DNS\nconfiguration for the Apache5 client</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9554\">KTOR-9554</a> DNS\nconfiguration for OkHttp client engine</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9555\">KTOR-9555</a>\nCustom SSE heartbeat function</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8914\">KTOR-8914</a>\nDependency injection: read annotations in function references</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8300\">KTOR-8300</a>\nSessions: Add a way to create a user session shared for all user devices\nor look up sessions of the same user</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9521\">KTOR-9521</a>\nUpgrade to Kotlin 2.3.21</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9276\">KTOR-9276</a> Make\nDynamicProviderConfig.authenticateFunction suspend</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9491\">KTOR-9491</a>\nProvide parameter validation convenience functions</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9506\">KTOR-9506</a>\nOpenAPI: Support prefixItems in JsonSchema for tuple type\ndefinitions</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-470\">KTOR-470</a>\nAdd an option to not resend the session cookie if the session data\nwasn''t changed.</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9355\">KTOR-9355</a>\nDeprecate HttpHeaders.AcceptCharset</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-7659\">KTOR-7659</a> Make\nktor-network compatible with ES modules for nodejs</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9350\">KTOR-9350</a> JS:\nMake ES2015 the default target for tests</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-7578\">KTOR-7578</a>\nUpdate Digest authentication implementation according to RFC 7616</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Improvements</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9503\">KTOR-9503</a> The\nJacksonConverter.streamRequestBody property name is confusing</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9552\">KTOR-9552</a>\nDeprecation notice for io.ktor.server.auth.Principal does not explain\nwhat to use instead</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-7458\">KTOR-7458</a>\nJetty Jakarta: Provide an easy way to disable SNI hostname\nvalidation</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9354\">KTOR-9354</a>\nWebsockets: webSocket builder function should return a Route to be\ndescribable</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9488\">KTOR-9488</a>\nNonce and hex function performance optimizations</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Bugfixes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9524\">KTOR-9524</a>\nNetty response hangs after connection lost</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9542\">KTOR-9542</a>\nNetty: The request handler runs on worker event loop instead of call\nevent loop since 3.4.3</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9531\">KTOR-9531</a>\nNetty server intermittently drops requests after upgrading to 3.4.3</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8151\">KTOR-8151</a>\nMicrometerMetrics: &quot;MeterFilters configured after a Meter has been\nregistered&quot; warning when a metric is registered before installing\nthe plugin</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9411\">KTOR-9411</a>\nDarwin throws DarwinHttpRequestException instead of\nFrameTooBigException</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8320\">KTOR-8320</a>\nCallLogging: plugin usage in testApplication breaks console standard\noutput</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8906\">KTOR-8906</a>\nJackson, with request body streaming on, exhausts Dispatchers.IO</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8709\">KTOR-8709</a>\nWebsockets: Unable to close session with a custom CloseReason</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9567\">KTOR-9567</a>\nFlaky UnixSockets on Windows: WSAEOPNOTSUPP from bind()</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9183\">KTOR-9183</a> A\nclient call wrapped with <code>withTimeout</code> throws a generic\nCancellationException instead of TimeoutCancellationException</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8199\">KTOR-8199</a>\nAutoreloading: default watch patterns don''t match anything when project\npath contain spaces</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9549\">KTOR-9549</a>\nKotlin/JS: ktor-ktor-client-core.mjs is incompatible with Vite: toRaw\nnaming conflict</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9544\">KTOR-9544</a>\nApache: body channel not cancelled when caller scope is cancelled</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9546\">KTOR-9546</a>\nHttpClient: cancelling ByteReadChannel body does not propagate to\nengine</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-455\">KTOR-455</a>\nContent-Disposition additional parameters should be inside quotes</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9500\">KTOR-9500</a>\nRawSourceChannel returns false positive on awaitContent</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-646\">KTOR-646</a>\nNetty engine still print annoying exceptions</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9527\">KTOR-9527</a>\nCurl: Freeze when receiving large responses</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9460\">KTOR-9460</a>\nCurl: Can''t build shared library with Ktor 3.4.2</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9483\">KTOR-9483</a>\nCurl: backpressure implementation is never used</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- raw HTML omitted -->\n</blockquote>\n<p>... (truncated)</p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Changelog</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md\">io.ktor:ktor-server-auth''s\nchangelog</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h1>3.5.0</h1>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Published 14 May 2026</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8421\">KTOR-8421</a>\nRoute.contentType should support multiple ContentType</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-7961\">KTOR-7961</a> Add\nknown TDM headers to the HttpHeaders object</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9418\">KTOR-9418</a>\nSupport getAs from the root ApplicationConfig</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9559\">KTOR-9559</a> DNS\nconfiguration for the Apache5 client</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9554\">KTOR-9554</a> DNS\nconfiguration for OkHttp client engine</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9555\">KTOR-9555</a>\nCustom SSE heartbeat function</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8914\">KTOR-8914</a>\nDependency injection: read annotations in function references</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8300\">KTOR-8300</a>\nSessions: Add a way to create a user session shared for all user devices\nor look up sessions of the same user</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9521\">KTOR-9521</a>\nUpgrade to Kotlin 2.3.21</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9276\">KTOR-9276</a> Make\nDynamicProviderConfig.authenticateFunction suspend</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9491\">KTOR-9491</a>\nProvide parameter validation convenience functions</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9506\">KTOR-9506</a>\nOpenAPI: Support prefixItems in JsonSchema for tuple type\ndefinitions</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-470\">KTOR-470</a>\nAdd an option to not resend the session cookie if the session data\nwasn''t changed.</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9355\">KTOR-9355</a>\nDeprecate HttpHeaders.AcceptCharset</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-7659\">KTOR-7659</a> Make\nktor-network compatible with ES modules for nodejs</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9350\">KTOR-9350</a> JS:\nMake ES2015 the default target for tests</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-7578\">KTOR-7578</a>\nUpdate Digest authentication implementation according to RFC 7616</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Improvements</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9503\">KTOR-9503</a> The\nJacksonConverter.streamRequestBody property name is confusing</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9552\">KTOR-9552</a>\nDeprecation notice for io.ktor.server.auth.Principal does not explain\nwhat to use instead</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-7458\">KTOR-7458</a>\nJetty Jakarta: Provide an easy way to disable SNI hostname\nvalidation</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9354\">KTOR-9354</a>\nWebsockets: webSocket builder function should return a Route to be\ndescribable</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9488\">KTOR-9488</a>\nNonce and hex function performance optimizations</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Bugfixes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9524\">KTOR-9524</a>\nNetty response hangs after connection lost</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9542\">KTOR-9542</a>\nNetty: The request handler runs on worker event loop instead of call\nevent loop since 3.4.3</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9531\">KTOR-9531</a>\nNetty server intermittently drops requests after upgrading to 3.4.3</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8151\">KTOR-8151</a>\nMicrometerMetrics: &quot;MeterFilters configured after a Meter has been\nregistered&quot; warning when a metric is registered before installing\nthe plugin</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9411\">KTOR-9411</a>\nDarwin throws DarwinHttpRequestException instead of\nFrameTooBigException</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8320\">KTOR-8320</a>\nCallLogging: plugin usage in testApplication breaks console standard\noutput</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8906\">KTOR-8906</a>\nJackson, with request body streaming on, exhausts Dispatchers.IO</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8709\">KTOR-8709</a>\nWebsockets: Unable to close session with a custom CloseReason</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9567\">KTOR-9567</a>\nFlaky UnixSockets on Windows: WSAEOPNOTSUPP from bind()</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9183\">KTOR-9183</a> A\nclient call wrapped with <code>withTimeout</code> throws a generic\nCancellationException instead of TimeoutCancellationException</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8199\">KTOR-8199</a>\nAutoreloading: default watch patterns don''t match anything when project\npath contain spaces</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9549\">KTOR-9549</a>\nKotlin/JS: ktor-ktor-client-core.mjs is incompatible with Vite: toRaw\nnaming conflict</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9544\">KTOR-9544</a>\nApache: body channel not cancelled when caller scope is cancelled</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9546\">KTOR-9546</a>\nHttpClient: cancelling ByteReadChannel body does not propagate to\nengine</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-455\">KTOR-455</a>\nContent-Disposition additional parameters should be inside quotes</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9500\">KTOR-9500</a>\nRawSourceChannel returns false positive on awaitContent</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-646\">KTOR-646</a>\nNetty engine still print annoying exceptions</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9527\">KTOR-9527</a>\nCurl: Freeze when receiving large responses</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9460\">KTOR-9460</a>\nCurl: Can''t build shared library with Ktor 3.4.2</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9483\">KTOR-9483</a>\nCurl: backpressure implementation is never used</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- raw HTML omitted -->\n</blockquote>\n<p>... (truncated)</p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/commit/3ccad96fbb891469cdb5ff92b51a96bb6d6374c9\"><code>3ccad96</code></a>\nRelease 3.5.0 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/ktorio/ktor/issues/5612\">#5612</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/commit/decd09ffd35e23a2b3e4481f37b252000a8b7ec2\"><code>decd09f</code></a>\nUpdate report links (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/ktorio/ktor/issues/5616\">#5616</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/commit/ba5bbc5a7aafe0b909e9c40536153d02b7baa99c\"><code>ba5bbc5</code></a>\nRethrow cancellation in Digest.build (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/ktorio/ktor/issues/5618\">#5618</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/commit/165355954f7659ddd9c114381ea8eb592dee9cb7\"><code>1653559</code></a>\nUpdate kotlinx-serialization to v1.11.0</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/commit/eb593ac471b00f99c55090fb190a0ec5cdfa5115\"><code>eb593ac</code></a>\nUpdate kotlinx-coroutines to v1.11.0</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/commit/043d400e8140e1e2c46830463efb807f3669a313\"><code>043d400</code></a>\nUpdate dependency org.jetbrains.kotlinx:kotlinx-io-core to v0.9.0</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/commit/75a8324a98f38ca299ba8af7e4224a07cb78bc30\"><code>75a8324</code></a>\nUpdate dependency com.squareup.okio:okio to v3.17.0</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/commit/757c3da525695ae2e0b3f15b50145f50e57d08af\"><code>757c3da</code></a>\nUpdate dependency com.google.code.gson:gson to v2.14.0</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/commit/4b796859d1c189190d3fe964bf506d98356a5e0c\"><code>4b79685</code></a>\nUpdate dependency com.auth0:jwks-rsa to v0.24.0</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/commit/6fe542f9b102300921ce681afb48d38c5e3aac2d\"><code>6fe542f</code></a>\nUpdate tomcat.jakarta to v10.1.55</li>\n<li>Additional commits viewable in <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/compare/3.4.3...3.5.0\">compare\nview</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<br />\n\nUpdates `io.ktor:ktor-server-auth-jwt` from 3.4.3 to 3.5.0\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/releases\">io.ktor:ktor-server-auth-jwt''s\nreleases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>3.5.0</h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Published 14 May 2026</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8421\">KTOR-8421</a>\nRoute.contentType should support multiple ContentType</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-7961\">KTOR-7961</a> Add\nknown TDM headers to the HttpHeaders object</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9418\">KTOR-9418</a>\nSupport getAs from the root ApplicationConfig</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9559\">KTOR-9559</a> DNS\nconfiguration for the Apache5 client</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9554\">KTOR-9554</a> DNS\nconfiguration for OkHttp client engine</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9555\">KTOR-9555</a>\nCustom SSE heartbeat function</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8914\">KTOR-8914</a>\nDependency injection: read annotations in function references</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8300\">KTOR-8300</a>\nSessions: Add a way to create a user session shared for all user devices\nor look up sessions of the same user</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9521\">KTOR-9521</a>\nUpgrade to Kotlin 2.3.21</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9276\">KTOR-9276</a> Make\nDynamicProviderConfig.authenticateFunction suspend</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9491\">KTOR-9491</a>\nProvide parameter validation convenience functions</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9506\">KTOR-9506</a>\nOpenAPI: Support prefixItems in JsonSchema for tuple type\ndefinitions</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-470\">KTOR-470</a>\nAdd an option to not resend the session cookie if the session data\nwasn''t changed.</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9355\">KTOR-9355</a>\nDeprecate HttpHeaders.AcceptCharset</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-7659\">KTOR-7659</a> Make\nktor-network compatible with ES modules for nodejs</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9350\">KTOR-9350</a> JS:\nMake ES2015 the default target for tests</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-7578\">KTOR-7578</a>\nUpdate Digest authentication implementation according to RFC 7616</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Improvements</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9503\">KTOR-9503</a> The\nJacksonConverter.streamRequestBody property name is confusing</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9552\">KTOR-9552</a>\nDeprecation notice for io.ktor.server.auth.Principal does not explain\nwhat to use instead</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-7458\">KTOR-7458</a>\nJetty Jakarta: Provide an easy way to disable SNI hostname\nvalidation</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9354\">KTOR-9354</a>\nWebsockets: webSocket builder function should return a Route to be\ndescribable</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9488\">KTOR-9488</a>\nNonce and hex function performance optimizations</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Bugfixes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9524\">KTOR-9524</a>\nNetty response hangs after connection lost</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9542\">KTOR-9542</a>\nNetty: The request handler runs on worker event loop instead of call\nevent loop since 3.4.3</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9531\">KTOR-9531</a>\nNetty server intermittently drops requests after upgrading to 3.4.3</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8151\">KTOR-8151</a>\nMicrometerMetrics: &quot;MeterFilters configured after a Meter has been\nregistered&quot; warning when a metric is registered before installing\nthe plugin</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9411\">KTOR-9411</a>\nDarwin throws DarwinHttpRequestException instead of\nFrameTooBigException</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8320\">KTOR-8320</a>\nCallLogging: plugin usage in testApplication breaks console standard\noutput</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8906\">KTOR-8906</a>\nJackson, with request body streaming on, exhausts Dispatchers.IO</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8709\">KTOR-8709</a>\nWebsockets: Unable to close session with a custom CloseReason</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9567\">KTOR-9567</a>\nFlaky UnixSockets on Windows: WSAEOPNOTSUPP from bind()</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9183\">KTOR-9183</a> A\nclient call wrapped with <code>withTimeout</code> throws a generic\nCancel…","tree":{"sha":"8b7013fbd67c26f8542c39887cd7fe11ec37360b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/navikt/esyfovarsel/git/trees/8b7013fbd67c26f8542c39887cd7fe11ec37360b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/navikt/esyfovarsel/git/commits/07e8f70b25f946b404a9fb7a4f22d2dc92dc72a8","verification":{"payload":"tree 8b7013fbd67c26f8542c39887cd7fe11ec37360b\nparent 728d441054eb2a32b3590268abf1143b27e1cc11\nauthor dependabot[bot] <49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1779379775 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1779379775 +0000\n\nchore(deps): bump ktorVersion from 3.4.3 to 3.5.0 (#986)\n\nBumps `ktorVersion` from 3.4.3 to 3.5.0.\nUpdates `io.ktor:ktor-server-content-negotiation` from 3.4.3 to 3.5.0\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/releases\">io.ktor:ktor-server-content-negotiation''s\nreleases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>3.5.0</h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Published 14 May 2026</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8421\">KTOR-8421</a>\nRoute.contentType should support multiple ContentType</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-7961\">KTOR-7961</a> Add\nknown TDM headers to the HttpHeaders object</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9418\">KTOR-9418</a>\nSupport getAs from the root ApplicationConfig</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9559\">KTOR-9559</a> DNS\nconfiguration for the Apache5 client</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9554\">KTOR-9554</a> DNS\nconfiguration for OkHttp client engine</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9555\">KTOR-9555</a>\nCustom SSE heartbeat function</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8914\">KTOR-8914</a>\nDependency injection: read annotations in function references</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8300\">KTOR-8300</a>\nSessions: Add a way to create a user session shared for all user devices\nor look up sessions of the same user</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9521\">KTOR-9521</a>\nUpgrade to Kotlin 2.3.21</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9276\">KTOR-9276</a> Make\nDynamicProviderConfig.authenticateFunction suspend</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9491\">KTOR-9491</a>\nProvide parameter validation convenience functions</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9506\">KTOR-9506</a>\nOpenAPI: Support prefixItems in JsonSchema for tuple type\ndefinitions</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-470\">KTOR-470</a>\nAdd an option to not resend the session cookie if the session data\nwasn''t changed.</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9355\">KTOR-9355</a>\nDeprecate HttpHeaders.AcceptCharset</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-7659\">KTOR-7659</a> Make\nktor-network compatible with ES modules for nodejs</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9350\">KTOR-9350</a> JS:\nMake ES2015 the default target for tests</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-7578\">KTOR-7578</a>\nUpdate Digest authentication implementation according to RFC 7616</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Improvements</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9503\">KTOR-9503</a> The\nJacksonConverter.streamRequestBody property name is confusing</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9552\">KTOR-9552</a>\nDeprecation notice for io.ktor.server.auth.Principal does not explain\nwhat to use instead</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-7458\">KTOR-7458</a>\nJetty Jakarta: Provide an easy way to disable SNI hostname\nvalidation</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9354\">KTOR-9354</a>\nWebsockets: webSocket builder function should return a Route to be\ndescribable</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9488\">KTOR-9488</a>\nNonce and hex function performance optimizations</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Bugfixes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9524\">KTOR-9524</a>\nNetty response hangs after connection lost</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9542\">KTOR-9542</a>\nNetty: The request handler runs on worker event loop instead of call\nevent loop since 3.4.3</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9531\">KTOR-9531</a>\nNetty server intermittently drops requests after upgrading to 3.4.3</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8151\">KTOR-8151</a>\nMicrometerMetrics: &quot;MeterFilters configured after a Meter has been\nregistered&quot; warning when a metric is registered before installing\nthe plugin</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9411\">KTOR-9411</a>\nDarwin throws DarwinHttpRequestException instead of\nFrameTooBigException</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8320\">KTOR-8320</a>\nCallLogging: plugin usage in testApplication breaks console standard\noutput</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8906\">KTOR-8906</a>\nJackson, with request body streaming on, exhausts Dispatchers.IO</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8709\">KTOR-8709</a>\nWebsockets: Unable to close session with a custom CloseReason</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9567\">KTOR-9567</a>\nFlaky UnixSockets on Windows: WSAEOPNOTSUPP from bind()</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9183\">KTOR-9183</a> A\nclient call wrapped with <code>withTimeout</code> throws a generic\nCancellationException instead of TimeoutCancellationException</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8199\">KTOR-8199</a>\nAutoreloading: default watch patterns don''t match anything when project\npath contain spaces</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9549\">KTOR-9549</a>\nKotlin/JS: ktor-ktor-client-core.mjs is incompatible with Vite: toRaw\nnaming conflict</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9544\">KTOR-9544</a>\nApache: body channel not cancelled when caller scope is cancelled</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9546\">KTOR-9546</a>\nHttpClient: cancelling ByteReadChannel body does not propagate to\nengine</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-455\">KTOR-455</a>\nContent-Disposition additional parameters should be inside quotes</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9500\">KTOR-9500</a>\nRawSourceChannel returns false positive on awaitContent</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-646\">KTOR-646</a>\nNetty engine still print annoying exceptions</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9527\">KTOR-9527</a>\nCurl: Freeze when receiving large responses</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9460\">KTOR-9460</a>\nCurl: Can''t build shared library with Ktor 3.4.2</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9483\">KTOR-9483</a>\nCurl: backpressure implementation is never used</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- raw HTML omitted -->\n</blockquote>\n<p>... (truncated)</p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Changelog</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md\">io.ktor:ktor-server-content-negotiation''s\nchangelog</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h1>3.5.0</h1>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Published 14 May 2026</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8421\">KTOR-8421</a>\nRoute.contentType should support multiple ContentType</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-7961\">KTOR-7961</a> Add\nknown TDM headers to the HttpHeaders object</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9418\">KTOR-9418</a>\nSupport getAs from the root ApplicationConfig</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9559\">KTOR-9559</a> DNS\nconfiguration for the Apache5 client</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9554\">KTOR-9554</a> DNS\nconfiguration for OkHttp client engine</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9555\">KTOR-9555</a>\nCustom SSE heartbeat function</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8914\">KTOR-8914</a>\nDependency injection: read annotations in function references</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8300\">KTOR-8300</a>\nSessions: Add a way to create a user session shared for all user devices\nor look up sessions of the same user</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9521\">KTOR-9521</a>\nUpgrade to Kotlin 2.3.21</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9276\">KTOR-9276</a> Make\nDynamicProviderConfig.authenticateFunction suspend</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9491\">KTOR-9491</a>\nProvide parameter validation convenience functions</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9506\">KTOR-9506</a>\nOpenAPI: Support prefixItems in JsonSchema for tuple type\ndefinitions</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-470\">KTOR-470</a>\nAdd an option to not resend the session cookie if the session data\nwasn''t changed.</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9355\">KTOR-9355</a>\nDeprecate HttpHeaders.AcceptCharset</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-7659\">KTOR-7659</a> Make\nktor-network compatible with ES modules for nodejs</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9350\">KTOR-9350</a> JS:\nMake ES2015 the default target for tests</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-7578\">KTOR-7578</a>\nUpdate Digest authentication implementation according to RFC 7616</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Improvements</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9503\">KTOR-9503</a> The\nJacksonConverter.streamRequestBody property name is confusing</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9552\">KTOR-9552</a>\nDeprecation notice for io.ktor.server.auth.Principal does not explain\nwhat to use instead</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-7458\">KTOR-7458</a>\nJetty Jakarta: Provide an easy way to disable SNI hostname\nvalidation</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9354\">KTOR-9354</a>\nWebsockets: webSocket builder function should return a Route to be\ndescribable</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9488\">KTOR-9488</a>\nNonce and hex function performance optimizations</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Bugfixes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9524\">KTOR-9524</a>\nNetty response hangs after connection lost</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9542\">KTOR-9542</a>\nNetty: The request handler runs on worker event loop instead of call\nevent loop since 3.4.3</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9531\">KTOR-9531</a>\nNetty server intermittently drops requests after upgrading to 3.4.3</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8151\">KTOR-8151</a>\nMicrometerMetrics: &quot;MeterFilters configured after a Meter has been\nregistered&quot; warning when a metric is registered before installing\nthe plugin</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9411\">KTOR-9411</a>\nDarwin throws DarwinHttpRequestException instead of\nFrameTooBigException</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8320\">KTOR-8320</a>\nCallLogging: plugin usage in testApplication breaks console standard\noutput</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8906\">KTOR-8906</a>\nJackson, with request body streaming on, exhausts Dispatchers.IO</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8709\">KTOR-8709</a>\nWebsockets: Unable to close session with a custom CloseReason</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9567\">KTOR-9567</a>\nFlaky UnixSockets on Windows: WSAEOPNOTSUPP from bind()</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9183\">KTOR-9183</a> A\nclient call wrapped with <code>withTimeout</code> throws a generic\nCancellationException instead of TimeoutCancellationException</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8199\">KTOR-8199</a>\nAutoreloading: default watch patterns don''t match anything when project\npath contain spaces</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9549\">KTOR-9549</a>\nKotlin/JS: ktor-ktor-client-core.mjs is incompatible with Vite: toRaw\nnaming conflict</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9544\">KTOR-9544</a>\nApache: body channel not cancelled when caller scope is cancelled</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9546\">KTOR-9546</a>\nHttpClient: cancelling ByteReadChannel body does not propagate to\nengine</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-455\">KTOR-455</a>\nContent-Disposition additional parameters should be inside quotes</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9500\">KTOR-9500</a>\nRawSourceChannel returns false positive on awaitContent</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-646\">KTOR-646</a>\nNetty engine still print annoying exceptions</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9527\">KTOR-9527</a>\nCurl: Freeze when receiving large responses</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9460\">KTOR-9460</a>\nCurl: Can''t build shared library with Ktor 3.4.2</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9483\">KTOR-9483</a>\nCurl: backpressure implementation is never used</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- raw HTML omitted -->\n</blockquote>\n<p>... (truncated)</p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/commit/3ccad96fbb891469cdb5ff92b51a96bb6d6374c9\"><code>3ccad96</code></a>\nRelease 3.5.0 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/ktorio/ktor/issues/5612\">#5612</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/commit/decd09ffd35e23a2b3e4481f37b252000a8b7ec2\"><code>decd09f</code></a>\nUpdate report links (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/ktorio/ktor/issues/5616\">#5616</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/commit/ba5bbc5a7aafe0b909e9c40536153d02b7baa99c\"><code>ba5bbc5</code></a>\nRethrow cancellation in Digest.build (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/ktorio/ktor/issues/5618\">#5618</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/commit/165355954f7659ddd9c114381ea8eb592dee9cb7\"><code>1653559</code></a>\nUpdate kotlinx-serialization to v1.11.0</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/commit/eb593ac471b00f99c55090fb190a0ec5cdfa5115\"><code>eb593ac</code></a>\nUpdate kotlinx-coroutines to v1.11.0</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/commit/043d400e8140e1e2c46830463efb807f3669a313\"><code>043d400</code></a>\nUpdate dependency org.jetbrains.kotlinx:kotlinx-io-core to v0.9.0</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/commit/75a8324a98f38ca299ba8af7e4224a07cb78bc30\"><code>75a8324</code></a>\nUpdate dependency com.squareup.okio:okio to v3.17.0</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/commit/757c3da525695ae2e0b3f15b50145f50e57d08af\"><code>757c3da</code></a>\nUpdate dependency com.google.code.gson:gson to v2.14.0</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/commit/4b796859d1c189190d3fe964bf506d98356a5e0c\"><code>4b79685</code></a>\nUpdate dependency com.auth0:jwks-rsa to v0.24.0</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/commit/6fe542f9b102300921ce681afb48d38c5e3aac2d\"><code>6fe542f</code></a>\nUpdate tomcat.jakarta to v10.1.55</li>\n<li>Additional commits viewable in <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/compare/3.4.3...3.5.0\">compare\nview</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<br />\n\nUpdates `io.ktor:ktor-client-content-negotiation` from 3.4.3 to 3.5.0\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/releases\">io.ktor:ktor-client-content-negotiation''s\nreleases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>3.5.0</h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Published 14 May 2026</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8421\">KTOR-8421</a>\nRoute.contentType should support multiple ContentType</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-7961\">KTOR-7961</a> Add\nknown TDM headers to the HttpHeaders object</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9418\">KTOR-9418</a>\nSupport getAs from the root ApplicationConfig</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9559\">KTOR-9559</a> DNS\nconfiguration for the Apache5 client</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9554\">KTOR-9554</a> DNS\nconfiguration for OkHttp client engine</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9555\">KTOR-9555</a>\nCustom SSE heartbeat function</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8914\">KTOR-8914</a>\nDependency injection: read annotations in function references</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8300\">KTOR-8300</a>\nSessions: Add a way to create a user session shared for all user devices\nor look up sessions of the same user</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9521\">KTOR-9521</a>\nUpgrade to Kotlin 2.3.21</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9276\">KTOR-9276</a> Make\nDynamicProviderConfig.authenticateFunction suspend</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9491\">KTOR-9491</a>\nProvide parameter validation convenience functions</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9506\">KTOR-9506</a>\nOpenAPI: Support prefixItems in JsonSchema for tuple type\ndefinitions</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-470\">KTOR-470</a>\nAdd an option to not resend the session cookie if the session data\nwasn''t changed.</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9355\">KTOR-9355</a>\nDeprecate HttpHeaders.AcceptCharset</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-7659\">KTOR-7659</a> Make\nktor-network compatible with ES modules for nodejs</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9350\">KTOR-9350</a> JS:\nMake ES2015 the default target for tests</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-7578\">KTOR-7578</a>\nUpdate Digest authentication implementation according to RFC 7616</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Improvements</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9503\">KTOR-9503</a> The\nJacksonConverter.streamRequestBody property name is confusing</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9552\">KTOR-9552</a>\nDeprecation notice for io.ktor.server.auth.Principal does not explain\nwhat to use instead</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-7458\">KTOR-7458</a>\nJetty Jakarta: Provide an easy way to disable SNI hostname\nvalidation</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9354\">KTOR-9354</a>\nWebsockets: webSocket builder function should return a Route to be\ndescribable</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9488\">KTOR-9488</a>\nNonce and hex function performance optimizations</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Bugfixes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9524\">KTOR-9524</a>\nNetty response hangs after connection lost</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9542\">KTOR-9542</a>\nNetty: The request handler runs on worker event loop instead of call\nevent loop since 3.4.3</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9531\">KTOR-9531</a>\nNetty server intermittently drops requests after upgrading to 3.4.3</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8151\">KTOR-8151</a>\nMicrometerMetrics: &quot;MeterFilters configured after a Meter has been\nregistered&quot; warning when a metric is registered before installing\nthe plugin</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9411\">KTOR-9411</a>\nDarwin throws DarwinHttpRequestException instead of\nFrameTooBigException</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8320\">KTOR-8320</a>\nCallLogging: plugin usage in testApplication breaks console standard\noutput</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8906\">KTOR-8906</a>\nJackson, with request body streaming on, exhausts Dispatchers.IO</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8709\">KTOR-8709</a>\nWebsockets: Unable to close session with a custom CloseReason</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9567\">KTOR-9567</a>\nFlaky UnixSockets on Windows: WSAEOPNOTSUPP from bind()</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9183\">KTOR-9183</a> A\nclient call wrapped with <code>withTimeout</code> throws a generic\nCancellationException instead of TimeoutCancellationException</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8199\">KTOR-8199</a>\nAutoreloading: default watch patterns don''t match anything when project\npath contain spaces</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9549\">KTOR-9549</a>\nKotlin/JS: ktor-ktor-client-core.mjs is incompatible with Vite: toRaw\nnaming conflict</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9544\">KTOR-9544</a>\nApache: body channel not cancelled when caller scope is cancelled</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9546\">KTOR-9546</a>\nHttpClient: cancelling ByteReadChannel body does not propagate to\nengine</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-455\">KTOR-455</a>\nContent-Disposition additional parameters should be inside quotes</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9500\">KTOR-9500</a>\nRawSourceChannel returns false positive on awaitContent</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-646\">KTOR-646</a>\nNetty engine still print annoying exceptions</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9527\">KTOR-9527</a>\nCurl: Freeze when receiving large responses</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9460\">KTOR-9460</a>\nCurl: Can''t build shared library with Ktor 3.4.2</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9483\">KTOR-9483</a>\nCurl: backpressure implementation is never used</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- raw HTML omitted -->\n</blockquote>\n<p>... (truncated)</p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Changelog</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md\">io.ktor:ktor-client-content-negotiation''s\nchangelog</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h1>3.5.0</h1>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Published 14 May 2026</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8421\">KTOR-8421</a>\nRoute.contentType should support multiple ContentType</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-7961\">KTOR-7961</a> Add\nknown TDM headers to the HttpHeaders object</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9418\">KTOR-9418</a>\nSupport getAs from the root ApplicationConfig</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9559\">KTOR-9559</a> DNS\nconfiguration for the Apache5 client</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9554\">KTOR-9554</a> DNS\nconfiguration for OkHttp client engine</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9555\">KTOR-9555</a>\nCustom SSE heartbeat function</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8914\">KTOR-8914</a>\nDependency injection: read annotations in function references</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8300\">KTOR-8300</a>\nSessions: Add a way to create a user session shared for all user devices\nor look up sessions of the same user</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9521\">KTOR-9521</a>\nUpgrade to Kotlin 2.3.21</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9276\">KTOR-9276</a> Make\nDynamicProviderConfig.authenticateFunction suspend</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9491\">KTOR-9491</a>\nProvide parameter validation convenience functions</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9506\">KTOR-9506</a>\nOpenAPI: Support prefixItems in JsonSchema for tuple type\ndefinitions</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-470\">KTOR-470</a>\nAdd an option to not resend the session cookie if the session data\nwasn''t changed.</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9355\">KTOR-9355</a>\nDeprecate HttpHeaders.AcceptCharset</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-7659\">KTOR-7659</a> Make\nktor-network compatible with ES modules for nodejs</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9350\">KTOR-9350</a> JS:\nMake ES2015 the default target for tests</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-7578\">KTOR-7578</a>\nUpdate Digest authentication implementation according to RFC 7616</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Improvements</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9503\">KTOR-9503</a> The\nJacksonConverter.streamRequestBody property name is confusing</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9552\">KTOR-9552</a>\nDeprecation notice for io.ktor.server.auth.Principal does not explain\nwhat to use instead</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-7458\">KTOR-7458</a>\nJetty Jakarta: Provide an easy way to disable SNI hostname\nvalidation</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9354\">KTOR-9354</a>\nWebsockets: webSocket builder function should return a Route to be\ndescribable</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9488\">KTOR-9488</a>\nNonce and hex function performance optimizations</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Bugfixes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9524\">KTOR-9524</a>\nNetty response hangs after connection lost</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9542\">KTOR-9542</a>\nNetty: The request handler runs on worker event loop instead of call\nevent loop since 3.4.3</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9531\">KTOR-9531</a>\nNetty server intermittently drops requests after upgrading to 3.4.3</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8151\">KTOR-8151</a>\nMicrometerMetrics: &quot;MeterFilters configured after a Meter has been\nregistered&quot; warning when a metric is registered before installing\nthe plugin</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9411\">KTOR-9411</a>\nDarwin throws DarwinHttpRequestException instead of\nFrameTooBigException</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8320\">KTOR-8320</a>\nCallLogging: plugin usage in testApplication breaks console standard\noutput</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8906\">KTOR-8906</a>\nJackson, with request body streaming on, exhausts Dispatchers.IO</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8709\">KTOR-8709</a>\nWebsockets: Unable to close session with a custom CloseReason</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9567\">KTOR-9567</a>\nFlaky UnixSockets on Windows: WSAEOPNOTSUPP from bind()</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9183\">KTOR-9183</a> A\nclient call wrapped with <code>withTimeout</code> throws a generic\nCancellationException instead of TimeoutCancellationException</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8199\">KTOR-8199</a>\nAutoreloading: default watch patterns don''t match anything when project\npath contain spaces</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9549\">KTOR-9549</a>\nKotlin/JS: ktor-ktor-client-core.mjs is incompatible with Vite: toRaw\nnaming conflict</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9544\">KTOR-9544</a>\nApache: body channel not cancelled when caller scope is cancelled</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9546\">KTOR-9546</a>\nHttpClient: cancelling ByteReadChannel body does not propagate to\nengine</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-455\">KTOR-455</a>\nContent-Disposition additional parameters should be inside quotes</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9500\">KTOR-9500</a>\nRawSourceChannel returns false positive on awaitContent</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-646\">KTOR-646</a>\nNetty engine still print annoying exceptions</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9527\">KTOR-9527</a>\nCurl: Freeze when receiving large responses</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9460\">KTOR-9460</a>\nCurl: Can''t build shared library with Ktor 3.4.2</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9483\">KTOR-9483</a>\nCurl: backpressure implementation is never used</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- raw HTML omitted -->\n</blockquote>\n<p>... (truncated)</p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/commit/3ccad96fbb891469cdb5ff92b51a96bb6d6374c9\"><code>3ccad96</code></a>\nRelease 3.5.0 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/ktorio/ktor/issues/5612\">#5612</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/commit/decd09ffd35e23a2b3e4481f37b252000a8b7ec2\"><code>decd09f</code></a>\nUpdate report links (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/ktorio/ktor/issues/5616\">#5616</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/commit/ba5bbc5a7aafe0b909e9c40536153d02b7baa99c\"><code>ba5bbc5</code></a>\nRethrow cancellation in Digest.build (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/ktorio/ktor/issues/5618\">#5618</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/commit/165355954f7659ddd9c114381ea8eb592dee9cb7\"><code>1653559</code></a>\nUpdate kotlinx-serialization to v1.11.0</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/commit/eb593ac471b00f99c55090fb190a0ec5cdfa5115\"><code>eb593ac</code></a>\nUpdate kotlinx-coroutines to v1.11.0</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/commit/043d400e8140e1e2c46830463efb807f3669a313\"><code>043d400</code></a>\nUpdate dependency org.jetbrains.kotlinx:kotlinx-io-core to v0.9.0</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/commit/75a8324a98f38ca299ba8af7e4224a07cb78bc30\"><code>75a8324</code></a>\nUpdate dependency com.squareup.okio:okio to v3.17.0</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/commit/757c3da525695ae2e0b3f15b50145f50e57d08af\"><code>757c3da</code></a>\nUpdate dependency com.google.code.gson:gson to v2.14.0</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/commit/4b796859d1c189190d3fe964bf506d98356a5e0c\"><code>4b79685</code></a>\nUpdate dependency com.auth0:jwks-rsa to v0.24.0</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/commit/6fe542f9b102300921ce681afb48d38c5e3aac2d\"><code>6fe542f</code></a>\nUpdate tomcat.jakarta to v10.1.55</li>\n<li>Additional commits viewable in <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/compare/3.4.3...3.5.0\">compare\nview</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<br />\n\nUpdates `io.ktor:ktor-serialization-jackson` from 3.4.3 to 3.5.0\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/releases\">io.ktor:ktor-serialization-jackson''s\nreleases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>3.5.0</h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Published 14 May 2026</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8421\">KTOR-8421</a>\nRoute.contentType should support multiple ContentType</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-7961\">KTOR-7961</a> Add\nknown TDM headers to the HttpHeaders object</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9418\">KTOR-9418</a>\nSupport getAs from the root ApplicationConfig</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9559\">KTOR-9559</a> DNS\nconfiguration for the Apache5 client</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9554\">KTOR-9554</a> DNS\nconfiguration for OkHttp client engine</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9555\">KTOR-9555</a>\nCustom SSE heartbeat function</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8914\">KTOR-8914</a>\nDependency injection: read annotations in function references</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8300\">KTOR-8300</a>\nSessions: Add a way to create a user session shared for all user devices\nor look up sessions of the same user</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9521\">KTOR-9521</a>\nUpgrade to Kotlin 2.3.21</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9276\">KTOR-9276</a> Make\nDynamicProviderConfig.authenticateFunction suspend</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9491\">KTOR-9491</a>\nProvide parameter validation convenience functions</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9506\">KTOR-9506</a>\nOpenAPI: Support prefixItems in JsonSchema for tuple type\ndefinitions</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-470\">KTOR-470</a>\nAdd an option to not resend the session cookie if the session data\nwasn''t changed.</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9355\">KTOR-9355</a>\nDeprecate HttpHeaders.AcceptCharset</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-7659\">KTOR-7659</a> Make\nktor-network compatible with ES modules for nodejs</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9350\">KTOR-9350</a> JS:\nMake ES2015 the default target for tests</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-7578\">KTOR-7578</a>\nUpdate Digest authentication implementation according to RFC 7616</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Improvements</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9503\">KTOR-9503</a> The\nJacksonConverter.streamRequestBody property name is confusing</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9552\">KTOR-9552</a>\nDeprecation notice for io.ktor.server.auth.Principal does not explain\nwhat to use instead</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-7458\">KTOR-7458</a>\nJetty Jakarta: Provide an easy way to disable SNI hostname\nvalidation</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9354\">KTOR-9354</a>\nWebsockets: webSocket builder function should return a Route to be\ndescribable</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9488\">KTOR-9488</a>\nNonce and hex function performance optimizations</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Bugfixes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9524\">KTOR-9524</a>\nNetty response hangs after connection lost</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9542\">KTOR-9542</a>\nNetty: The request handler runs on worker event loop instead of call\nevent loop since 3.4.3</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9531\">KTOR-9531</a>\nNetty server intermittently drops requests after upgrading to 3.4.3</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8151\">KTOR-8151</a>\nMicrometerMetrics: &quot;MeterFilters configured after a Meter has been\nregistered&quot; warning when a metric is registered before installing\nthe plugin</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9411\">KTOR-9411</a>\nDarwin throws DarwinHttpRequestException instead of\nFrameTooBigException</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8320\">KTOR-8320</a>\nCallLogging: plugin usage in testApplication breaks console standard\noutput</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8906\">KTOR-8906</a>\nJackson, with request body streaming on, exhausts Dispatchers.IO</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8709\">KTOR-8709</a>\nWebsockets: Unable to close session with a custom CloseReason</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9567\">KTOR-9567</a>\nFlaky UnixSockets on Windows: WSAEOPNOTSUPP from bind()</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9183\">KTOR-9183</a> A\nclient call wrapped with <code>withTimeout</code> throws a generic\nCancellationException instead of TimeoutCancellationException</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8199\">KTOR-8199</a>\nAutoreloading: default watch patterns don''t match anything when project\npath contain spaces</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9549\">KTOR-9549</a>\nKotlin/JS: ktor-ktor-client-core.mjs is incompatible with Vite: toRaw\nnaming conflict</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9544\">KTOR-9544</a>\nApache: body channel not cancelled when caller scope is cancelled</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9546\">KTOR-9546</a>\nHttpClient: cancelling ByteReadChannel body does not propagate to\nengine</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-455\">KTOR-455</a>\nContent-Disposition additional parameters should be inside quotes</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9500\">KTOR-9500</a>\nRawSourceChannel returns false positive on awaitContent</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-646\">KTOR-646</a>\nNetty engine still print annoying exceptions</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9527\">KTOR-9527</a>\nCurl: Freeze when receiving large responses</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9460\">KTOR-9460</a>\nCurl: Can''t build shared library with Ktor 3.4.2</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9483\">KTOR-9483</a>\nCurl: backpressure implementation is never used</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- raw HTML omitted -->\n</blockquote>\n<p>... (truncated)</p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Changelog</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md\">io.ktor:ktor-serialization-jackson''s\nchangelog</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h1>3.5.0</h1>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Published 14 May 2026</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8421\">KTOR-8421</a>\nRoute.contentType should support multiple ContentType</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-7961\">KTOR-7961</a> Add\nknown TDM headers to the HttpHeaders object</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9418\">KTOR-9418</a>\nSupport getAs from the root ApplicationConfig</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9559\">KTOR-9559</a> DNS\nconfiguration for the Apache5 client</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9554\">KTOR-9554</a> DNS\nconfiguration for OkHttp client engine</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9555\">KTOR-9555</a>\nCustom SSE heartbeat function</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8914\">KTOR-8914</a>\nDependency injection: read annotations in function references</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8300\">KTOR-8300</a>\nSessions: Add a way to create a user session shared for all user devices\nor look up sessions of the same user</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9521\">KTOR-9521</a>\nUpgrade to Kotlin 2.3.21</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9276\">KTOR-9276</a> Make\nDynamicProviderConfig.authenticateFunction suspend</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9491\">KTOR-9491</a>\nProvide parameter validation convenience functions</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9506\">KTOR-9506</a>\nOpenAPI: Support prefixItems in JsonSchema for tuple type\ndefinitions</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-470\">KTOR-470</a>\nAdd an option to not resend the session cookie if the session data\nwasn''t changed.</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9355\">KTOR-9355</a>\nDeprecate HttpHeaders.AcceptCharset</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-7659\">KTOR-7659</a> Make\nktor-network compatible with ES modules for nodejs</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9350\">KTOR-9350</a> JS:\nMake ES2015 the default target for tests</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-7578\">KTOR-7578</a>\nUpdate Digest authentication implementation according to RFC 7616</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Improvements</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9503\">KTOR-9503</a> The\nJacksonConverter.streamRequestBody property name is confusing</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9552\">KTOR-9552</a>\nDeprecation notice for io.ktor.server.auth.Principal does not explain\nwhat to use instead</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-7458\">KTOR-7458</a>\nJetty Jakarta: Provide an easy way to disable SNI hostname\nvalidation</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9354\">KTOR-9354</a>\nWebsockets: webSocket builder function should return a Route to be\ndescribable</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9488\">KTOR-9488</a>\nNonce and hex function performance optimizations</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Bugfixes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9524\">KTOR-9524</a>\nNetty response hangs after connection lost</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9542\">KTOR-9542</a>\nNetty: The request handler runs on worker event loop instead of call\nevent loop since 3.4.3</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9531\">KTOR-9531</a>\nNetty server intermittently drops requests after upgrading to 3.4.3</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8151\">KTOR-8151</a>\nMicrometerMetrics: &quot;MeterFilters configured after a Meter has been\nregistered&quot; warning when a metric is registered before installing\nthe plugin</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9411\">KTOR-9411</a>\nDarwin throws DarwinHttpRequestException instead of\nFrameTooBigException</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8320\">KTOR-8320</a>\nCallLogging: plugin usage in testApplication breaks console standard\noutput</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8906\">KTOR-8906</a>\nJackson, with request body streaming on, exhausts Dispatchers.IO</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8709\">KTOR-8709</a>\nWebsockets: Unable to close session with a custom CloseReason</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9567\">KTOR-9567</a>\nFlaky UnixSockets on Windows: WSAEOPNOTSUPP from bind()</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9183\">KTOR-9183</a> A\nclient call wrapped with <code>withTimeout</code> throws a generic\nCancellationException instead of TimeoutCancellationException</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8199\">KTOR-8199</a>\nAutoreloading: default watch patterns don''t match anything when project\npath contain spaces</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9549\">KTOR-9549</a>\nKotlin/JS: ktor-ktor-client-core.mjs is incompatible with Vite: toRaw\nnaming conflict</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9544\">KTOR-9544</a>\nApache: body channel not cancelled when caller scope is cancelled</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9546\">KTOR-9546</a>\nHttpClient: cancelling ByteReadChannel body does not propagate to\nengine</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-455\">KTOR-455</a>\nContent-Disposition additional parameters should be inside quotes</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9500\">KTOR-9500</a>\nRawSourceChannel returns false positive on awaitContent</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-646\">KTOR-646</a>\nNetty engine still print annoying exceptions</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9527\">KTOR-9527</a>\nCurl: Freeze when receiving large responses</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9460\">KTOR-9460</a>\nCurl: Can''t build shared library with Ktor 3.4.2</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9483\">KTOR-9483</a>\nCurl: backpressure implementation is never used</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- raw HTML omitted -->\n</blockquote>\n<p>... (truncated)</p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/commit/3ccad96fbb891469cdb5ff92b51a96bb6d6374c9\"><code>3ccad96</code></a>\nRelease 3.5.0 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/ktorio/ktor/issues/5612\">#5612</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/commit/decd09ffd35e23a2b3e4481f37b252000a8b7ec2\"><code>decd09f</code></a>\nUpdate report links (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/ktorio/ktor/issues/5616\">#5616</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/commit/ba5bbc5a7aafe0b909e9c40536153d02b7baa99c\"><code>ba5bbc5</code></a>\nRethrow cancellation in Digest.build (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/ktorio/ktor/issues/5618\">#5618</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/commit/165355954f7659ddd9c114381ea8eb592dee9cb7\"><code>1653559</code></a>\nUpdate kotlinx-serialization to v1.11.0</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/commit/eb593ac471b00f99c55090fb190a0ec5cdfa5115\"><code>eb593ac</code></a>\nUpdate kotlinx-coroutines to v1.11.0</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/commit/043d400e8140e1e2c46830463efb807f3669a313\"><code>043d400</code></a>\nUpdate dependency org.jetbrains.kotlinx:kotlinx-io-core to v0.9.0</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/commit/75a8324a98f38ca299ba8af7e4224a07cb78bc30\"><code>75a8324</code></a>\nUpdate dependency com.squareup.okio:okio to v3.17.0</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/commit/757c3da525695ae2e0b3f15b50145f50e57d08af\"><code>757c3da</code></a>\nUpdate dependency com.google.code.gson:gson to v2.14.0</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/commit/4b796859d1c189190d3fe964bf506d98356a5e0c\"><code>4b79685</code></a>\nUpdate dependency com.auth0:jwks-rsa to v0.24.0</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/commit/6fe542f9b102300921ce681afb48d38c5e3aac2d\"><code>6fe542f</code></a>\nUpdate tomcat.jakarta to v10.1.55</li>\n<li>Additional commits viewable in <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/compare/3.4.3...3.5.0\">compare\nview</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<br />\n\nUpdates `io.ktor:ktor-server-auth` from 3.4.3 to 3.5.0\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/releases\">io.ktor:ktor-server-auth''s\nreleases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>3.5.0</h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Published 14 May 2026</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8421\">KTOR-8421</a>\nRoute.contentType should support multiple ContentType</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-7961\">KTOR-7961</a> Add\nknown TDM headers to the HttpHeaders object</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9418\">KTOR-9418</a>\nSupport getAs from the root ApplicationConfig</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9559\">KTOR-9559</a> DNS\nconfiguration for the Apache5 client</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9554\">KTOR-9554</a> DNS\nconfiguration for OkHttp client engine</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9555\">KTOR-9555</a>\nCustom SSE heartbeat function</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8914\">KTOR-8914</a>\nDependency injection: read annotations in function references</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8300\">KTOR-8300</a>\nSessions: Add a way to create a user session shared for all user devices\nor look up sessions of the same user</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9521\">KTOR-9521</a>\nUpgrade to Kotlin 2.3.21</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9276\">KTOR-9276</a> Make\nDynamicProviderConfig.authenticateFunction suspend</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9491\">KTOR-9491</a>\nProvide parameter validation convenience functions</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9506\">KTOR-9506</a>\nOpenAPI: Support prefixItems in JsonSchema for tuple type\ndefinitions</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-470\">KTOR-470</a>\nAdd an option to not resend the session cookie if the session data\nwasn''t changed.</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9355\">KTOR-9355</a>\nDeprecate HttpHeaders.AcceptCharset</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-7659\">KTOR-7659</a> Make\nktor-network compatible with ES modules for nodejs</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9350\">KTOR-9350</a> JS:\nMake ES2015 the default target for tests</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-7578\">KTOR-7578</a>\nUpdate Digest authentication implementation according to RFC 7616</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Improvements</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9503\">KTOR-9503</a> The\nJacksonConverter.streamRequestBody property name is confusing</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9552\">KTOR-9552</a>\nDeprecation notice for io.ktor.server.auth.Principal does not explain\nwhat to use instead</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-7458\">KTOR-7458</a>\nJetty Jakarta: Provide an easy way to disable SNI hostname\nvalidation</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9354\">KTOR-9354</a>\nWebsockets: webSocket builder function should return a Route to be\ndescribable</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9488\">KTOR-9488</a>\nNonce and hex function performance optimizations</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Bugfixes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9524\">KTOR-9524</a>\nNetty response hangs after connection lost</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9542\">KTOR-9542</a>\nNetty: The request handler runs on worker event loop instead of call\nevent loop since 3.4.3</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9531\">KTOR-9531</a>\nNetty server intermittently drops requests after upgrading to 3.4.3</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8151\">KTOR-8151</a>\nMicrometerMetrics: &quot;MeterFilters configured after a Meter has been\nregistered&quot; warning when a metric is registered before installing\nthe plugin</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9411\">KTOR-9411</a>\nDarwin throws DarwinHttpRequestException instead of\nFrameTooBigException</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8320\">KTOR-8320</a>\nCallLogging: plugin usage in testApplication breaks console standard\noutput</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8906\">KTOR-8906</a>\nJackson, with request body streaming on, exhausts Dispatchers.IO</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8709\">KTOR-8709</a>\nWebsockets: Unable to close session with a custom CloseReason</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9567\">KTOR-9567</a>\nFlaky UnixSockets on Windows: WSAEOPNOTSUPP from bind()</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9183\">KTOR-9183</a> A\nclient call wrapped with <code>withTimeout</code> throws a generic\nCancellationException instead of TimeoutCancellationException</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8199\">KTOR-8199</a>\nAutoreloading: default watch patterns don''t match anything when project\npath contain spaces</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9549\">KTOR-9549</a>\nKotlin/JS: ktor-ktor-client-core.mjs is incompatible with Vite: toRaw\nnaming conflict</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9544\">KTOR-9544</a>\nApache: body channel not cancelled when caller scope is cancelled</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9546\">KTOR-9546</a>\nHttpClient: cancelling ByteReadChannel body does not propagate to\nengine</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-455\">KTOR-455</a>\nContent-Disposition additional parameters should be inside quotes</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9500\">KTOR-9500</a>\nRawSourceChannel returns false positive on awaitContent</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-646\">KTOR-646</a>\nNetty engine still print annoying exceptions</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9527\">KTOR-9527</a>\nCurl: Freeze when receiving large responses</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9460\">KTOR-9460</a>\nCurl: Can''t build shared library with Ktor 3.4.2</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9483\">KTOR-9483</a>\nCurl: backpressure implementation is never used</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- raw HTML omitted -->\n</blockquote>\n<p>... (truncated)</p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Changelog</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md\">io.ktor:ktor-server-auth''s\nchangelog</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h1>3.5.0</h1>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Published 14 May 2026</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8421\">KTOR-8421</a>\nRoute.contentType should support multiple ContentType</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-7961\">KTOR-7961</a> Add\nknown TDM headers to the HttpHeaders object</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9418\">KTOR-9418</a>\nSupport getAs from the root ApplicationConfig</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9559\">KTOR-9559</a> DNS\nconfiguration for the Apache5 client</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9554\">KTOR-9554</a> DNS\nconfiguration for OkHttp client engine</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9555\">KTOR-9555</a>\nCustom SSE heartbeat function</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8914\">KTOR-8914</a>\nDependency injection: read annotations in function references</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8300\">KTOR-8300</a>\nSessions: Add a way to create a user session shared for all user devices\nor look up sessions of the same user</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9521\">KTOR-9521</a>\nUpgrade to Kotlin 2.3.21</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9276\">KTOR-9276</a> Make\nDynamicProviderConfig.authenticateFunction suspend</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9491\">KTOR-9491</a>\nProvide parameter validation convenience functions</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9506\">KTOR-9506</a>\nOpenAPI: Support prefixItems in JsonSchema for tuple type\ndefinitions</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-470\">KTOR-470</a>\nAdd an option to not resend the session cookie if the session data\nwasn''t changed.</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9355\">KTOR-9355</a>\nDeprecate HttpHeaders.AcceptCharset</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-7659\">KTOR-7659</a> Make\nktor-network compatible with ES modules for nodejs</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9350\">KTOR-9350</a> JS:\nMake ES2015 the default target for tests</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-7578\">KTOR-7578</a>\nUpdate Digest authentication implementation according to RFC 7616</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Improvements</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9503\">KTOR-9503</a> The\nJacksonConverter.streamRequestBody property name is confusing</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9552\">KTOR-9552</a>\nDeprecation notice for io.ktor.server.auth.Principal does not explain\nwhat to use instead</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-7458\">KTOR-7458</a>\nJetty Jakarta: Provide an easy way to disable SNI hostname\nvalidation</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9354\">KTOR-9354</a>\nWebsockets: webSocket builder function should return a Route to be\ndescribable</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9488\">KTOR-9488</a>\nNonce and hex function performance optimizations</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Bugfixes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9524\">KTOR-9524</a>\nNetty response hangs after connection lost</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9542\">KTOR-9542</a>\nNetty: The request handler runs on worker event loop instead of call\nevent loop since 3.4.3</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9531\">KTOR-9531</a>\nNetty server intermittently drops requests after upgrading to 3.4.3</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8151\">KTOR-8151</a>\nMicrometerMetrics: &quot;MeterFilters configured after a Meter has been\nregistered&quot; warning when a metric is registered before installing\nthe plugin</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9411\">KTOR-9411</a>\nDarwin throws DarwinHttpRequestException instead of\nFrameTooBigException</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8320\">KTOR-8320</a>\nCallLogging: plugin usage in testApplication breaks console standard\noutput</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8906\">KTOR-8906</a>\nJackson, with request body streaming on, exhausts Dispatchers.IO</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8709\">KTOR-8709</a>\nWebsockets: Unable to close session with a custom CloseReason</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9567\">KTOR-9567</a>\nFlaky UnixSockets on Windows: WSAEOPNOTSUPP from bind()</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9183\">KTOR-9183</a> A\nclient call wrapped with <code>withTimeout</code> throws a generic\nCancellationException instead of TimeoutCancellationException</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8199\">KTOR-8199</a>\nAutoreloading: default watch patterns don''t match anything when project\npath contain spaces</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9549\">KTOR-9549</a>\nKotlin/JS: ktor-ktor-client-core.mjs is incompatible with Vite: toRaw\nnaming conflict</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9544\">KTOR-9544</a>\nApache: body channel not cancelled when caller scope is cancelled</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9546\">KTOR-9546</a>\nHttpClient: cancelling ByteReadChannel body does not propagate to\nengine</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-455\">KTOR-455</a>\nContent-Disposition additional parameters should be inside quotes</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9500\">KTOR-9500</a>\nRawSourceChannel returns false positive on awaitContent</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-646\">KTOR-646</a>\nNetty engine still print annoying exceptions</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9527\">KTOR-9527</a>\nCurl: Freeze when receiving large responses</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9460\">KTOR-9460</a>\nCurl: Can''t build shared library with Ktor 3.4.2</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9483\">KTOR-9483</a>\nCurl: backpressure implementation is never used</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- raw HTML omitted -->\n</blockquote>\n<p>... (truncated)</p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/commit/3ccad96fbb891469cdb5ff92b51a96bb6d6374c9\"><code>3ccad96</code></a>\nRelease 3.5.0 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/ktorio/ktor/issues/5612\">#5612</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/commit/decd09ffd35e23a2b3e4481f37b252000a8b7ec2\"><code>decd09f</code></a>\nUpdate report links (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/ktorio/ktor/issues/5616\">#5616</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/commit/ba5bbc5a7aafe0b909e9c40536153d02b7baa99c\"><code>ba5bbc5</code></a>\nRethrow cancellation in Digest.build (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/ktorio/ktor/issues/5618\">#5618</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/commit/165355954f7659ddd9c114381ea8eb592dee9cb7\"><code>1653559</code></a>\nUpdate kotlinx-serialization to v1.11.0</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/commit/eb593ac471b00f99c55090fb190a0ec5cdfa5115\"><code>eb593ac</code></a>\nUpdate kotlinx-coroutines to v1.11.0</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/commit/043d400e8140e1e2c46830463efb807f3669a313\"><code>043d400</code></a>\nUpdate dependency org.jetbrains.kotlinx:kotlinx-io-core to v0.9.0</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/commit/75a8324a98f38ca299ba8af7e4224a07cb78bc30\"><code>75a8324</code></a>\nUpdate dependency com.squareup.okio:okio to v3.17.0</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/commit/757c3da525695ae2e0b3f15b50145f50e57d08af\"><code>757c3da</code></a>\nUpdate dependency com.google.code.gson:gson to v2.14.0</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/commit/4b796859d1c189190d3fe964bf506d98356a5e0c\"><code>4b79685</code></a>\nUpdate dependency com.auth0:jwks-rsa to v0.24.0</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/commit/6fe542f9b102300921ce681afb48d38c5e3aac2d\"><code>6fe542f</code></a>\nUpdate tomcat.jakarta to v10.1.55</li>\n<li>Additional commits viewable in <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/compare/3.4.3...3.5.0\">compare\nview</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<br />\n\nUpdates `io.ktor:ktor-server-auth-jwt` from 3.4.3 to 3.5.0\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ktorio/ktor/releases\">io.ktor:ktor-server-auth-jwt''s\nreleases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>3.5.0</h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Published 14 May 2026</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8421\">KTOR-8421</a>\nRoute.contentType should support multiple ContentType</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-7961\">KTOR-7961</a> Add\nknown TDM headers to the HttpHeaders object</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9418\">KTOR-9418</a>\nSupport getAs from the root ApplicationConfig</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9559\">KTOR-9559</a> DNS\nconfiguration for the Apache5 client</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9554\">KTOR-9554</a> DNS\nconfiguration for OkHttp client engine</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9555\">KTOR-9555</a>\nCustom SSE heartbeat function</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8914\">KTOR-8914</a>\nDependency injection: read annotations in function references</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8300\">KTOR-8300</a>\nSessions: Add a way to create a user session shared for all user devices\nor look up sessions of the same user</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9521\">KTOR-9521</a>\nUpgrade to Kotlin 2.3.21</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9276\">KTOR-9276</a> Make\nDynamicProviderConfig.authenticateFunction suspend</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9491\">KTOR-9491</a>\nProvide parameter validation convenience functions</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9506\">KTOR-9506</a>\nOpenAPI: Support prefixItems in JsonSchema for tuple type\ndefinitions</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-470\">KTOR-470</a>\nAdd an option to not resend the session cookie if the session data\nwasn''t changed.</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9355\">KTOR-9355</a>\nDeprecate HttpHeaders.AcceptCharset</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-7659\">KTOR-7659</a> Make\nktor-network compatible with ES modules for nodejs</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9350\">KTOR-9350</a> JS:\nMake ES2015 the default target for tests</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-7578\">KTOR-7578</a>\nUpdate Digest authentication implementation according to RFC 7616</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Improvements</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9503\">KTOR-9503</a> The\nJacksonConverter.streamRequestBody property name is confusing</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9552\">KTOR-9552</a>\nDeprecation notice for io.ktor.server.auth.Principal does not explain\nwhat to use instead</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-7458\">KTOR-7458</a>\nJetty Jakarta: Provide an easy way to disable SNI hostname\nvalidation</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9354\">KTOR-9354</a>\nWebsockets: webSocket builder function should return a Route to be\ndescribable</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9488\">KTOR-9488</a>\nNonce and hex function performance optimizations</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Bugfixes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9524\">KTOR-9524</a>\nNetty response hangs after connection lost</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9542\">KTOR-9542</a>\nNetty: The request handler runs on worker event loop instead of call\nevent loop since 3.4.3</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9531\">KTOR-9531</a>\nNetty server intermittently drops requests after upgrading to 3.4.3</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8151\">KTOR-8151</a>\nMicrometerMetrics: &quot;MeterFilters configured after a Meter has been\nregistered&quot; warning when a metric is registered before installing\nthe plugin</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9411\">KTOR-9411</a>\nDarwin throws DarwinHttpRequestException instead of\nFrameTooBigException</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8320\">KTOR-8320</a>\nCallLogging: plugin usage in testApplication breaks console standard\noutput</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8906\">KTOR-8906</a>\nJackson, with request body streaming on, exhausts Dispatchers.IO</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-8709\">KTOR-8709</a>\nWebsockets: Unable to close session with a custom CloseReason</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTOR-9567\">KTOR-9567</a>\nFlaky UnixSockets on Windows: WSAEOPNOTSUPP from bind()</li