n":"bjorn-faaberg","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMTQ2MDEx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bjorn-faaberg/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bjorn-faaberg/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bjorn-faaberg/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bjorn-faaberg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bjorn-faaberg/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bjorn-faaberg","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/navikt/esyfovarsel/commits/e9f39031fb5bcffda73c3170f166f9f41d3b0721/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-11T06:50:15Z","email":"bjorn.faaberg@nav.no","name":"Bjørn Faaberg"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-11T06:50:15Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(db): lagre hendelse-json for feilede varsler (#968)\n\n## Endringer\n\nLegger til nullable hendelse_json TEXT-kolonne i UTSENDING_VARSEL_FEILET\nslik at vi kan ta vare på den serialiserte Kafka-hendelsen ved feil, og\nhar all data tilgjengelig ved resend-forsøk.\n\n### Hva er gjort\n- Ny Flyway-migrering (V42) som legger til kolonnen\n- Oppdatert domain-klasse, DAO (insert) og ResultSet-mapper\n- Test som verifiserer round-trip\n\n### Neste steg\n- Oppdatere SenderFacade til å faktisk serialisere hendelsen ved feil\n- Støtte resend av ArbeidsgiverNotifikasjonTilAltinnRessursHendelse i\nResendFailedVarslerJob\n\nCloses #967\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"8466c9eb082ef570a01fd87e6ac079e70c68ddef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/navikt/esyfovarsel/git/trees/8466c9eb082ef570a01fd87e6ac079e70c68ddef"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/navikt/esyfovarsel/git/commits/e9f39031fb5bcffda73c3170f166f9f41d3b0721","verification":{"payload":"tree 8466c9eb082ef570a01fd87e6ac079e70c68ddef\nparent ebf71ceee29b4e5f58ec34ec2fbd6576d2ceb6f7\nauthor Bjørn Faaberg <bjorn.faaberg@nav.no> 1778482215 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1778482215 +0000\n\nfeat(db): lagre hendelse-json for feilede varsler (#968)\n\n## Endringer\n\nLegger til nullable hendelse_json TEXT-kolonne i UTSENDING_VARSEL_FEILET\nslik at vi kan ta vare på den serialiserte Kafka-hendelsen ved feil, og\nhar all data tilgjengelig ved resend-forsøk.\n\n### Hva er gjort\n- Ny Flyway-migrering (V42) som legger til kolonnen\n- Oppdatert domain-klasse, DAO (insert) og ResultSet-mapper\n- Test som verifiserer round-trip\n\n### Neste steg\n- Oppdatere SenderFacade til å faktisk serialisere hendelsen ved feil\n- Støtte resend av ArbeidsgiverNotifikasjonTilAltinnRessursHendelse i\nResendFailedVarslerJob\n\nCloses #967\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqAXw3CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA5fcQAAOdMFpwHHTGAmKnQGbgSw9o\nejtrwaU3RrvcGB5ImyBNEEmym3/XrXwahqIqK0Mr8fxHKl7ad6ja2GcSOKx6YznM\n2YCgquovz0JzjyBUii8BisRGMqwcmwDpWJLqnmuc+As36RS4Lqu7SuH1HIVuzlXm\nOLjEgoRqat0TsPUgWhjSy0pdWgCxtF6rgvIafAsYclTBZSU6f5RaXL7/raUymjOL\n1G4UBNUzy3VC3ZRrevEoxJEqBDSmvzdG+61AlMEWW5h/scOjk2JE/E+G5lbGUKc+\n5G7I3t0E2W/L58/m2Aw2zQmfqp4mI/vz/Vqraf5ZLJ1k+2Dwxi9nHxjtDOFx1vy0\nAEuJ8RWaX6YZlMYDRHN5fJ3Ddwb3uTk7i6PsVM567foi1dahjbAbCLTsz+kWYcNZ\ntsw5jspKMdJPSvRBYixttv2NHZJLN3Ngmvjjhg7VQDFZH+FwJEPpDBheUDZS99hP\nuBOJC2AYIOXRnmY0WdbnE6wWy9Lm1OT1hv6/16E/MQSTDKmEj4MGv8rTQWs4dD/+\nkc5rwBvpZNp0p19ZkOKk1KV6JUR2vHeBD/P7H1ayVyAb0OyGV9icF3L0RljKKFF1\nnI8ad11SOw/wZhtMpEthpX+ptVu1H3DFKTd5/WxIcFPIRRxf/eMOPI67lnESRfxg\n+65JKRQyPSB+DQtVtbHB\n=M+3Q\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-11T06:50:32Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/fol