E-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-21T09:47:06Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/jcr-account-creation-notification/commit/f1e8cfaac3cffde5664c55ef65bf6bae55a5ef1c","node_id":"C_kwDOEkKlytoAKGYxZThjZmFhYzNjZmZkZTU2NjRjNTVlZjY1YmY2YmFlNTVhNWVmMWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/jcr-account-creation-notification/commit/93dd14730bbf80de4b9c3fb6837dfd310116ad7f","sha":"93dd14730bbf80de4b9c3fb6837dfd310116ad7f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jcr-account-creation-notification/commits/93dd14730bbf80de4b9c3fb6837dfd310116ad7f"}],"sha":"f1e8cfaac3cffde5664c55ef65bf6bae55a5ef1c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jcr-account-creation-notification/commits/f1e8cfaac3cffde5664c55ef65bf6bae55a5ef1c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jcr-account-creation-notification/commits/93dd14730bbf80de4b9c3fb6837dfd310116ad7f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-21T07:29:44Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSÉ"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-21T07:29:44Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"refactor: nest GraphQL operations under a jcrAccountCreationNotification namespace container (#16)\n\nMove the root Query (jcrAccountCreationNotificationSettings) + root Mutation\n(jcrAccountCreationNotificationSaveSettings) flat fields under one hierarchical namespace\ncontainer, per the Jahia GraphQL convention.\n\n- Query:    jcrAccountCreationNotificationSettings     -> jcrAccountCreationNotification { settings }\n- Mutation: jcrAccountCreationNotificationSaveSettings -> jcrAccountCreationNotification { saveSettings }\n\nNew holder types JcrAccountCreationNotificationQuery/Mutation carry the operations as\ninstance @GraphQLField methods (the GqlSettings return type moves into the query holder);\nthe *Extension classes keep a single jcrAccountCreationNotification accessor field.\n@GraphQLRequiresPermission stays on each leaf. Frontend gql.js + jsx + jest test, and\nCypress fixtures/specs updated in lockstep. Core JCR createUser/deleteUser fixtures untouched.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"e61b82c572de6b4f2012aa46d16af8a748323df9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jcr-account-creation-notification/git/trees/e61b82c572de6b4f2012aa46d16af8a748323df9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jcr-account-creation-notification/git/commits/93dd14730bbf80de4b9c3fb6837dfd310116ad7f","verification":{"payload":"tree e61b82c572de6b4f2012aa46d16af8a748323df9\nparent 865962ab35c44d52bf0f9e968b04598a938fffa8\nauthor Florent BOURASSÉ <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1782026984 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782026984 +0200\n\nrefactor: nest GraphQL operations under a jcrAccountCreationNotification namespace container (#16)\n\nMove the root Query (jcrAccountCreationNotificationSettings) + root Mutation\n(jcrAccountCreationNotificationSaveSettings) flat fields under one hierarchical namespace\ncontainer, per the Jahia GraphQL convention.\n\n- Query:    jcrAccountCreationNotificationSettings     -> jcrAccountCreationNotification { settings }\n- Mutation: jcrAccountCreationNotificationSaveSettings -> jcrAccountCreationNotification { saveSettings }\n\nNew holder types JcrAccountCreationNotificationQuery/Mutation carry the operations as\ninstance @GraphQLField methods (the GqlSettings return type moves into the query holder);\nthe *Extension classes keep a single jcrAccountCreationNotification accessor field.\n@GraphQLRequiresPermission stays on each leaf. Frontend gql.js + jsx + jest test, and\nCypress fixtures/specs updated in lockstep. Core JCR createUser/deleteUser fixtures untouched.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqN5LoCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAmkcQAHwtoWxKJLiG59Lt9aVS9FEL\nes+I7dx9Nhpw1Uau+CRgPfjlR76rMhKapszLcZL76VOoV4hrFQxDLVJVTP+bsjAM\n1rXCC9iftZem+VQh9K4z+PMTCI1qe52Xdg0eqGGngDJ1VDSisoj2wB9bo9yjsrAl\nQmyBJ+ey0oDGA9Eb0kqEBId6heb9V92YpnVo+lGTzSywdXqktdye/MVV32skanqk\n9tB4lQ2hCDnlF2kesnE/A