"2026-06-07T07:03:41Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-07T07:03:41Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"message":"fix: consume richtext-ckeditor5 remote as richtextCkeditor5\n\nThe richtext-ckeditor5 module renamed its Module Federation container\nglobal from appShell.remotes.ckeditor5 to appShell.remotes.richtextCkeditor5\n(beta-3+ / 1.0.1). The stale ''ckeditor5'' mapping resolved to undefined at\nruntime, so the CKEditor remote was skipped, the admin route never\nregistered, and the settings panel rendered blank — failing all admin-UI\nCypress specs. Align the remote name with the current richtext-ckeditor5.\n\nValidated: admin-UI E2E now fully green (root-login 16/16, jcr-account 15/15).\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"4a5a4fd6797ff9be5e4fcce1aef8c345865b2603","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jcr-account-creation-notification/git/trees/4a5a4fd6797ff9be5e4fcce1aef8c345865b2603"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jcr-account-creation-notification/git/commits/b0bb6f30c76909e4d8a1f350b08a5ee5e37536a3","verification":{"payload":"tree 4a5a4fd6797ff9be5e4fcce1aef8c345865b2603\nparent bc07fffeddb283d9b66de2b5933b5fd2fc6a01b5\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1780815821 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1780815821 +0200\n\nfix: consume richtext-ckeditor5 remote as richtextCkeditor5\n\nThe richtext-ckeditor5 module renamed its Module Federation container\nglobal from appShell.remotes.ckeditor5 to appShell.remotes.richtextCkeditor5\n(beta-3+ / 1.0.1). The stale ''ckeditor5'' mapping resolved to undefined at\nruntime, so the CKEditor remote was skipped, the admin route never\nregistered, and the settings panel rendered blank — failing all admin-UI\nCypress specs. Align the remote name with the current richtext-ckeditor5.\n\nValidated: admin-UI E2E now fully green (root-login 16/16, jcr-account 15/15).\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9UhsGUDwSL3kFAmolF80ACgkQUhsGUDwS\nL3katAgAtRYC5qTIXXEF2bYSE8gj5hwP63mrDzD+L4mIo7UBWYzlkcD4yhr7V0wR\nZkx+SjiSFsTT6WgWNBTEApeQJcMOWk0cwwa3dUAgKwF0HSDkwb9n5XjxjCWNO4Pa\nSGvWKMKIAbpQPghuTR8uJqTMsSwSU+fo0q3uJ/qBoODmG9P+GAGf9ULM7W59Wcer\nNPDWqp0JEm9HREULeTnJD9NUlSoAnQg6XLyl7qlgFfV/K0cEKkucdVDPYq1wLPm9\nJjR4yPfyQ8WLT10akDNw+MbDDlo7VD9/pzU8pGVL13lt/kAw36aHKWYYn2gNKc/+\nIlo0G1qV8K7fWKrndZCaiy4KimAOxA==\n=j//T\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-07T13:37:51Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/jcr-account-creation-notification/commit/b0bb6f30c76909e4d8a1f350b08a5ee5e37536a3","node_id":"C_kwDOEkKlytoAKGIwYmI2ZjMwYzc2OTA5ZTRkOGExZjM1MGIwOGE1ZWU1ZTM3NTM2YTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/jcr-account-creation-notification/commit/bc07fffeddb283d9b66de2b5933b5fd2fc6a01b5","sha":"bc07fffeddb283d9b66de2b5933b5fd2fc6a01b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jcr-account-creation-notification/commits/bc07fffeddb283d9b66de2b5933b5fd2fc6a01b5"}],"sha":"b0bb6f30c76909e4d8a1f350b08a5ee5e37536a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jcr-account-creation-notification/commits/b0bb6f30c76909e4d8a1f350b08a5ee5e37536a3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jcr-account-creation-notification/commits/bc07fffeddb283d9b66de2b5933b5fd2fc6a01b5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T12:42:26Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T12:42:26Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"message":"fix: log clear WARN in onEvent when listener registration failed on activate\n\nIf @Activate caught a RepositoryException, observationSession remains null and\nthe listener is permanently broken. Add an early-exit guard in onEvent that\nemits a WARN so operators know events are silently dropped instead of receiving\nno signal at all.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"6788e0e8169d68458c9fcc9c0695e43fb656a352","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jcr-account-creation-notification/git/trees/6788e0e8169d68458c9fcc9c0695e43fb656a352"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jcr-account-creation-notification/git/commits/bc07fffeddb283d9b66de2b5933b5fd2fc6a01b5","verification":{"payload":"tree 6788e0e8169d68458c9fcc9c0695e43fb656a352\nparent d97fd72c1ef72d3f1c24be06c310aa91164e70f9\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1780749746 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1780749746 +0200\n\nfix: log clear WARN in onEvent when listener registration failed on activate\n\nIf @Activate caught a RepositoryException, observationSession remains null and\nthe listener is permanently broken. Add an early-exit guard in onEvent that\nemits a WARN so operators know events are silently dropped instead of receiving\nno signal at all.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9UhsGUDwSL3kFAmokFbIACgkQUhsGUDwS\nL3nz9gf/WKo+4u7mYpD0UUJCyUv12W2Sw6tpM540gDnsZltIhb/AfMxxdBc3/14M\nGE2H9Tq8rTAbwPtgofrXsDB/h/x3rnUIK1J+msX6ajD16xH3cn3ozQWz8NyVmiwA\nl4MfQDO5XBhY9fWGVtOTBpbnjESqG/7USapH3d3/mjC/UUqfA3YffpBQPaBI2T+A\n9k/Wc0B6TGI4EdJh1J32z3aimcUsNC0yeQjxSnNIReBKMaF8clZBY/CS+a8SMyHv\nGILdZYVAsero38o68xTBCPaD0aCaQ1w1aqHTf3snGUC3jhnQKtX68zBosiLMK5AG\nCO2mSSvK8SWDrDT2089juPHPRX07qg==\n=3mwU\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-07T13:37:51Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbou